  <para style="h">Eksọdọs</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eksọdọs</para>
  <para style="toc2">Eksọdọs</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eksọ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Eksọdọs</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ekuut Nditọ Isrel</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />Mme anyịñ nditọ Isrel e-ekekeeneke Yekọb eka isọñ Iyib edo ami, kwa awo kwa ubon amọ:<verse eid="EXO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Rubịn, Simiọn, Lifai ye Yuda,<verse eid="EXO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />Isaka, Sebulọn ye Benyamin,<verse eid="EXO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />Daan ye Naftali; Kad ye Asaa.<verse eid="EXO 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Afịd nditọ Yekọb ekedo awo ata mme duob; Yosef mmọdo akebaba ke Iyib.<verse eid="EXO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Akema Yosef ye afịd nditọete amọ ideen ye afịd emana ado emaekpañña, <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />ado nditọ Isrel emaetọt eti-eti; ammọ emaetara, enyʌñ etọt ke ibad enyʌñ ewak tutu afịd isọñ akeyọhọ ye ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Akem ufa adidem, a-Yosef imiikidooho ñkpọ ndomokeed inọ anye inyʌññọ ikidiọọñọ se Yosef akenam anọ Iyib, amaadida ukara ke Iyib. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Anye amaabo ikọd amọ ate, “Nditọ Isrel e-edinekke ewak ikan ñnyịn. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Ana ñnyịn idu uwem ke mbufiọk ye ammọ, imiidooho ntoro, ammọ eyaewawak ekan ado, ndin adieke ekọñ atịppeke, ammọ eyaeda ye mme asua ñnyịn enwana ye ñnyịn, enyʌñ ewuọọñọ ekpọñ idịd ñnyịn.”<verse eid="EXO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Ke ntak ado ammọ emaenịm mme etubom ifʌn enọ ammọ, adifiik ammọ ke unyenyịk utom; ndin ammọ emaebọp itie unịm ñkpọ ke Pitọm ye Ramese nte mme abio ubonoñkpọ enọ Fero. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Ado naña nte ekefefiik ammọ, ntoro ke ammọ ekekaiso etọt enyʌñ etara, ndin mbon Iyib emaekappa ebaak nditọ Isrel, <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />enyʌñ ekaa iso enọ ammọ utom ibak-ibak. <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />Ammọ emaenam uwem adooro nditọ Isrel ke ntak akpọsọñ utom adiwuak mbad mbot ntək itiad ubọbufọk ye nsio-nsio utom ke mme inwañ. Ke afịd akpọsọñ utom ado, nditọ Iyib ikinieghe mbọm ibaña ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Adidem Iyib amaadọkkọ mbiauman nditọ Hibru, e-ekekereke Sifra ye Pua abo, <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />“Ndufo imaimʌm ibaan Hibru uman ke itie umʌmuman, ekpekịt ke nsekayịn awodeen ke ado, iwot anye, ado akpedo ayịn awonwaan, iyaak anye adu uwem.” <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Ado, mbiauman nditọ Hibru emaebaak Abasi, ndin ikinamma se adidem Iyib akebo ammọ enam. Ke ntoro ammọ emaeyaak nditọ ideen edu uwem. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Ndin adidem Iyib amaadọñ ekoot mbiauman ado, anyʌñ abịp ammọ abo, “Nsoo inam yak ndufo enam ntom? Nsoo inam ndufo eyaak nditọ ideen edu uwem?”<verse eid="EXO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Mbiauman ado emaebọọrọ Fero ete, “Ibaan Hibru ibaaha nte ibaan Iyib; ammọ ekop adudu ke idem, enyʌñ esiman nditọ mbemiso mbiauman ediwuọwuọ.”<verse eid="EXO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" />Ke ntoro Abasi amaafọn ido ye mbiauman ado, ndin nditọ Isrel emaetọt enyʌñ enekke ewak ekan naña ekedodo. <verse eid="EXO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />Abasi amaanọ mbiauman ado ubon ammọ, sia ammọ emaebaak Abasi.<verse eid="EXO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Ke ntom Fero amaanọ afịd ikọd amọ uyio ate: “Ana ndufo etoomo afịd nsek nditọ ideen Hibru e-emanna edọñ ke Inyañ Nail, ado eyaak afịd nsek nditọ ibaan edu uwem.”<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Emana Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Awodeen esiin Lifai amaadọ awonwaan Lifai, <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />ndin anye amaayommo anyʌñ aman ayịn awodeen. Eka ayịn ado akekịt naña ayịn amọ ayaiya, anye amaadịp anye ke ufañ afiọñ ita. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Ado ke anye imiikikanna idịp ayịn ado aba, anye amaaben anye asịn ke akpasa ñnyanyaha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ubom, nte ke Yenesis 6:14</char></note> e-ekeyette itai ye bitumen, anyʌñ aben anye akenịm ke atu ñnyanyaha ke mben Inyañ Nail. <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Ndin ayịneka amọ awonwaan amaakeda nsan-nsan ase se idiitịppe inọ ayịn ado.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Akema ayịn awonwaan Fero amaasọiyọ akaa Inyañ Nail adikiyie idem, ndin nditọufọk amọ emaesaña ke mben inyañ. Anye amaakịt akpasa ado ke atu ñnyanyaha anyʌñ adọñ afʌn awonwaan amọ akeben anye isọk imọ. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Ke anye amaakekʌppọ akịt nsekayịn ado naña atua, mbọm amaanam anye. Ndin anye amaabo, “Anyem ado keed ke atu nsek nditọ Hibru.”<verse eid="EXO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Ndin ayịneka amọ awonwaan amaabịp ayịn Fero ate, “Ami mmekeme ikikoot keed ke atu ibaan Hibru nọ adido adeb unọ fiin?”<verse eid="EXO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Adiaha Fero amaanyịmme ate, “Ii, kaa.” Ndin, ayịneka amọ awonwaan amaakaa akekoot eka ayịn ado adi. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Ndin ayịn Fero amaabo anye, “Ben nsekayịn ami kekama nnọ miin, ndin ami ñyaukpe fiin akʌk.” Ke ntoro, mma ado amaaben ayịn ado akekama. <verse eid="EXO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />Ayịn ado amaakekpon, eka amọ amaaben anye asọk ayịn Fero, ndin anye amaakappa ado ayịn amọ. Adiaha Fero amaasio anye anyịñ, Moses,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Moses atie nte usem Hibru a-adooho adidʌt nsio</char></note> abo, “Ami ñkedʌt anye nsio ke mmọọñ.”<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moses Afeghe Akaa Midian</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Usen keed, ke Moses amaakekpon, anye amaawuọ akeda ase itie a-mbon ammọ ekebaaha enam akpọsọñ utom. Ndin anye amaakịt naña awo Iyib amia awo Hibru, keed ke atu ubon amọ. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Ke anye amaakese umi, ase uko, nọ imiikịtte awo, anye amaawot awo Iyib ado anyʌñ adịp anye ke ntan abuuk. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Anye akewuọ edem usen, amaakekịt naña nditọ Hibru iba enwaana. Moses amaadọkkọ andikidue ate, “Nsoo ido nọ afo amia emọ-emọ ayịn Hibru ndufo?”<verse eid="EXO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Awodeen ado amaabo Moses, “Anie ikumek fiin andikara ye abiideikpe inọọ ñnyịn? Afo ayem adiñwot miin naña akewot awo Iyib?” Ndin ndịk amaanam Moses, anye amaanyʌñ akere abo, “Ana ado mme awo e-ediọọñọ se ami ñkenam.”<verse eid="EXO 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />Ke Fero amaakekop abaña ñkpọ ami, anye amaayem adiwot Moses, ado Moses amaafeghe akpọñ Fero akedʌñ ke Midian, anyʌñ aketie akpere ube mmọọñ. <verse eid="EXO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Amaaba aku ke Midian a-akenieghe nditọ ibaan itiaba, ndin ammọ emaedi edibọ mmọọñ ndọñ ke akwa se ufene ete ammọ enwọñ. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Mme akpemeedọñ emaedibiiñe ammọ, ado Moses amaakenyaaña ammọ anyʌñ anọ udịmenañ ammọ mmọọñ.<verse eid="EXO 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />Ke ini ubọikpa ami emaeketịmme inyọñọ ibịne ete ammọ Ruel, anye amaabịp ammọ abo, “Nsoo inam nọ ndufo ebak ntom enyọñọ edi mfịn?”<verse eid="EXO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ ebo, “Awo Iyib keed akinyaaña ñnyịn asio ke ubọk mme akpemeedọñ. Kpa anye akekoi mmọọñ inọọ, anyʌñ anọ udịmenañ mmọọñ enwọñ.”<verse eid="EXO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Ruel amaabịp nditọ amọ abo, “Ndin anye aba ke mmọọ? Nsoo ikinam nọ ndufo edakka ekpọñ anye? Ikoot anye idi nọ adidia ñkpọ.”<verse eid="EXO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Moses amaanyịmme adidʌñ ye Ruel, ndin anye amaanọ anye Sipora, ayịn amọ awonwaan ke ndọ. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Sipora amaaman ayịn awodeen, ndin Moses amaasio anye anyịñ Kesọm,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesọm atie nte usem Hibru a-adooho asenawo do</char></note> sia anye akebo, “Ami mmekappa ndo asenawo ke asenidịd.”<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Ke afịd anyan ini ado, adidem Iyib amaadikpa. Ndin nditọ Isrel emaemịm mmịm ke idak ufʌn ammọ, enyʌñ etua, ndin ayịd a-ammọ eketuaha eyem unwam amaadọọk akesịm Abasi idem. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Abasi amaakop mmịm ammọ anyʌñ atoiyo enwọñọ amọ ye Ebraham, ye Aisik ye Yekọb. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Ndin Abasi amaasuuk anyen ase nditọ Isrel, anyʌñ akere ñkpọ abaña ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Moses ye Ikọd A-asakka Ikañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />Ke ini Moses akesʌkkọ abọọk ufene Yetro, ete anwaan amọ, a-akedooho aku ke Midian, anye amaakoono ufene akesịm edem ukañ anaan tutu akewuọ Họreb, abod Abasi. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Do ke enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeyaara idem awọt anye ke edemeikañ ke esịd ikọd. Moses amaakịt ke akpesʌkado i-ikañ akesakka ke ikọd, ikañ ikitaaha ikọd. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Ndin Moses amaakere ke esịd amọ abo, “Ami ñyaasaña ñkese utọ ñkpọ ñkpaidem ami, ntak i-ikañ imiitaaha ikọd.”<verse eid="EXO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />Ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakekịt ke anye amaakanna akaa adise, Abasi amaakoot anye ke ufọọd esịd ikọd, “Moses! Moses!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 3:4">Moses amaabọọrọ, “Se miin mi.”<verse eid="EXO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />Abasi amaabo anye, “Kuusaña ukpere ukan ado! Sịññe ikpaukod ke ukod mfo, sia itie a-afo adaaha do ado adisana isọñ.” <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />Ndin Abasi amaabo, “Ami ndo Abasi ete mfo, Abasi Ebraham, Abasi Aisik ye Abasi Yekọb.” Moses akekop ami, anye amaadịp iso amọ, sia anye amaakop ndịk adise Abasi.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Ke akpanikọ, ami mmekịt ukuud ikọd mmi ke Iyib. Ami mmekop ntuaña ye eseeme ammọ ke ubọk mme etubom ifʌn ammọ; mbọm anyʌñ annam miin abaña ufen a-ammọ ebọọhọ. <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />Ke ntoro ami mmesọiyọ ndi adinyaaña ammọ nsio ke ubọk mbon Iyib, ñnyʌñ mben ammọ nsio ke isọñ ado ñkesịn ke eti isọñ a-anwañake, isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk, isọñidʌñ mbon Kenan, mbon Hed, Amọọ, mbon Peris, Hif ye mbon Yebus. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Idahami, ntuaña nditọ Isrel adinsịm miin, ñko ami mmekịt naña mbon Iyib efiik ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Kaa idahami. Ami udọñ fiin utom nnọ Fero mbo akeben ikọd mmi Isrel asio ke isọñ Iyib.”<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Ado Moses amaabo Abasi ate, “Ami ndo anie adika mbịne Fero ñnyʌñ ñkesịññe nditọ Isrel ke Iyib?”<verse eid="EXO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Ndin Abasi amaabo anye, “Ami ñyaaba ye afo. Ndin se idiido idiọọñọ unọ fiin ke ado ami udọñ fiin ado mi: Afo umauben ikọd mmi usio ke Iyib, ndufo eyaekpono Abasi ke ekamba abod ami.”<verse eid="EXO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Moses amaabịp Abasi abo, “Akpedo ami ñkaa ñkedọkkọ nditọ Isrel mbo, ‘Abasi mme eteete ndufo andọñ miin utom inọọ ndufo,’ ndin ammọ embịp miin ebo, ‘Nsoo ido anyịñ amọ?’ Nsoo ke ami ndiibọọrọ ammọ?”<verse eid="EXO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Abasi amaabo Moses, “<char style="nd">Ami Ndo Se Ami Ndo</char>. Se afo uduudọkkọ nditọ Isrel ado ami: ‘<char style="nd">Ami Ndodo</char> andọñ miin inọọ ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Abasi amaanyʌñ abo Moses, “Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ndufo, Abasi Ebraham, Abasi Aisik ye Abasi Yekọb, andọñ miin inọọ ndufo.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 3:15">“Anyịñ mmi ado ami ke nsi-nsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 3:15">anyịñ se ndufo ediñkoot miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 3:15">ke afịd emana.<verse eid="EXO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />“Kaa, kekoot ñkpisọñ ke Isrel bok itie keed nyʌñ bo ammọ, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ndufo, Abasi Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb, amaayaara idem añwọt miin anyʌñ abo: Ami mmikpeme ndufo mmenyʌñ ñkịt se inam ndufo ke Iyib. <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Ndin ami mmenwọñọ adiben ndufo nsio ke ukuud ke Iyib ñkesịn ke isọñ mbon Kenan, mbon Hed, mbon Amọọ, mbon Peris, mbon Hif ye mbon Yebus, isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk.’<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />“Mme ñkpisọñ ke Isrel eyaekpañ utọñ unọ fiin. Ndin ana afo ye ñkpisọñ Isrel eka ekebo adidem Iyib, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi nditọ Hibru, amaasoobo ye ñnyịn. Yak ñnyịn inam isañ usen ita ika anaan nọ ikiwa uwa inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn.’ <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Ado ami mmediọọñọ ke adidem Iyib idiiyakka ndufo enyọñọ ibọhọke ke akpọsọñ ubọk anyịk anye. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Ke ntoro ami ñyaasio ubọk mmi ñnyan ñnyʌñ ñkpọkkọ nditọ Iyib ye afịd utịppeñkpọ se ami ndiinam ke atu ammọ. Ado amaaboiyo, anye ayaayaak ndufo enyọñọ.<verse eid="EXO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />“Ndin ami ñyaanam mbon Iyib ewọt nditọ Isrel mfọn, mbaak ndufo idinyọñọ ubọk ñkaña. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Afịd se ido awonwaan anie adibeeñe mbọhọidʌñ amọ ye awonwaan se idʌñ ke ufọk amọ ñkpọ silfa ye kold ye mme afọñ, se ediisịn nditọ ndufo ideen ye ibaan. Ntom ke ndufo ediibịme inie nditọ Iyib.”<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Abasi Anọ Moses Mme Idiọọñọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Moses amaabọọrọ ate, “Akpedo anam ammọ inịmme se ami ntañ, inyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ innọ miin, ndin ebo, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikiyaarake idem uwọt fiin-e’?”<verse eid="EXO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />Ndin Abọọñ amaabịp anye ate, “Nsoo ke afo akama ado ke ubọk mfo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:2">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Esañ.”<verse eid="EXO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye, “Top anye nịm ke isọñ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:3">Moses amaatop esañ anịm ke isọñ, ndin esañ ado amaakappa udʌkikọd, ndin Moses amaafeghe. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye, “Sio ubọk mfo nyan, nyʌñ mʌm udʌkikọd ado ke isịm.” Ndin Moses amaasio ubọk anyan aben udʌkikọd ado, ndin anye amaamaana akappa esañ ke ubọk amọ. <verse eid="EXO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Ami ado nọ ammọ enịm ke ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme ete ammọ, Abasi Ebraham, Abasi Aisik ye Abasi Yekọb, a-ayaara idem uwọt fiin.”<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Sin ubọk mfo ke esịd ewịra mfo.” Anye amaanyʌñ asịn ubọk amọ ke esịd ewịra amọ, ndin anye akesio ubọk adi, ikpọkidem ammọ amaakappa akpamfia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru, akpamfia akeda anọ nsio-nsio udọñọ a-ataaha awo ke ikpaidem.</char></note> akappa asana nte sino.<verse eid="EXO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Anye amaabo “Maana sịn ubọk mfo ke ewịra mfo.” Ndin Moses amaamaana asịn ubọk ke ewịra amọ, ndin akesio, ubọk amọ amaamaana aba naña akeba, ukem nte ikpaidem amọ.<verse eid="EXO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye ate, “Adieke ammọ imuunịmme fiin ke akpanikọ, imiinyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ inọ akpa idiọọñọ, akpena ammọ enịm ayọhọ iba. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Ado adieke ammọ imiinịmme mme idiọọñọ iba ami imiinyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ unọ fiin, dat mmọọñ ke Inyañ Nail duọk ke nsaad isọñ. Mmọọñ a-afo adatta ato inyañ ayaakappa ado iyiib ke amaaduọkkọ ke isọñ.”<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Moses amaabo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> dakka do nọ awo mfo. Tọọñọ anaanam ami ndooho awo ndọọn ikọ, me ke usen edem me tọọñọ afo akeneme nneme ye awo mfo. Ami nsibabat ikọ ntañ.”<verse eid="EXO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabịp anye, “Anie akenọọ ubonawo inua ammọ? Anie anam ammọ edo inan me imuum? Anie anam ammọ ekịt usʌñ me anam ammọ edo nnan? Nte idooho ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>? <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />Ndin kaa, sia ami ñyaunwam fiin aditañ ikọ ñnyʌñ utemme fiin se uduutañ.”<verse eid="EXO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Ado Moses amaabo, “Abọọñ, mbọk dakka do nọ awo mfo. Mbọk dọñ awo mfen.”<verse eid="EXO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Ndin iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabịmme abịne Moses, anye amaanyʌñ abo, “Ayịneka mfo Erọn, a-adooho awo Lifai-a? Ami mmediọọñọ ke anye a-anọ itañ ikọ mfọn-mfọn. Anye asʌk adi ke usʌñ adidusoobo fiin, anye ayaanyʌñ anem esịd adukịt fiin. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />Afo ayaatañ ikọ anọ anye, anyʌñ asịn anye ikọ ke inua. Ndin ami ñyainwam ndufo awo iba etañ ikọ, ñnyʌñ ikpeep ndufo se ediinam. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />Anye ayaatañ ikọ anọ mbon awo ke iwuod mfo, ndin adiiba nte anye ado inua mfo anyʌñ aba nte afo ado Abasi anọ anye. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />Ado ben esañ ami kama ke ubọk mfo nọ afo akan adat anye anam mme utom idiọọñọ.”<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moses Atịmme Akaa Iyib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Akema Moses amaatịmme akaa abịne Yetro, ete anwaan amọ, anyʌñ akebo anye ate, “Yak ami ntịmme mbịne mbon mmi ke Iyib, nọ ñkese me awo ammọ ndomokeed mmọdo asʌk aba ke uwem.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:18">Yetro amaabo anye, “Kaa, tʌm saña.”<verse eid="EXO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ke Midian ate, “Tịmme kaa Iyib, sia afịd mbon se ikiyem aduwot fiin ekpañña.” <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Ndin Moses amaaben anwaan amọ ye nditọ amọ ideen, adot ke dọñki anyʌñ atịmme akaa Iyib. Anye amaaben esañ Abasi akama ke ubọk. <verse eid="EXO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Afo umautịmme unyọñ Iyib, kịt bo ke amenam afịd utịppeñkpọ se ami unọọ fiin adudu adinam ke iso Fero. Ado ami ñyaasọñ anye esịd mbaak anye adiyaak ikọd mmi enyọñọ. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />Ndin bo Fero ate, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Isrel ado akpan mmi, <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />ndin ami mmaubo fiin, “Yaak ayịn mmi awodeen anyọñ, nọ anye akeñkpono miin.” Ado sia afo amaasịn adiyaak anye anyọñ, ami ñyaawot akpan usen mfo.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasoobo ye Moses ke itie nduọkadudu a-anye akenaaha adaiya ke usʌñisañ amọ, ndin anyʌñ ayem adiwot anye. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Ado Sipora amaaben ikwa, akpịkke ayịn amọ edʌd anyʌñ atuuk ñkpad Moses. Anye amaabo Moses ate, “Ke akpanikọ afo ado ebendọ ke iyiib annọ miin.” <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasaana anye ayaak. (Ke ini anye akebooho “ebendọ ke iyiib,” anye aketañ abaña adifọọrọ edəd).<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Erọn, “Kaa ke soobo ye Moses ke anaan.” Ndin anye amaakesoobo ye Moses ke abod Abasi anyʌñ atʌm anye inua. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Moses amaanyʌñ adọkkọ Erọn afịd ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo anye atañ, ye afịd mme idiọọñọ se anye akenọọ Moses uyio abo anam.<verse eid="EXO 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Moses ye Erọn emaekoot afịd ñkpisọñ Isrel ebon itie keed, <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />ndin Erọn amaanyʌñ adọkkọ ammọ afịd ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ anọ Moses. Moses amaanyʌñ anam mme idiọọñọ ke iso mbon awo, <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />ndin nditọ Isrel emaenịm ke akpanikọ. Ke ini ammọ ekekoppo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-akere ñkpọ abaña ammọ anyʌñ akịt ukuud ammọ, ammọ emaetuak iwuod ekpono Abasi.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Itiadubọbufọk A-ñnyanyaha Imiisịneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Ke ado amaakeboiyo, Moses ye Erọn emaekaa ekebo Fero ete, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel atañ ado ami, ‘Yaak ikọd mmi enyọñọ, nọ ammọ ekenam usọrọ ke anaan ennọ miin.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Fero amaabo ate, “Anie ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nọ ami ñkpekop uyio amọ ñnyʌñ ñyaak Isrel enyọñọ? Ami ndiọọñọke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ami, ndin ndiiyaaha Isrel enyọñọ.”<verse eid="EXO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Akema ammọ emaebo, “Abasi nditọ Hibru amaasoobo ye ñnyịn. Yak ñnyịn inam isañ usen ita ika anaan ikiwa uwa inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, imiidooho ntoro anye akeme aditọ ñnyịn udọñọ ñkpa me adisobo ñnyịn ke akañkañ.”<verse eid="EXO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Ado adidem Iyib amaabọọrọ, “Moses ye Erọn, nsoo ido nọ ndufo eyem ediben mme awo ñkpọñ utom ammọ? Itịmme ikaa ikinam utom ndufo!” <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Akema Fero amaabo, “Se, mbon se iba ke abio e-ewak eti-eti idahami, ndin ndufo iyakka nọ ammọ enam utom.”<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Ke usen ado Fero amaanọ mme etubom akpeme ifʌn ye mme aseutom uyio ate: <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />“Ndufo inaaha enọ ibon ami ñnyanyaha ukama mbot itiad ubọbufọk aba; yak ammọ eka ekeyem ñnyanyaha ke idem ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Ado bo nọ ammọ ebot ukem ibad itiad ubọbufọk naña akesido; ikiisio ibad. Ammọ edoñño ifu; ado anam nọ ammọ ebọñọ ñkpo ebo, ‘Yak ñnyịn ika ikiwa uwa inọ Abasi ñnyịn.’ <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Nam utom ammọ anekke akpon nọ ammọ eka iso enam utom, ikiinyʌñ ikpañ utọñ inọọ nsu.”<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Ndin mme etubom akpeme ifʌn ye mme aseutom emaekaa ekebo nditọ Isrel ete, “Fero abo ntom: ‘Ami ndiinọọhọ ndufo ñnyanyaha aba. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Ikaa ikiyem ñnyanyaha ndufo ke itie keed akeedodo a-ndufo ediikan ikịt, ado awo idiisioho ibad utom ndufo ndomokeed.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Ndin ammọ emaesuana edọñọ ke afịd isọñ Iyib edikikoono ikpitok abakpa ñnyʌñ ñkama nnam utom ke itie ñnyanyaha. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Mme etubom akpeme ifʌn emaenenekke eyịre ammọ ebo, “Inam iso utom ndufo mfịn ima, naña ekenam ke ini e-ekenieghe ñnyanyaha.” <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Ndin mme aseñkpọ mbaña ifʌn Fero emaetiim mme aseutom nditọ Isrel a-ammọ ekemekke, enyʌñ ebịp ebo, “Nsoo inam nọ ndufo idiikanna ikọọk ibad itiad naña ekinọọ ndufo ñkpọñ a-akeboiyoke ye mfịn, naña ekesinam?”<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Ndin mme aseñkpọ mbaña nditọ Isrel emaekaa ekeseeme enọ Fero ebo: “Nsoo inam nọ afo akama nditọufọk mfo ntom? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />Awo inọọhọ nditọufọk mfo ñnyanyaha aba, ado ibo ñnyịn, ‘Inam itiad ubọbufọk!’ E-emia nditọufọk mfo, ado ndudue ato ikọd mfo.”<verse eid="EXO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Fero amaabo, “Ifu, ndufo edoñño ifu! Ado anam nọ ndufo ekaiso ebo, ‘Yak ñnyịn ika ikiwa uwa inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Ikaa ikinam utom idahami. Awo idiinọọhọ ndufo ñnyanyaha ndomokeed, ado ana ndufo esʌk esio afịd udomo ibad itiad ubọbufọk ndufo.”<verse eid="EXO 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Mme aseñkpọ mbaña nditọ Isrel emaekịt ke mmimọ iba ke mfịna, sia ekedọkkọke ammọ ebo, “Inaaha ndufo esuuhọ udomo ibad itiad ubọbufọk se ebo ndufo ebot kwa usen.” <verse eid="EXO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Ke ini ammọ emaekekpọñ Fero, ammọ emaekịt Moses ye Erọn naña esọñeda adisoobo ye ammọ, <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />ndin ammọ emaebo, “Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ise ndufo anyʌñ akpe ikpe inọ ndufo! Ndufo emenam ñnyịn ido ñkpọ ndek inọ Fero ye ikpọ mbon utom amọ, emenyʌñ esịn ammọ akañkañ ke ubọk nọ iwot ñnyịn.”<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abasi Anwọñọ Adinọ Ñkpọkñyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Moses amaatịmme abịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo anye ate, “Ntaha, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ntak a-afo abenne mfịna asọk ibon ami-e? Ntak a-afo akendọññọ miin ado ami? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />Tọọñọ ami ñkeka ñketañ ikọ ye Fero ke anyịñ mfo, anye a-aben mfịna anọ ibon ami, afo unyʌññọ unyaaña ikọd mfo ba keed.”<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Afo ayaakịt se ami ndiinam ye Fero: Ke ntak akpọsọñ ubọk mmi anye ayaayaak ammọ enyọñọ. Ke ntak akpọsọñ ubọk mmi anye ayaabiiñe ammọ asịññe ke idịd amọ.”<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Abasi amaanyʌñ abo Moses ate, “Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />Ami mmaawọt Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb idem nte Abasi Andikponñkan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Abasi Andikponñkan ado El-Sadai</char></note>, ado ami ñkenamma nọ ammọ ediọọñọ anyịñ mmi nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ </char>,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se esịd ikọ ke Eksọdọs 3:15</char></note> ñko ami ñkeyaarake idem mmi ayọhọ-ayọhọ nnọ ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />Ami mmaanịm edioomo mmi ye ammọ ke adinọ ammọ isọñ Kenan, a-ammọ ekedʌññọ nte mme adidʌñ. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Akanna ado, ami mmekop mmịm nditọ Isrel, a-mbon Iyib efʌnnọke, ami mmetoiyo edioomo mmi ñko.<verse eid="EXO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />“Ke ntoro, dọkkọ nditọ Isrel: ‘Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin ami ñyaisio ndufo ke akpọnọ mbon Iyib. Ami ñyaifak ndufo nsio ke ufʌn ammọ, ndin ñyainyaaña ndufo ke akpọsọñ ubọk mmi ñnyʌñ nnọ ammọ ekamba ufen. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Ami ñyaidat ndufo nte ikọd mmi, ami ñyaado Abasi ndufo. Ndin ndufo eyaediọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-akisioho ndufo afep ke akpọnọ nditọ Iyib. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Ñko ami ñyaiben ndufo ñkaa isọñ a-ami ñkedịppeke ubọk mmi ñnwọñọ nnọ Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb. Ami ñyainọ ndufo nte inie. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Moses amaaben mme ikọ ami akedọkkọ nditọ Isrel, ado ammọ ikikpañña utọñ inọ anye ato ntak unana idodanyen ye mfiomo ye ufen-ufen utom.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />“Kaa kedọkkọ Fero adidem Iyib ate ayaak nditọ Isrel ewuọñọ ekpọñ idid amọ.”<verse eid="EXO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Ado Moses amaabo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate, “Adieke nditọ Isrel imiikpañña utọñ innọ miin, Fero adiinam die ikpañ utọñ innọ miin, sia ami ndo ekek?”<verse eid="EXO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñwed Ubon Moses ye Erọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatañ ikọ anọ Moses ye Erọn abaña nditọ Isrel ye Fero adidem Iyib; anye amaanyʌñ anọ ammọ uyio ate enam nditọ Isrel ekpọñ isọñ Iyib.<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Mme adaiwuod ke mme ubon ammọ ekedo ami.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 6:14" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 6:14">Nditọ ideen Rubịn, akpan Isrel ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 6:14">Hanọk ye Palu, Hesrọn ye Kaami.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="EXO 6:14">Mme aduuk Rubịn ekedo ado.<verse eid="EXO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Nditọ ideen Simiọn ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 6:15">Yemuel, Yamịn, Ohad, Yakịn, Soha ye Sọọl, awonwaan Kenan akemanna.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="EXO 6:15">Mme aduuk Simiọn ekedo ado.<verse eid="EXO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Mbon ami ekedo nditọ ideen Lifai akeene ñwed ndutʌm:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 6:16">Kesọn, Kohad ye Merari. (Lifai akedu uwem isua ikie mme edịb mme duob mme itiaba).<verse eid="EXO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Nditọ ideen Kesọn, ke aduuk ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="EXO 6:17">Libni ye Simei.<verse eid="EXO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />Nditọ ideen Kohad ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="EXO 6:18">Amram, Isaa Hibrọn ye Usiel.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 6:18">(Kohad akedu uwem isua ikie mme edịb mme duob mme ita.)<verse eid="EXO 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />Nditọ ideen Merari ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="EXO 6:19">Mahli ye Musi.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="EXO 6:19">Mbon ami ekedo mme aduuk Lifai naña ewet ke ñwed.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Amram akedọ ayịneka ete amọ awonwaan Yokebed, a-akemanna Erọn ye Moses anọ anye.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="EXO 6:20">(Amram akedu uwem isua ikie mme edịb mme duob mme itiaba).<verse eid="EXO 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Nditọ ideen Isaa ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 6:21">Kora, Nefek ye Sikri.<verse eid="EXO 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Nditọ ideen Usiel ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 6:22">Miseel, Elsafan ye Sitri.<verse eid="EXO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Erọn akedọ Eliseba, ayịn Aminadab ye ayịneka awonwaan Nasọn, ndin anye amaaman Nadab, Abihu, Eliasa ye Itama anọ anye.<verse eid="EXO 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Nditọ ideen Kora ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 6:24">Asiaa, Elkana ye Abiasaf.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="EXO 6:24">Mme aduuk Kora ekedo ami.<verse eid="EXO 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Eliasa, ayịn Erọn amaadọ ayịn Putiel keed, ndin anye amaaman Finehas anọ anye.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 6:25" />
  <para style="li4" vid="EXO 6:25">Mme adaiwuod ke ubon mme Lifai, ke aduuk ke aduuk edo ado.<verse eid="EXO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Erọn ye Moses ami ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo, “Iben ikọd mmi Isrel isio ke Iyib ke ikpeghe ke ikpeghe ammọ.” <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Kpasʌk Moses ye Erọn ekedo mbon e-eketañña ikọ enọ Fero adidem Iyib ebaña adiben nditọ Isrel nsio ke isọñ Iyib.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erọn Atañ Ikọ ke Iwuod Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />Ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña ikọ anọ Moses ke Iyib, <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />anye amaabo Moses ate, “Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Dọkkọ Fero adidem Iyib afịd se ami ndiitañ unọ fiin.”<verse eid="EXO 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Ado Moses amaabo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate, “Sia ami ndoho ekek, Fero adiinam die ikpañ utọñ innọ miin?”<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Ami mmunam fiin aba nte Abasi anọ Fero, ndin ayịneka mfo Erọn ayaado prọfed mfo. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />Ana afo atañ afịdñkpọ se ami unọọ uyio mbo atañ, ndin ayịneka mfo Erọn ana adọkkọ Fero abo ayaak nditọ Isrel ekpọñ idịd amọ. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />Ado ami ñyaasọñ Fero esịd, ndin akpesʌkado a-ami ndiinam mme idiọọñọ ye utịppeñkpọ mmi ewak ke Iyib, <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />Fero idiikpañña utọñ unọ fiin. Ndin ami ñyaadot ubọk mmi ke Iyib, ñyaanyʌñ ñkama mme ñkpoon ufen ndʌt ikpeghe ubon mmi nsio, ikọd mmi, mbon Isrel. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />Nditọ Iyib eyaediọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ini ami mmaanyan ubọk mmi ndot ke Iyib ñnyʌñ mben nditọ Isrel nsio do.”<verse eid="EXO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Moses ye Erọn emaenam kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ ammọ uyio. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Moses akedo isua anaañ, ndin Erọn ado isua anaañ mme ita ke ini ammọ eketañña ikọ enọ Fero.<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esañ Erọn Akappa Udʌkikọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses ye Erọn ate, <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />“Fero amaibo ndufo, ‘Inam utịppeñkpọ,’ afo bo Erọn ate, ‘Ben esañ mfo top nịm ke isọñ ke iso Fero,’ ndin ayaakappa udʌkikọd.”<verse eid="EXO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Ndin Moses ye Erọn emaekaa ebịne Fero enyʌñ ekenam kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme ammọ. Erọn amaatop esañ amọ anịm ke isọñ ke isọ Fero ye mme ñkpisọñ mbon utom amọ, ndin esañ amaakappa udʌkikọd. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Fero amaanyʌñ adọñ ekoot mbon aniọñ ye mbon useñkpọ, ndin mbon mmayịk Iyib emaenyʌñ enañña ukem ñkpọ ado ato ndịbe idiọñ ammọ: <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />Ammọ keedekeed emaetop esañ ammọ enịm ke isọñ, ndin emaekappa udʌkikọd. Ado esañ Erọn amaakoono esañ ammọ amen. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Kpa ye ado esịd Fero akesʌk asọsọñ, ndin anye ikiikpañña utọñ inọ ammọ, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udọñọ Nsobo Iyiib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Esịd Fero asʌk asọsọñ; anye a-asịn adiyaak nditọ Isrel enyọñọ. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Kaa bịne Fero ubakusen ke ini anye awuọhọ aka inyañ. Soobo anye ke mben Inyañ Nail, nyʌñ ben esañ a-akekappake udʌkikọd do kama ke ubọk mfo. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />Ndin dọkkọ anye bo, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi nditọ Hibru, andọñ miin abo ndudọkkọ fiin: Yaak ikọd mmi enyọñọ, nọ ammọ ekeñkpono miin ke anaan. Ado tutu ami afo ukpañña utọñ. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Ayaato ke ami afo ayaadiọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ami ñyaakama esañ a-asịneke ke ubọk mmi ñyʌppọ mmọọñ Nail, ndin anye ayaakappa iyiib. <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />Mme iyak ke mmọọñ Nail eyaekpañña, inyañ ado ayaanyʌñ atebe; mbon Iyib idiikanna inwọñ mmọọñ amọ aba.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Dọkkọ Erọn, ‘Ben esañ mfo nyʌñ sio ubọk mfo nyan ke mmọọñ isọñ Iyib, ke anyọñ mme idịm ye mme akpaubom, ke anyọñ mme ibiok ye afịd udiọhọ mmọọñ ndin ammọ eyaekappa iyiib.’ Iyiib ayaayọhọ afịd itie ke isọñ Iyib, kpa ke mme ekamba udọññkpọ ake eto ye itiad.”<verse eid="EXO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Moses ye Erọn emaenam kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ ammọ uyio. Anye amaadịppe esañ amọ ke iso Fero, ye mme ñkpisọñ mbon utom amọ, anyʌñ amia mmọọñ Nail, ndin afịd mmọọñ amaakappa ado iyiib. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Iyak ke Nail emaekpañña, ñko mmọọñ ado amaatebe adiọọk tutu nditọ Iyib ikikanna inwọñ anye aba. Iyiib amaayọhọ afịd itie ke Iyib.<verse eid="EXO 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Ado mbon unam mmayịk ke Iyib emaekama idiọñ ammọ enyʌñ enam mme ukem ñkpọ ado, ndin esịd Fero amaasọñ; anam anye ikikamma ikpañ utọñ nọọ Moses ye Erọn, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Utu ke ado, Fero amaakanna iso anyọñ ufọkubọọñ amọ, inyʌññọ isesịn akikere amọ do. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Ndin afịd mbon Iyib emaedọk isọñ ekanna Inyañ Nail eyem mmọọñ se enwọñ, sia ammọ ikikanna inwọñ mmọọñ a-aketooho inyañ ado.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udọñọ Nsobo Mfuọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Usen itiaba emaeboiyo tọọñọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam mmọọñ Nail akappa iyiib.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="nb">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed mbon Hibru ewet Eksọdọs 8:1-4 nte Eksọdọs 7:26-29, ndin Eksọdọs 8:5-32 ewet nte Eksọdọs 8:1-28. </char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Kaa ke bo Fero ntom, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ami: Yak ikọd mmi enyọñọ, nọ ammọ ekeñkpono miin. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />Adieke afo umuuyakka ammọ enyọñọ, ami ñyaakama nsobo mfuọd mmia afịd idịd mfo ufen. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Inyañ Nail adiiyọhọ ye mfuọd. Ammọ eyaedọñọ edi ufọkubọọñ ye ubeed nnaa ye ikʌk mfo, tutu akesịm ufọk mme ñkpisọñ mfo ye afịd mbon mfo, dian ye mme ediok mfo ye mme itiad ukọkñkpọ. <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Mme mfuọd eyaedọọk ubịne fiin ye mme ñkpisọñ mfo.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Dọkkọ Erọn, ‘Sio ubọk mfo nyan ye esañ ke anyọñ mme idịm, mme akpaubom ye mme ibiok, nyʌñ nam mme mfuọd ewuọñọ ediyọhọ isọñ Iyib.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Ndin Erọn amaanyan ubọk amọ ke anyọñ mme mmọọñ Iyib, ndin mme mfuọd emaewuọñọ edifʌk isọñ. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Ado mbon unam mmayịk emaenyʌñ enam kpa ukem ñkpọ ado ke ndedịbe idiọñ ammọ; ammọ emaenam mme mfuọd ewuọñọ ediyọhọ isọñ Iyib.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Fero amaadọñ ekoot Moses ye Erọn adibo ammọ ate, “Ibọñ akam inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nọ aben mfuọd akpọñ ikọd mmi, ndin ami ñyaayaak mbon ndufo enyọñọ ekewa uwa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="EXO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Moses amaabo Fero ate, “Ke ukpono mfo, ami ñkpaama afo anịm ini a-afo akpemaaha ami mbọñ akam unọ fiin, mme ñkpisọñ mfo, ikọd mfo, ye mme ufọk mfo nọ mfuọd enyọñọ, ibọhọke mbon se isʌhọ ke Inyañ Nail.”<verse eid="EXO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Fero amaabo “Yak ado ñkpọñ.” Ndin Moses amaabọọrọ abo, “Adiido naña afo abo, nọ afo adiọọñọ ke ibaaha awo a-abaaha nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Mfuọd eyaukpọñ fiin ye ufọk mfo, mme ñkpisọñ mfo ye ikọd mfo; ammọ ediisʌhọ ke Nail kpọd.”<verse eid="EXO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Ke Moses ye Erọn emaekekpọñ Fero, Moses amaaseeme akoot <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke abaña mfuọd a-anye akedọññọ anọ Fero. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam se Moses akebeeñe. Mfuọd emaekpañña ke ufọk, ke esịd akwere ye ke mme inwañ. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Emaekoono ammọ ekʌp ke ebono ke ebono, ndin utebe ammọ amaakara abio. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Ado Fero amaakekịt ke imibọ emem, anye amaamaana asọñ esịd, inyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ inọ Moses ye Erọn, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udọñọ Nsobo Ndañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Dọkkọ Erọn, ‘Sio esañ mfo nyan nyʌñ yʌppọ ntọñ ke isọñ,’ ndin ayaakappa ndañ ke afịd isọñ Iyib.” <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Ammọ emaenam ntoro, ndin ke ini Erọn amaakesio ubọk ye esañ ayʌppọ ntọñ isọñ, ndañ amaafʌk mme awo ye unam. Afịd ntọñ ke isọñ Iyib amaakappa ndañ. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Mbon unam mmayịk emaedomo adinam ndañ ke ido idiọñ ammọ, ado ikikanna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 8:18">Sia ndañ amaakeyọhọ awo ye unam idem ke afịd itie,<verse eid="EXO 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />mbon unam mmayịk emaebo Fero ete, “Anye ami ado nnuunubọk Abasi.” Ado Fero akesʌk asọsọñ esịd, inyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ inọ Moses ye Erọn, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udọñọ Nsobo Nsʌñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Bak dakka da ubakusen kaa ke soobo Fero idaha a-anye akaaha mben inyañ, nyʌñ bo anye ntom, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Yak ikọd mmi enyọñọ, nọ ammọ ekeñkpono miin. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />Adieke afo umuuyakka ikọd mmi enyọñọ, ami ñyaadọñ uwak-uwak udịm nsʌñ unọ fiin, mme ikpọ mbon utom mfo, ikọd mfo ye afịd ufọk mfo. Mme ufọk nditọ Iyib eyaeyọhọ ye nsʌñ; tutu nsʌñ afʌk afịd isọñ.<verse eid="EXO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />“ ‘Ado ke usen ado ami ñyaasio isọñ Kosen mfep, itie i-ikọd mmi edʌñọke, mme udịm nsʌñ idiibaaha do, nọ afo adiọọñọ ke ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mmọdo mba ke isọñ ami. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Ami ñyaabakka ikọd mmi ñkpọñ ikọd mfo. Idiọọñọ ami ayaatịppe ñkpọñ.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaanam ntoro. Uwak-uwak udịm nsʌñ emaeduọññọ edọñọ akwere Fero ye ufọk mme ñkpisọñ amọ, enyʌñ ebiat afịd isọñ Iyib.<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Ndin Fero amaadọñ ekoot Moses ye Erọn, anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Ikaa, ikinam uwa inọ Abasi ndufo mi ke isọñ ami.” <verse eid="EXO 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Ado Moses amaabọọrọ, “Idiinenne adinam ntoro. Mme uwa a-ñnyịn iwaaha inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn ediiba nte mbubiam ke iso mbon Iyib. Nte ammọ idiitọọñọ ñnyịn ke itiad, adieke ñnyịn iwaha uwa a-abaaha nte mbubiam ke anyen ammọ? <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Ana ñnyịn inam isañ usen ita, ika ke anaan ikinam uwa inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, naña anye inọ ñnyịn uyio.”<verse eid="EXO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Fero amaabo, “Ami ñyaayaak ndufo eka ekewa uwa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke anaan, ado inaaha ndufo edọọk eka nọ anekke anyọọñ usʌñ. Ñko, ibọñ akam innọ miin.”<verse eid="EXO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Moses amaabọọrọ, “Ami mmaasʌk ukpọkpọñ fiin, ñyaabọñ akam nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin nsʌñ eyaekpọñ Fero, mme ñkpisọñ amọ ye mbon amọ ñkpọñ. Ado yak Fero akịt abo ke imọ idiinamma ñkpọ ñkara-ñkara aba ke anye aditre adiyaak nditọ Isrel eka ekewa uwa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="EXO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Ndin Moses amaakpọñ Fero, akaa akebọñ akam anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñko amaanyʌñ anam se Moses akebeeñe. Mme nsʌñ emaekpọñ Fero, ye mme ñkpisọñ amọ ye ikọd amọ; nsʌñ ndomokeed ikisʌhọke aba. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" />Ado ini ami ñko Fero amaamaana asọñ esịd, inyʌññọ iyak nditọ Isrel enyọñọ.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Udọñọ Nsobo Ke Mme Ufene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Kaa bịne Fero ke bo anye ate, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi nditọ Hibru, atañ ado ami: “Yak ikọd mmi enyọñọ, nọ ammọ ekeñkpono miin.” <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />Adieke afo umuuyakka ammọ enyọñọ, anyʌñ akaiso amʌm ammọ akama, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaaben ataa idiọọk udọñọ nsobo adot mme ufene mfo ke inwañ, mme enañmbakara, mme dọñki ye mme kamel ye enañ, mme edọñ ye ebod. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanịm ubakka ke atu ufene nditọ Isrel ye ake nditọ Iyib, mbaak ufene nditọ Isrel ndomokeed adikpa.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-anịm ini anyʌñ abo ate, “Ñkpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam ñkpọ ami ke isọñ Iyib.” <verse eid="EXO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam ntoro ke edem usen: Afịd mme ufene mbon Iyib emaekpañña, ado unam nditọ Isrel ndomokeed ikikpaaha. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Fero amaaduuñọ anyʌñ akịt ke ufene nditọ Isrel ndomokeed ikikpaaha. Kpayeado, esịd amọ ikinyịmmeke, ndin anye ikibeeñeke idem adiyaak nditọ Isrel enyọñọ.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udọñọ Nsobo Ndufuud</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn, “Iwoppo ekpaubọk ntọñ ke atʌñikañ, ndin yak Moses atop asuan ke afịm ke iso Fero. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Anye ayaakappa ado ñkeñe ntọñ ke afịd isọñ Iyib, ndin ndufuud ayaafịt afịd awo ye unam ke idem ke isọñ Iyib.”<verse eid="EXO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Ndin ammọ emaeben ntọñ ke atʌñikañ ekeda ke iso Fero. Moses amaatop anye asuan ke afịm, ndin inia ndufuud amaabomo afʌk mme awo ye ufene. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Mbon unam mmayịk ikikanna ida ke iso Moses ke ntak a-ndufuud akefʌkkọ ammọ idem ye afịd mbon Iyib. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam esịd Fero asọñ, anye inyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ inọ Moses ye Erọn, kpa nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedọkkọke Moses.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udọñọ Nsobo Edịmitiad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses ate, “Baabak demme ubakusen, ke soobo ye Fero nyʌñ bo anye, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi nditọ Hibru atañ ado ami: Yak ikọd mmi enyọñọ, nọ ammọ ekeñkpono miin, <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />imiidooho ntoro, isañ anyem ami ñyaadọñ akpọsọñ udọñọ unọ fiin ye mme ñkpisọñ mfo ye ikọd mfo, nọ afo adiọọñọ ke inieghe awo ndomokeed a-atieghe nte ami ke afịd ederimbod. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Sia ami ñkpaakenyan ubọk mmi ñkama idiọọk udọñọ a-akpekisọọhọ ndufo afep ke afịd ederimbod uyʌppọ fiin ye ikọd mfo. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Ado ami ñkudịppe fiin nnịm nnọ kpa ntak ami, nọ ami uwọt fiin adudu mmi, ñko nọ enyʌñ ekwọrọ anyịñ mmi ke afịd ederimbod. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Afo asʌk abiọọñọ ikọd mmi, unyʌññọ uyak ammọ enyọñọ. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Ke ntak ado, ñkpọñ ke ukem ini ami, ami ñyaadọñ akaakan idiọọk edịmitiad a-adooho kpaanam ideppe ke Iyib, tọọñọ abio ami akeba tutu idahami. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Nọ uyio yak ekoono mme ufene ye afịd ñkpọ se afo anie ke inwañ edọñ ke ufọk, sia edịmitiad adiiduọññọ itọ afịd awo ye unam se ibañña ke anwa ye ke inwañ, ndin ammọ eyaekpañña.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Mme ñkpisọñ Fero e-ekekponoke ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> emaesọsọp ekoono mme ifʌn ye ufene ammọ edọñ ke ufọk. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Ado mbon se ikitre utọñ ibaña ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> emaekpọñ mme ifʌn ye ufene ammọ ke inwañ.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses ate, “Sio ubọk mfo nyan ke ikpaanyọñ nọ edịmitiad adep ke afịd isọñ Iyib, anyʌñ abọñ mme awo, mme unam ye afịd ñkpọ se etọ ke inwañ ke isọñ Iyib.” <verse eid="EXO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />Moses akesio esañ amọ anyan ke ikpaanyọñ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọñ aduma, edịmitiad, ye akebkeb asakka awuọ isọñ. Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaduọk edịmitiad ke isọñ Iyib; <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />edịmitiad amaadep, akebkeb anyʌñ asakka ke iso ye ke edem. Ami akedo ndiọọkñkan ayobio ke afịd isọñ Iyib tọọñọ nte anye akedo akpọ-akpọ idịd. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Ke afịd isọñ Iyib edịmitiad amaasobo afịd ñkpọ ke inwañ, me awo me ufene; amaawuut afịd se ikikọt ke inwañ anyʌñ abʌñ mme eto. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Ukweeñe itie e-edịmitiad imiikideppe akedo isọñ Kosen, itie a-nditọ Isrel ekedʌñọke.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Akema Fero amaadọñ ekekoot Moses ye Erọn edi, anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Ini anye ami, ami mmenam idiọọkñkpọ. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-anen, ndin ami ye ikọd mmi imidue. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Kpe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ubọk, sia ñnyịn imikịt aduma ye edịmitiad nọ iyʌkkọ ñnyịn. Ami ñyaayaak ndufo enyọñọ; idooho se ndufo etie aba.”<verse eid="EXO 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Moses amaabọọrọ ate, “Ami mmaawuọ ke isọñ abio, ñyaakat ubọk mmi ñkpe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ubọk. Aduma ayaatre, ñko edịmitiad idiibaaha aba, nọ afo adiọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anie ederimbod. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />Ado ami mmediọọñọ ke afo ye mme ñkpisọñ mfo isʌkkọ ibabaak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi.”<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />(Emaesobo mme eto flaks ye baali, sia baali amaadat, ñko flaks amaasịññe mfịd. <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />Ado awo ikibiatta abakpa ye speel, sia ammọ ikidatta diin idaha ntoro.)<verse eid="EXO 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Ndin Moses amaawuọ ke abio akpọñ Fero, akebenne ubọk anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ndin aduma ye edịmitiad emaetre; edịm ikiinyʌññọ iduọkkọ aba ke isọñ. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Ke Fero amaakekịt ke edịm ye edịmitiad ye aduma etre, anye amaamaana anam idiọọk: Anye ye mme ñkpisọñ amọ emaenenekke esọñ esịd. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Ndin esịd Fero amaasọñ, anye ikiinyʌññọ iyaak nditọ Isrel enyọñọ; kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ ato inua Moses.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Udọñọ Nsobo Ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Kaa bịne Fero, sia ami mmesọñ anye esịd ye esịd mme ñkpisọñ amọ, nọ ami nnam mme utom idiọọñọ mmi ke atu ammọ, <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" />nọ ndufo ediidọkkọ nditọ ndufo ye nditọnditọ ndufo naña ami ñketʌnọ nditọ Iyib ye naña ami ñkenam mme utom idiọọñọ mmi ke atu ammọ, ñko, nọ ndufo ediọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” <verse eid="EXO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Ndin Moses ye Erọn emaekaa ekebo Fero ete, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi nditọ Hibru abo: ‘Adiikpeene die mbemiso afo asuuhọ idem mfo ke iso mmi? Yak ikọd mmi eka nọ ammọ ekeñkpono miin. <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />Adieke afo umuuyakka ammọ enyọñọ, ami ñyaaben ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ ndi idịd mfo ñkpọñ. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Ammọ eyaefʌk afịd isọñ tutu awo ikịtte ñkaña isọñ aba. Ammọ eyaebiat etək se ikisọsʌhọ unọọ fiin tọọñọ edịmitiad akekweeñe, tutu awuọ afịd eto se ida ke inwañ. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Ammọ eyaeyọhọ mme ufọk mfo ye ake mme ñkpisọñ mfo ye ake nditọ Iyib, ñkpọ a-adooho ete ye eka me eteete ndufo kpaanam ikikịtte, tọọñọ ke usen a-ammọ ekedʌkkọ edʌñọ ke isọñ ami tutu mfịn.’ ” Ndin Moses amaakanna edem akpọñ Fero.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Akema mme ñkpisọñ Fero emaebo anye ete, “Adiikpeene die awo ami adika iso ido ñkpọ iduọ inọọ ñnyịn? Yak ibon ami enyọñọ, nọ ammọ ekekpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ. Tutu ami afo udiọọñọke ke Iyib adʌk nsobo?”<verse eid="EXO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Emaeben Moses ye Erọn etịmme edi iso Fero. Ndin anye amaabo, “Ikaa, ikikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. Ado indọkkọ miin mbon se idiika.”<verse eid="EXO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Moses amaabọọrọ ate, “Ñnyịn idiika ye iwaad ye mme ñkpisọñ, nditọ ñnyịn ibaan ye ideen, ye udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ ñnyịn, sia ñnyịn inie adinam usọrọ nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="EXO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Ndin Fero amaabo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aba ye ndufo; adieke ami ñyakka ndufo eka, ye ibaan ye nditọ ndufo! Awuọ ndufo emenie idiọọk uduak ke esịd. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Iyoo! Yak ideen ikpọọñ eka ekekpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi, sia ami ado se afo asibeeñe.” Ndin emaebịne Moses ye Erọn esio ke iso Fero.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Sio ubọk mfo nyan ke isọñ Iyib yak mme ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ esọiyọ efʌk isọñ enyʌñ esobo afịd ñkpọ inwañ, ye afịd ñkpọ se edịmitiad akebiat asʌhọ.”<verse eid="EXO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Ndin Moses amaasio esañ amọ anyan ke Iyib, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñko amaanam afịm edem usakkautịn afịme afʌk afịd isọñ Iyib ke afịd uweemeayio ye akonayio. Afịm ado amaakoono mme ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ adi ke usiere usen; <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />ammọ emaetọ edọñọ afịd isọñ Iyib enyʌñ eketekke ekʌbọ ke ekamba udịm kwa ikpeghe ke afịd isọñ Iyib. Utọ akwọkudịm nsobo ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ ado ikibaaha akpa, idiinyʌññọ iba aba. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Ammọ emaefʌk afịd isọñ tutu anye adinweenwen. Ammọ emaesobo afịd ñkpọ se ikisʌhọ ke edịmitiad amaakekweeñe, afịd ñkpọ inwañ mme mfịd eto. Ñkpọ ndomokeed se inwịm ke eto me ke mfịd inwañ ikisʌhọke ke isọñ Iyib aba.<verse eid="EXO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Ndin Fero amaasọp adọñ ekoot Moses ye Erọn anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Ami mmedue <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ñnyʌñ idue ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Idakka innọ ke idiọọkñkpọ mmi akañ keed ami; ñko inyʌñ ikpe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ubọk nọ aben nsobo ñkpa ami asio añkpọñ miin.”<verse eid="EXO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Moses amaakpọñ Fero anyʌñ akenam ñkpeubọk anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñko amaanam akpọsọñ ukod afịm edem usobutịn, adikpuut ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ akedọñ ke Ndad-ndad Akpainyañ. Ndomo ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ keed ikisʌhọke ke itie ndomokeed ke isọñ Iyib. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasọñ Fero esịd, anye inyʌññọ iyak nditọ Isrel enyọñọ.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ufen Nsobo Ekịm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses abo, “Sio ubọk mfo nyan ke ikpaanyọñ nọ ekịm afʌk Iyib, ekịm a-anekkeke akịmme.” <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Ndin Moses amaasio ubọk amọ anyan ke ikpaanyọñ, ndin akaakan ekịm amaafʌk afịd isọñ Iyib ke usen ita. <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />Awo ndomokeed ikikanna imọọnọ awo mfen, me adiwuọ nsaña ke usen ita. Kpayeado afịd nditọ Isrel emaekịt unwana ke mme itie a-ammọ ekedʌññọ.<verse eid="EXO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Akenam ntoro, Fero amaadọñ ekoot Moses adi, anyʌñ adibo anye ate, “Ikaa, ikikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ikoono ibaan ye nditọ ndufo ikaa; ado iyaak udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ ndufo ibono.”<verse eid="EXO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Ado Moses amaabo Fero ate, “Ana afo ayaak nọ ñnyịn ikinam uwa ye ufọfọb uwa inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Ufene ñnyịn ñko ana asaña ye ñnyịn; mbai ñkpad ndomokeed inaaha asʌhọ. Ana ñnyịn isio ubaak ammọ ikama ikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn. Adiido ñnyịn iwọwuọ do ke ñnyịn ididiọọñọ se ñnyịn idiidat ikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi.” <verse eid="EXO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam esịd Fero asọñ, anye inyʌññọ inyịmme adiyaak ammọ nọ enyọñọ. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Fero amaabo Moses ate, “Kpọñ iso mmi! Kịt bo ke afo udieghe iso mmi aba! Usen a-afo akịtte iso mmi, afo ayaakpa.”<verse eid="EXO 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Moses amaabọọrọ anye ate, “Yak ado kpa naña afo abo, ami nduukịtte fiin iso aba.”<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Udọñọ Nsobo Ñkpañña Mme Akpan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Akedikem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Ami ñyaaben udọñọ keed mfen nnọ Fero ye mbon Iyib. Ado amaakweeñe, anye ayaayak nọ ndufo enyọñọ, ndin anye ayaibịne ndufo asịññe afịd-afịd. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />Dọkkọ mbon awo bo ke ideen ye ibaan ana ebeeñe mme mbọhọidʌñ ammọ ñkpọ a-silfa ye kold.” <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />(<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam nditọ Iyib ewọt mbon Isrel mfọn, ndin Moses ke idem amọ ado awo a-mme ñkpisọñ Fero ye mbon abio ekenekke ekpono ke Iyib.)<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Ndin Moses amaabo ate, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: ‘Ke ñkpọ nte ufọọd akonayio, ami ñyaawuọ ndʌk ke afịd isọñ Iyib. <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />Afịd mme akpan ke Iyib eyaekpañña, tọọñọ ke akpan Fero, a-atieghe ke ebekpo, tutu asịm akpan afʌn awonwaan a-abaaha ke itie ukọkñkpọ, ye afịd akpa nditọ enañ ñko. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Akpọsọñ uyom ntuaña ayaaba ke afịd isọñ Iyib, ayaadiọọk akan se ikidadak iba me se idiinyʌñ iba ke ini iso. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Ado ke atu nditọ Isrel, ewa idiikpọiyọ awo me unam ndomokeed.’ Ndin ndufo eyaediọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anịm ubakka ke ufọọd mbon Iyib ye Isrel. <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Afịd mme ñkpisọñ mfo eyaedi embịne miin, edinyuuk iwuod ke iso mmi enyʌñ ebo ete, ‘Ikaa, afo ye afịd ikọd mfo e-esañake ye afo!’ Ado amaakweeñe ami ñyaanyọñ.” Ndin Moses amaakpọñ iso Fero, ke akpọsọñ iyadesịd.<verse eid="EXO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses ate, “Fero idiikpañña utọñ unọ fiin nọ ato ke ado mme utịppeñkpọ edinam mmi ewak ke isọñ Iyib.” <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Moses ye Erọn emaenam afịd mme utịppe edinam ami ke iso Fero, ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam esịd Fero asọñ, ndin anye ikiyakka nditọ Isrel ekpọñ abio amọ.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ye Usọrọ Uyo A-yiis Imiisịneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn ke isọñ Iyib ate, <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />“Afiọñ ami adiido akpa afiọñ inọ ndufo, akpa afiọñ ke isua. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Dọkkọ afịd esob Isrel ate ke ayọhọ usen duob ke afiọñ ami yak awo keedekeed aben ñyịn edọñ ke iwuod ubon amọ, keed kwa ufọk. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />Adieke ibad awo ke ufọk asịppe akan se eta ifre ñyịn edọñ, ana ammọ ewuana keed ye ñkpere ñkan mbọhọidʌñ ammọ, ke emaekediọọñọ ibad awo e-ebaaha do. Ana ndufo ebiere ibad ñyịn edọñ se eyem akeene se awo keedekeed akan ata. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Mme unam se ndufo emek ana edo ñyaara e-esọññọ isua keed, inyʌññọ inie ndo, ndin ndufo emekeme edisio anye ke atu edọñ me ebod. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Ibọọk ammọ tutu ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ke afiọñ, ini a-anaaha nte afịd awo ke esob Isrel ewot ammọ ke ndubiayio. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />Ndin ammọ eyaedat ubaak iyiib ado eyeet ke mben ye anyọñ abaiudọk ye ufọk a-ammọ etieghe eta ñyịn edọñ ado. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Kpa akonayio ado, ammọ ana enwanwan unam ado ke ikañ eta ye mme mfañ se inie idod, ye uyo a-yiis imiisịneke. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Ndufo ikiita unam ado ndisi, ikiinyʌñ item ke mmọọñ, ado inwan anye ke ikañ ye iwuod, ukod ye ñkpọ esịd idịb. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />Ikiiyak mbeñe ndomokeed asʌhọ tutu ubakusen, adieke ubaak asʌhọke tutu ubakusen, ana efọp anye. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Naña ndufo ediita anye ado ami: Inək ewịra idọñ ke ñkpahaisịn ndufo, isịne ikpaukod, inyʌñ ikama esañ ke ubọk. Isọsọp inua ita anye, sia ado usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="EXO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />“Kpa ke akonayio ado, ami ñyaasaña mboiyo ke afịd isọñ Iyib, ñnyʌñ ñwoot afịd mme akpan ke awo ye ke unam, ami ñko ñyaamia afịd mme abasi Iyib ufen. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Iyiib ado adiido idiọọñọ inọ ndufo ke mme ufọk a-ndufo ebaaha, ndin ami mmaakịt iyiib ado, ami ñyaasaña mboiyo. Idiọọk udọñọ nsobo ndomokeed idiituuho ndufo idaha a-ami ndiisobo isọñ Iyib.<verse eid="EXO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />“Usen ami ado se ana ndufo etoiyo. Ke afịd emana ke ayioiso, ana ndufo edia usọrọ ami enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte nsi-nsi ewʌhọ. <verse eid="EXO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />Ana ndufo eta uyo a-yiis imiisịneke ke afịd usen itiaba. Tọọñọ ke akpa usen, ikoono yiis isịññe ke ufọk ndufo, sia ana ebịne awo a-ataaha ñkpọ se yiis asịne tọọñọ ke akpa usen tutu asịm ayọhọ usen itiaba esio ke Isrel. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />Ke akpa usen, inịm adisana esob, mfen ñko ke ayọhọ usen itiaba. Ikiinyʌñ inam utom ndomokeed ke afịd mme usen ami, ibọhọke aditem ndidia nnọọ afịd awo edia; ukweeñe se enie edinam ado ado.<verse eid="EXO 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />“Ndufo idia Usọrọ Uyo a-Yiis Imiisịneke, sia kpa ke usen ado ke ami ñkesịññe mme ubon ndufo ke isọñ Iyib. Inịm usen usọrọ ami nte nsi-nsi ewʌhọ ke afịd emana. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />Ke akpa afiọñ ana ndufo eta uyo a-yiis imiisịneke, tọọñọ ke ndubiayio ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ tutu akesịm ndubiayio ayọhọ usen edịb mme keed. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />Inaaha ekịt yiis ke ufọk ndufo ke usen itiaba. Ndin ana ebịne awo akeedodo, me ado asenawo me amanaisọñ, a-adiaha ñkpọ se yiis asịne ke esịd esio ke esob ubon Isrel. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Ikiidia ñkpọ ndomokeed e-ekamake yiis enam. Nte ndufo edọdʌñ, ana eta uyo a-yiis imiisịneke.”<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Akema Moses amaadọñ ekoot afịd ñkpisọñ Isrel edi, anyʌñ adibo ammọ ate, “Ikaa ini keed ikisịññe mme unam inọ ubon ndufo, inyʌñ iwot ñyịn edọñ Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Ikama abek haisọb, inyiin ke iyiib ke esịd akwa inyʌñ iyeet iyiib ke anyọñ ye mben abaiudọk. Awo ndufo ndomokeed inaaha awuọ ke ufọk tutu ubakusen. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasaña akanna afịd isọñ adisobo nditọ Iyib, anye ayaakịt iyiib ke anyọñ ye mben abaiudọk, ndin anye ayaasaña aboiyo inuausʌñ ado, anye idiiyakka andisobo adʌk ufọk ndufo anyʌñ awot awo.<verse eid="EXO 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />“Inịm mme item ami nte nsi-nsi ewʌhọ ke idem ndufo ye nditọ ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Ndufo imaidʌk isọñ ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiinọ ndufo naña anye akenwọñọ, ikaiso ikpeme adinam usọrọ ami. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />Ndin nditọ ndufo emaibịp, ‘Adinam ami ada anọ soo?’ <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Ndufo eyaedọkkọ ammọ ete, ‘Adinam ami ado uwa Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akesañake aboiyo ke mme ufọk nditọ Isrel ke Iyib ke ini anye akesoboke nditọ Iyib. Ndin mme awo emaenyuuk iwuod enyʌñ ekpono Abasi.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Nditọ Isrel emaenam kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ Moses ye Erọn uyio.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Ke ufọọd akonayio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasobo afịd mme akpan ke isọñ Iyib, tọọñọ ke akpan Fero, a-aketieghe ke ebekpo, tutu asịm akpan awo ñkpakọb a-akebaaha ke ebuka ubeed isọñ, ye mme akpa idịb afịd mme ufene ñko. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Fero ye afịd ñkpisọñ amọ ye afịd nditọ Iyib emaedakka eda ke akonayio, ndin ñkpoyo amaakpon ke Iyib, sia ibaaha ufọk ndomokeed a-awo imiikikpaaha.<verse eid="EXO 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akwọkudịm Unyọñọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Akedo akonayio ado, Fero amaadọñ ekoot Moses ye Erọn edi, anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Idakka! Ikpọñ ikọd mmi, ndufo ye nditọ Isrel! Ikaa ikikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> naña ndufo ekebeeñe. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Ikoono udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ ndufo, naña ekeyem, inyʌñ inyọñọ. Inyʌñ indiọñ miin ñko.”<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Mbon Iyib emaenyịk nditọ Isrel ete yak ammọ esọsọp ekpọñ abio. Ammọ emaebo, “Sia imiidooho ntoro, afịd ñnyịn iyaikpañña!” <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Ndin mme awo emaedappa eboho ndisi uyo mbemiso esịn yiis, enyʌñ edot anye ke afara ke akwa unuakka ñkpọ, ebọp ke afọñ. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Mbon Isrel emaenam naña Moses aketemme ammọ, enyʌñ ebeeñe mbon Iyib mme ñkpọ a-silfa ye kold ye afọñ. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam mbon Iyib ewọt ammọ mfọn, ndin ammọ emaenọ ammọ se ekebebeeñe; ammọ emaenyʌñ ebịme mme inie nditọ Iyib.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Nditọ Isrel emaesaña tọọñọ ke Ramese tutu Sukọd. Ke esioho ibaan ye ntəkayịn efep, ideen tọsịn ikie itiokeed ekesaña ke ukod. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Mme uwak mbon mfen emaekeene ammọ, mme akpakʌb ufene, udịmedọñ ye udịmenañ. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />Ye eboho uyo a-nditọ Isrel ekekamake eto Iyib, ammọ emaesañ uyo a-yiis imiisịneke. Mme eboho uyo ado ikisịneke yiis, sia ekebeebịn ammọ esio ke Iyib, ndin ammọ ikinieghe ini inam ndidia inọ idem ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Ufañ ini a-nditọ Isrel ekedʌññọ ke Iyib akedo isua ikie inaañ mme edịb mme duob. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Ke utịd isua ikie inaañ mme edịb mme duob ado, afịd mme ubon <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> emaekpọñ Iyib. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaataba idab akonayio ado adisio ammọ ke isọñ Iyib, ke akonayio ami, ana afịd Isrel etaba idab adikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afịd emana ke nsi-nsi.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ewʌhọ Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn ate, “Mme ewʌhọ Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo edo ami:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 12:43">“Inaaha awo asenidịd ndomokeed adia anye. <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />Afʌn akeedodo a-afo adeppe akeme adidia ke afo amaakenịm anye mboppo, <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />ado asenawo me awo e-ekpeeghekpe utom inaaha adia.<verse eid="EXO 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />“Ana edia anye ke esịd ufọk; ikiiben unam ado ndomokeed iwuọ anwa. Ikiibuuñ akpọ unam ado ndomokeed. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />Afịd esob ubon Isrel ana enam usọrọ ami.<verse eid="EXO 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />“Asenawo a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo a-ayemme adinam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ana afọọrọ afịd ideen ke esịdufọk amọ edʌd. Amaama anye akeme iwuana ke usọrọ ami nte amanaisọñ. Awo se imiifọọrọke edʌd inaaha adia usọrọ ami. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Mbed ami abọp amanaisọñ ye adidʌñ ukem ukem.”<verse eid="EXO 12:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Afịd nditọ Isrel emaenam kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akewuuk Moses ye Erọn abo enam. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Ndin ke usen ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakoono nditọ Isrel asio ke isọñ Iyib ke mme ikpeghe ubon ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Usio Akpa Ayịn Nnịm Saña-saña</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />“Kpọnnọ afịd mme akpan nịm nnọ miin saña-saña. Akpa mfịdidịb ke atu nditọ Isrel annie miin, adooho awo me unam.”<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Akema Moses amaabo nditọ Isrel ate, “Ndufo inịm usen ami ke ñkpọ aditoiyo, usen a-ndufo ekewuọhọ ke isọñ Iyib, isọñ ufʌn, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaisio ndufo do ke akpọsọñ ubọk. Ikiidia ñkpọ ndomokeed a-asịneke yiis. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Mfịn, ndufo inyọñọ, ke afiọñ Afif. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaiben ndufo adʌk isọñ mbon Kenan, mbon Hed, Amọọ, Hif ye mbon Yebus, isọñ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ mme eteete ndufo adinọ ndufo, isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk, ana ndufo enam usọrọ ami ke afiọñ ami: <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />Ke usen itiaba ndufo enie edita uyo se yiis imiisịneke, ndin ke ayọhọ usen itiaba ana ndufo enam usọrọ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Ita uyo a-yiis imiisịnneke ke mme usen itiaba ado. Inaaha ekịt ñkpọ ndomokeed se yiis asịne ke atu ndufo, inyʌññọ ina ekịt yiis ndomokeed ke mme ñkpere adaña ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Dọkkọ ayịn mfo ke usen ado bo, ‘Ami nnam ami ato ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam annọọ miin ke usen a-ami ñkewuọhọ ke isọñ Iyib.’ <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />Adinam ami ayaaba nte idiọọñọ ke ubọk mfo ye aditoiyo ke akpọiso mfo, ke mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ami ana aba ke ñkpọkinua mfo. Sia<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akiben ndufo asio ke isọñ Iyib ke akpọsọñ ubọk. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />Ana ndufo enịm ewʌhọ ami ke akem ini amọ kwa isua.<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaiben ndufo akesịn ke isọñ mbon Kenan, anyʌñ akappa isọñ inọ ndufo, naña anye akenwọñọ inọ ndufo ye mme eteete ndufo, <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />ana ndufo ekappa akpa mfịdidịb enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Afịd mme akpa ayaara a-atooho ufene ndufo anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Idat ñyịn edọñ ifakka afịd se ido akpa ñyịn dọñki, ado ndufo imiifakkake anye, ibuuñ anye itọñ. Ifakka afịd mme akpan ke atu nditọ ideen ndufo.<verse eid="EXO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />“Ayịn awodeen mfo amaubịp ke ini iso abo, ‘Nsoo ke ñkpọ ami awuọñọ?’ bo anye ate, ‘Akpọsọñ ubọk ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akekama iben ñnyịn asio ke isọñ Iyib, asio ke isọñ ufʌn. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />Ke ini Fero ke ntịdutọñ amaakesịn adiyaak ñnyịn nọ inyọñọ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawot mme akpa mfịdidịb ake awo ye ake mme unam ke Iyib. Ami ado ntak a-ami ñwaaha akpa ayaara afịd ntʌñidịb unam ñnyʌñ mfakka afịd akpa nditọ ideen mmi.’ <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />Ñko ami adiiba nte idiọọñọ ke ubọk mfo ye ñkpọ aditoiyo ke akpọiso mfo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaisio ñnyịn ke isọñ Iyib ke akpọsọñ ubọk amọ.”<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukaaña Akpainyañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />Ke ini Fero amaakeyaak nditọ Isrel enyọñọ, Abasi ikidatta ammọ usʌñ isaña ke idịd mbon Filistia, akpesʌkado udo amaakpere. Sia Abasi akebo, “Ammọ ekpekekịt ekọñ ke usʌñ, ekeme ikpʌhọ akikere enyʌñ etịmme enyọñ Iyib.” <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Ke ntoro Abasi akedat ammọ akanna usʌñ akpautatan akewuọ Ndad-ndad Akpainyañ. Nditọ Isrel emaebeeñe idem enọ anwan ke ini ammọ ekewuọñọke ke Iyib.<verse eid="EXO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Moses amaakoono mme akpọ Yosef sia Yosef amaanam nditọ Isrel enam enwọñọ. Yosef akebo, “Abasi idiitreke adinwam ndufo, ndin ana ndufo ekoono akpọ mmi esio ke abio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ke Yenesis 50:25.</char></note> ami.”<verse eid="EXO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Ammọ ekekpọñ Sukọd, ammọ emaeba ke Etam ke mben akpautatan. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />Ke uweemeayio, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaboiyo ammọ iso ke adaaha ntọñanyọñ adidat ammọ usʌñ ndin asaña ke adaaha ikañ ke akonayio nọ anọ ammọ unwana, nọ ammọ ekan enam isañ uweemeayio ye akonayio. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Adaaha ntọñanyọñ ke uweemeayio ye adaaha ikañ ke akonayio ikikpọññọ itie ammọ ke iso nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel ate yak etịmme edem ekeba ekpere Pi Hahirọd, ke ufọọd Mikdol ye akpainyañ. Yak ammọ enam nnaaekọñ ke mben akpainyañ, ke nsakiso Baal Sefọn. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Fero adiikere ibo, ‘Nditọ Isrel esʌk edutịn ke afịd isọñ ke ndutịme, akpautatan akanna ammọ akʌk.’ <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />Ndin ami ñyaanam esịd Fero asọñ, nọ anye abịne ammọ. Ado ami ñyaabọ ubọọñ nnọ idem mmi nto Fero ye afịd udịmekọñ amọ, ndin mbon Iyib eyaediọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” Ndin nditọ Isrel emaenam naña ekedọkkọ ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Ke ini ekedọkkọke adidem Iyib ke nditọ Isrel emaefeeñe enyọñọ, Fero ye mme ñkpisọñ amọ emaekpəho akikere ebaña ammọ enyʌñ ebo, “Nsoo ke ñnyịn inam ami? Ñnyịn imiyaak nditọ Isrel enyọñọ, inyʌñ itaba mme utom ammọ ekesinamma inọọ ñnyịn.” <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Ke ntoro, anye amaabeeñe idem ye sariọd ekọñ amọ, anyʌñ akoono mbon ekọñ amọ. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />Anye amaakoono sariọd ikie itiokeed se ifọọn ikan, adian ye afịd mme sariọd mfen ke Iyib, adọñ ikpọ mbon ekọñ ayọhọ. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasọñ Fero adidem Iyib esịd, nọ anye abịne nditọ Isrel, e-ekesañake uko-uko ewuọñọ enyọñọ. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />Mbon Iyib, afịd mme enañmbakara ye sariọd ekọñ Fero, mme andiwad enañmbakara ye mbon ekọñ emaebịne nditọ Isrel, enyʌñ ekekpịkke ammọ iso ke itie a-ammọ ekebaaha ke mben akpainyañ a-akpereke Pi Hahirọd, ke nsakiso Baal Sefọn.<verse eid="EXO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />Fero akedikpere, nditọ Isrel emaedịppe anyen ese, ndin sese nditọ Iyib naña esaña ke udịm ebịne ammọ. Akpọsọñ ndịk amaanam ammọ, ndin ammọ emaebọñ ñkpo eseeme enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />Ammọ emaebịp Moses ete, “Ado nte udi ibaññake ke Iyib nọ afo ikoono ñnyịn nọ idikpañña ke akpautatan? Nsoo ke afo anam ami ye ñnyịn, nọ afo isịññe ñnyịn asio ke Iyib? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Ado nte ñnyịn ikubooho fiin ke isọñ Iyib ite, ‘Isaana ñnyịn iyaak nọ ñnyịn ido nditọufọk inọ mbon Iyib?’ Akpaakefọn ñnyịn adinam utom nnọọ nditọ Iyib akan ñnyịn adidikpañña ke akpautatan!”<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Moses amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, “Ikiikop ndịk. Inie nsọọñọnda ndin ndufo eyaekịt adinyaaña ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiinọ ndufo mfịn. Mbon Iyib a-ndufo ekịtte mfịn mi, ndufo idiikịtte ammọ aba ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanwana inọ ndufo; ndufo ikap isọñ ida.”<verse eid="EXO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Nsoo ido nọ afo atua aseeme annọ miin? Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo yak ammọ eka kpa iso. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />Dịppe esañ mfo nyʌñ sio ubọk mfo nyan ke akpainyañ nọ abakka mmọọñ nọ nditọ Isrel esaña ke ufọọd akpainyañ eboiyo ke nsaad isọñ. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Ami ñyaasọñ mbon Iyib esịd nọ ammọ eboiyo edʌk ebịne nditọ Isrel. Ndin ami ñyaabọ ubọọñ nto Fero ye mbon ekọñ amọ, nto mme sariọd ekọñ ye mme andiwad enañmbakara amọ. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />Mbon Iyib eyaediọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke mmabọ ubọọñ nto Fero, mme sariọd ekọñ amọ ye mme awat enañmbakara amọ.”<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Ndin enyere Abasi, a-akesañake ke iso mbon ekọñ Isrel, amaatịmme akanna akesaña ke edem ammọ. Adaaha ntọñanyọñ amaanyʌñ awọññọ ke iso akeda ke edem ammọ, <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />ke ufọọd mbon ekọñ Iyib ye ake Isrel. Afịd akonayio ntọñanyọñ amaaben ekịm asịn ke mbeñ keed anyʌñ anọ unwana ke mbeñ uko; ndin ukañ umi isañake ikikpere ukañ uko ke afịd akonayio.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />Akema Moses amaasio ubọk anyan ke akpainyañ, ndin afịd akonayio ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam afịm usakkautịn akpuut mmọọñ akpainyañ atịme edem, anyʌñ anam anye akappa ado nsaad isọñ. Mmọọñ amaabakka iba, <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />ndin nditọ Isrel emaesaña eboiyo ke ufọọd akpainyañ ke nsaad isọñ, ye ndibene mmọọñ ke nnasia ye ke ufiin ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Mbon Iyib emaebịne ammọ, afịd mme enañmbakara ye mme sariọd ye mme awat enañmbakara Fero emaebịne ammọ ekewuọ esịd akpainyañ. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Ke ñkịmñnwaña akonayio, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatie ke adaaha ikañ ye ntọñanyọñ ase mbon ekọñ Iyib anyʌñ asịn ammọ ke ndutịme. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Anye amaayʌttọ mme ikara ukod sariọd ekọñ ammọ adian, anam ammọ enie mfịna adiwat. Ndin nditọ Iyib emaebo, “Yak ñnyịn itịmme edem ikpọñ nditọ Isrel! <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ada ye ammọ anwana ekọñ ye ñnyịn.”<verse eid="EXO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Sio ubọk mfo nyan ke akpainyañ nọ mmọọñ afeghe atịmme akefʌk nditọ Iyib ye sariọd ekọñ ammọ ye mme andiwat enañmbakara.” <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Moses amaasio ubọk amọ anyan ke akpainyañ, ndin ayio akesiere akpainyañ amaatịmme akeda ke itie amọ. Mbon Iyib ekesʌk efeeñe eka udo, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakpuut ammọ adọñ ke esịd akpainyañ. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Mmọọñ amaafeghe atịmme akefuuk mme sariọd ekọñ ye mme andiwad enañmbakara, ye afịd mbon ekọñ Fero e-ekebịneke nditọ Isrel edʌk esịd akpainyañ. Awo ammọ ndomokeed ikibọkkọke.<verse eid="EXO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Ado nditọ Isrel emaesaña eboiyo ke akpainyañ ke nsaad isọñ, ye ndibene mmọọñ ke nnasia ye ke ufiin ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanyaaña Isrel asio ke ubọk nditọ Iyib, Isrel emaenyʌñ ekịt naña nditọ Iyib ekpañña ebono ke mben esʌk. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Ndin ke nditọ Isrel emaekekịt naña akpọsọñ ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenwana ye nditọ Iyib, ammọ emaebaak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ ebuọt idem ye anye ye Moses isʌñutom amọ.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ikwọ Moses ye Miriam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Ndin Moses ye nditọ Isrel emaekwọ ikwọ ami enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">“Ami ñyaakwọ nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">sia anye akoñño itie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">Anye amaakoono enañmbakara ye mme andiwad</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">afʌñ aduọọk ke esịd akpainyañ.<verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado adudu ye ukpeme mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">anye akappa ado adinyaaña mmi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:2">Anye ado Abasi mmi, ndin ñyaatooro anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">anye ado Abasi ete mmi, ndin ami ñyaatooro anye.<verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado uko ke ekọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:3">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado anyịñ amọ.<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />Anye amaafʌñ mme sariọd ekọñ Fero ye udịmekọñ amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">aduọọñọ ke akpainyañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:4">Mme ataa awuọiso mbon ekọñ Fero</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">emaedeñ ke Ndad-ndad Akpainyañ.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Utʌñọ mmọọñ e-efʌk ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:5">ammọ emaeteñ edʌk udem nte itiad.<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ubọk nnasia mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">amaanie uko ke adudu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:6">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ubọk nnasia mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">amaanuak mme asua.<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />“Afo amaakama akpọsọñ adudu ubọọñ mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">atop mbon se ikinwana ye afo aduọọñọ ke isọñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:7">Afo amaatat ikañ iyadesịd mfo ayaak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">anye ata ammọ nte mbio.<verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />Ke afo adifiat iwuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">mme mmọọñ emaeboho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:8">Mme utʌño mmọọñ emaedakka eda nte ndibene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">udem mmọọñ emaesọọñ ke ufọọd akpainyañ.<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />Usua amaaduaak inua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">‘ami ñyaabịne, ami ñyaakpịkke ammọ iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:9">Ami ñyaadeeme ñkpọ mbịme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">ami ñyaadia tutu andooro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:9">Ami ñyaasio akañkañ mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">ndin ubọk mmi ayaasobo ammọ.’<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Ado afo amaasio inweek afịm mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">ndin akpainyañ amaafʌk ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:10">Ammọ emaedeñ nte ñked</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">ke ekamba mmọọñ.<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anie ke atu mme abasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">atie nte afo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:11">Anie atie nte afo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">a-anieghe uku ke adisanaido,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:11">anie uteeñe ke ubọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">anam mme utịppe adinam?<verse eid="EXO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />“Afo amesio ubọk nnasia mfo anyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:12">ndin isọñ aben mme asua mfo amen.<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />Ke nsọọñọnda ima mfo, afo ayaadat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">mbon se afo afak usʌñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:13">Ke adudu mfo, ayaawọt ammọ usʌñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">nọ ekesịm ke adisana itieidʌñ mfo.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />Mme idịd eyaekop enyʌñ enyeñ idem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:14">Mbọribọ ayaamʌm mbon Filistia.<verse eid="EXO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />Uteeñe ayaanam mbọọñ Edọm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:15">mme ñkpisọñ Mọb eyaekpañña ñnyeñidem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:15">Mbon abio Kenan eyaeyeppe afịd-afịd;<verse eid="EXO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />akpọsọñ ndịk ye ayeemensia ayaafʌk ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:16">Ato ke adudu ubọk mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">ammọ eyaedop eda nte itiad,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:16">tutu ikọd mfo eboiyo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">tutu nditọ Isrel a-afo akefakka eboiyo.<verse eid="EXO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />Afo ayaaben ammọ adʌk adi, anyʌñ atọ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">ke abod a-adooho asaña-asaña udeemeñkpọ mfo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:17">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, itie a-afo akenịmme nte itieidʌñ mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">adisana itie, Abọọñ, u-ubọk mfo akenamma.<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:18">ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Idaha mme enañmbakara Fero, mme sariọd ekọñ mme andiwad mme enañmbakara ekedọñọke ke akpainyañ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam mmọọñ akpainyañ atịmme adifʌk ammọ, ado nditọ Isrel emaesaña eboiyo akpainyañ ke nsaad isọñ. <verse eid="EXO 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Ndin prọfed Miriam, ayịneka awonwaan Erọn, amaaben ibịdubọk ke ubọk amọ, afịd ibaan ndin emaekeene anye, ekama mme ibịdubọk enyʌñ enek unek. <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Miriam amaakwọ ikwọ ami anọ ammọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">“Kwọ ikwọ nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">sia anye anekke akoñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">Enañmbakara ye andiwad</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">anye afʌñ asịn ke esịd akpainyañ.”<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Mmọọñ Mara ye Elim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Ndin Moses amaadat Isrel usʌñ ato ke Ndad-ndad Akpainyañ, ndin ammọ emaedʌk ekaa ke Akpautatan Sọọ. Ammọ ikikịtte mmọọñ ke usen ita a-ammọ ekesañake ke akpautatan. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Ke ini ammọ emaekedi Mara,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mara awuọñọ idod-idod</char></note> ammọ ikikanna inwọñ mmọọñ amọ sia akedoodoro. (Ado anam nọ ekoot itie ado Mara.) <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Ndin nditọ Isrel emaenam mfịna, enyʌñ edukuunọ ye Moses, ebo anye ete, “Nsoo ke ñnyịn idiinwọñ?”<verse eid="EXO 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Ndin Moses amaaseeme anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawọt anye ibio eto. Anye amaaketop eto ado asịn ke mmọọñ, mmọọñ amaakappa ado se enwọñ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">Ke itie ado ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ ammọ ewʌhọ ye item, anyʌñ adomo ammọ ase. <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />Anye amaadọkkọ ammọ abo, “Ndufo ikpitịm ikpañ utọñ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, inyʌñ inam se inen ke iso amọ, ndufo ikpikpañ utọñ inọ mme mbed amọ inyʌñ inịm mme ewʌhọ amọ, ami ndiinamma mme utọ udọñọ a-ami ñkebenne ñkeene mbon Iyib ikeene ndufo, sia ami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndo andikọk ndufo udọñọ.”<verse eid="EXO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Ndin ammọ emaekewuọ Elịm, itie idịm duob mme iba ye ayob ata mme duob ekebaaha, ammọ emaenyʌñ eba do ekpere mmọọñ ado.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Mana ye Asasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Afịd ubon Isrel emaekpọñ Elịm edisịm Akpautatan Sin, a-adaaha ke ufọọd Elim ye Sainai, ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ition ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba tọọñọ ammọ ekewuọñọ ekpọñ Iyib. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Ndin afịd ubon Isrel emaesuuk Moses mme Erọn uyio ke akpautatan. <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />Nditọ Isrel emaebo ammọ ete, “Akpekapado ñnyịn ikikpa ke ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Iyib! Ke udo ñnyịn imaisitie ikanna mme ako unam, inyʌñ idia afịd ndidia se ikpiyeyem, ado afo amaisịññe ñnyịn adi ke akpautatan ami aditem afịd esob awo ami abiọọñ nọ ekpañña.”<verse eid="EXO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses ate, “Ami ñyaanam uyo ato ke anyọñ adep nte edịm unọ fiin. Mme awo ana ewuọ eka esiin kwa usen ekekoono se idiikem ammọ usen ado. Ke utọ usʌñ ami ke ami ndiidomo ammọ nse me ammọ eyaenịm mme item mmi. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiokeed, ammọ eyaetem se ammọ ekoono edi, ndin ana awak akañ iba akan se ammọ esikoono ke mme usen mfen.”<verse eid="EXO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Akema, Moses ye Erọn emaedọkkọ afịd nditọ Isrel ebo, “Ke ndubiayio, ndufo eyaediọọñọ ke ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akisịññe ndufo ke Iyib, <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />ndin ayio amaasiere ndufo eyaekịt ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, sia anye a-akop ndukuunọ a-ndufo edukuunọke ebaña anye. Ñnyịn ido mme anie, nọ ndufo ekpedukuunọ ibana ñnyịn?” <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Ndin Moses amaabo ammọ ate, “Ndufo eyaediọọñọ ke akedo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke anye amainọ ndufo unam nọ eta ke ndubiayio ye afịd uyo se ndufo ekpeyeyem ke ubakusen, sia anye amaakop ndukuunọ a-ndufo edukuunọke ebaña anye. Ñnyịn ido mme anie? Ndufo idukuunọke ibaña ñnyịn, ado esuuk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> uyio.”<verse eid="EXO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Akema, Moses amaabo Erọn ate, “Dọkkọ afịd ubon Isrel, ‘Idi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, sia anye a-akop ndukuunọ ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Ke ini Erọn akesʌkkọ atañ ikọ anọ afịd ubon Isrel, ammọ ekese ukañ akpautatan, edikịt ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte awuọ ada ke ntọñanyọñ.<verse eid="EXO 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />“Ami mmekop ndukuunọ nditọ Isrel. Dọkkọ ammọ bo, ‘Ke ñkịmnsiere, ndufo eyaeta unam, ndin ke ubakusen ndufo eyaeyʌkkọ ye uyo. Ndin ndufo eyaediọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Ndubiayio ado asasa emaedi edifʌk itie a-ammọ ekebaaha, ndin mbara amaakanna itie a-ammọ ekebaaha akʌk ke ubakusen. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />Ke ini mbara ado amaakesat, ammọ emaekịt ntək ñkpakpa uyo e-ekebaaha nte mbara ke isọñ akpautatan. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Ke ini nditọ Isrel ekekịtte ami, ammọ emaebịp emọ-emọ ete, “Nsoo ido ami?” Sia ammọ ikidiọọñọke se ñkpọ ado akedo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 16:15">Moses amaabo ammọ, “Ado uyo ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inọọhọ ndufo abo eta. <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inọọhọ ndufo ado ami: ‘Awo keedekeed ana akoono naña anye ayem. Ben udomo oma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.4; se ñko ke Eksọdọs 16:18, 32, 33 ye 36</char></note> keed nọ awo keedekeed ke atayad mfo.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Mbon Isrel emaenam naña ekedọkkọ ammọ, usʌk awo emaekoono uwak, usʌk etək-etək. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />Ndin ke ammọ emaekedomo ke udomoñkpọ oma, awo andikikoono nọ anekke awak ikinieghe awak abọhọ, ñko awo se ikikoono etək-etək ikinieghe yak asịp abọhọ. Afịd awo emaekoono anye akem naña ammọ ekeyem.<verse eid="EXO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Ndin Moses amaadọkkọ ammọ ate, “Inaaha awo ndomokeed anịm uyo amọ tutu ubakusen.”<verse eid="EXO 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Kpayeado, usʌk awo ikikpañña utọñ inọ Moses; ammọ emaenịm ubaak uyo ado tutu ayio asiere, ado ndọñ amaadʌk anyʌñ atọọñọ aditebe. Ndin Moses amaayat esịd ye ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />Kwa ubakusen awo keedekeed amaakoono se ikikem ye se anye akeyem, ndin ke utịn amaakefiop, uyo ado amaatọọñọ adiyeeme. <verse eid="EXO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Ammọ emaekoono se idiikem ammọ ke usen iba, ke ayọhọ usen itiokeed, oma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 2.8</char></note> iba kwa awo, ndin mme adadusʌñ ke mme ubon Isrel emaeketañ enọ Moses. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />Ndin anye amaadọkkọ ammọ ate, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ uyo abaña ado ami: ‘Ñkpọñ adiido usen nduọkadudu sabad, adisana sabad anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ke ntoro, isañ se eyem adisañ, inyʌñ item se eyem aditem. Inịm se iyọhọ isʌhọ tutu ubakusen.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Nte Moses aketemmeke, ammọ emaenịm anye tutu ubakusen, anye ñko ikibiarake inyʌññọ idʌk ndọñ. <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Moses amaadọkkọ ammọ ate, “Ita anye mfịn ami, sia mfịn ado sabad <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ndufo idiikịtte anye nte keed ke isọñ mfịn. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Ndufo enie edikoono anye ke usen itiokeed, ado ayọhọ usen itiaba, usen Sabad, anye idiibaaha aba.”<verse eid="EXO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Kpayeado, usʌk awo emaekaa ke ayọhọ usen itiaba adikikoono uyo, ado ammọ ikikịtte ñkpọ ndomokeed. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Adiikpeene die afo <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ado ndufo</char></note> adika iso itre adinịm mme mbed ye item mmi? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Nie ke akikere bo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> u-unọ fiin Sabad; ado anam ke ayọhọ usen itiokeed anye unọ fiin uyo a-akemme usen iba. Afịd awo ana eba ke itie nte ammọ eba ke ayọhọ usen itiaba; awo ndomokeed inaaha awuọ esiin.” <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Ke ntoro, mbon awo emaeduọk adudu ke ayọhọ usen itiaba.<verse eid="EXO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Nditọ Isrel ekekoot uyo ado mana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mana atie nte ikọ Hibru awuọñọke Nsoo ido ami. Se Eksọdọs 16:15.</char></note> Anye akedo afia-afia nte ñkpasi korianda, anyʌñ aba awo ke inua nte nsaad uyo e-ekamake adanakwọọk enam. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Moses amaadọkkọ ammọ ate, “Mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọọhọ ado ami: ‘Iben mana ke udomoñkpọ oma inịm anye inọ afịd emana ndufo ke iso, nọ ammọ ekịt uyo a-ami ñkinọọhọ ndufo nọ eta ke anaan ke ini ami ñkisioho ndufo ke Iyib.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Ndin Moses amaabo Erọn ate, “Ben atu keed nyʌñ domo mana ke ñkene udomoñkpọ sịn. Ndin nịm anye ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nọ enịm anye enọ afịd emana ke ayio iso.”<verse eid="EXO 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses, Erọn amaasịn mana ye mme itiad mbed edioomo, nọ ana do nte ñkpọ aditoiyo. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Nditọ Isrel emaedia mana ke isua aba, tutu ediwuọ isọñ a-ammọ ekedʌñọke, emaedia mana tutu ekewuọ adaña abio Kenan.<verse eid="EXO 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />(Oma keed ado mbaak efa keed ke itie duob.)<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s1">Mmọọñ A-atooho Itiad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Afịd ubon Isrel emaedaaña eto Akpautatan Sin, enam isañ tọọñọ ke itie keed tutu ekewuọ itie mfen naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ ammọ uyio. Ammọ emaeba etək ini ke Refidịm, ado mmọọñ ikibaaha se mme awo enwọñ. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Ndin ammọ emaetọhọ ye Moses enyʌñ ebo, “Inọ ñnyịn mmọọñ nọ inwọñ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Moses amaabọọrọ abo, “Nsoo ido nọ ndufo etọhọ ye ami? Nsoo inam nọ ndufo edomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idomo?”<verse eid="EXO 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Ado itọñ amaasat ammọ do, ammọ emaenyʌñ esuuk Moses uyio. Emaebo anye ete, “Nsoo ikinam nọ afo akisịññe ñnyịn, nditọ ye ufene ñnyịn ke Iyib nọ idiikpañña nsaditọñ?”<verse eid="EXO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Ndin Moses amaatua, aseeme anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, “Afo abo nnam soo ye ibon ami? Ayak ataa etək-etək, ammọ ekpaentọọñ miin ke itiad.”<verse eid="EXO 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ Moses ate, “Kaa keda ke iso mme awo. Dat ubaak ñkpisọñ Isrel nyʌñ ben esañ a-afo akemiaha Inyañ Nail kama ke ubọk mfo. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />Ami ñyaada do ke iso mfo ke mben itiad ke Họreb. Mia itiad ado, ke mmọọñ ayaawuọ se mme awo enwọñ.” Moses amaanam ami ke iso ñkpisọñ Isrel. <verse eid="EXO 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Anye akekoot itie ado Masa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Masa awuọñọ adidomo</char></note> ye Meriba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Meriba awuọñọ aditọhọ</char></note> sia nditọ Isrel emaedutañña enyʌñ edomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idomo, ebo, “Me <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmọdo aba ke atu ñnyịn me ibaaha?”<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekan Mbon Amalek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Mbon Amalek emaedinwana ye nditọ Isrel ke Refidịm. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Moses amaadọkkọ Yọsua abo, “Mek mme awo ke atu ideen ñnyịn nyʌñ kaa ke nwana ye nditọ Amalek. Ñkpọñ, ami ndiida ke anyọñ abod ye esañ Abasi ke ubọk mmi.”<verse eid="EXO 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Ndin Yọsua amaanwana ye mbon Amalek, kpa naña Moses akenọọ anye uyio, ndin Moses, Erọn ye Họọ emaedọọk ekaa anyọñ abod ado. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Adaña ini ubọk Moses akebaaha ke anyọñ, Isrel emaekan ke ekọñ, ado ini a-anye akesuuhọ ubọk, nditọ Amalek emaekan. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Ke ini ubọk amaakemem Moses, ammọ emaeben itiad esịn ke idak nọ anye atie ke anyọñ itiad ado. Erọn ye Họọ emaedịppe ubọk amọ ke anyọñ, keed ke ubọk umi, keed ke ubọk uko, nọ anam ubọk amọ asọñada ke anyọñ tutu utịn asop. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Ke ntoro Yọsua amaakan mbon ekọñ Amalek ke akañkañ.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Wet ñkpọ ami sịn ke ikpañwed nte ñkpọ aditoiyo, nyʌñ nam Yọsua akop abaña, sia ami ñyaasọọk anyịñ Amalek nsio afịd-afịd ke idak hefịn.”<verse eid="EXO 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Moses amaabọp akpokoro uwa, anyʌñ akoot anye: <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Afọñidiọọñọ mmi. <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />Anye akebo, “Sia emaedịppe ubọkanwan etuuk ebekpo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanwana ekọñ ye nditọ Amalek ke afịd emana.”<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yetro Akese Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Ndin Yetro, aku Midian, ete anwaan Moses amaakop abaña afịd ñkpọ se Abasi akenam anọ Moses ye ikọd amọ Isrel, ye naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akekoono ammọ asio ke Iyib.<verse eid="EXO 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Ke Moses amaakenọ anwaan amọ Sipora nọ aka ukañ ammọ, ete anwaan amọ Yetro amaabọ anye <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />ye nditọ ideen amọ iba. Ayịn keed akekere Kesọm,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesọm atie nte awuọñọ asenawo do</char></note> sia Moses amaabo, “Ami mmekappa ndo asenawo ke asenidịd”; <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />ayịn anye ako akekere Eliesa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eliesa awuọñọ Abasi mmi ado adinyaaña.</char></note> sia anye amaabo, “Abasi ete mmi akedo andiñnwam miin; anye amañnyaaña miin asio ke akañkañ Fero.”<verse eid="EXO 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Ete anwaan Moses, Yetro, amaasaña keed ye nditọ ideen Moses ye anwaan Moses abịne Moses ke anaan, ke itie a-anye akebaaha akpere abod Abasi. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Yetro amaadọñ utom anọ Moses ate, “Ami, ete anwaan mfo Yetro, nsʌk ndi ye anwaan mfo ye nditọ ideen amọ iba.”<verse eid="EXO 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Moses amaawuọ akesoobo ye ete anwaan amọ, asuuk iwuod ke isọñ anyʌñ atʌm anye inua. Ke ammọ emaedukọmmọ emọ-emọ, emaeboiyo edʌk esịd atayad. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Moses amaadọkkọ ete anwaan amọ afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam Fero ye mbon Iyib ke ntak Isrel ye ufen se ammọ ekekịt ke usʌñ, ye naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenyaaña ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Esịd amaadat Yetro adikop mbaña afịd nti ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam anọ Isrel ke anye adikifak ammọ nsio ke ubọk mbon Iyib. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Ndin Yetro amaabo, “Itooro anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-akufakka fiin asio ke ubọk nditọ Iyib ye Fero, a-akenyʌññọ afak nditọ Isrel asio ke ubọk mbon Iyib. <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />Ami mmediọọñọ idahami ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpon akan afịd mme abasi mfen, sia anye akenam ami ye mbon se ikifʌnnọ Isrel ye ntañidem.” <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Ndin Yetro, ete anwaan Moses, amaanam ufọfọb uwa ye mme uwa mfen anọ Abasi, ndin Erọn ñko amaadi ye afịd ñkpisọñ Isrel edidia ndidia ye ete anwaan Moses ke iso Abasi.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Ayio akesiere, Moses amaadọọk ñkpọitie amọ atie nte abiideikpe nnọọ nditọ Isrel, ammọ emaenyʌñ eda ekanna anye ekʌk tọọñọ ke ubakusen tutu ndubiayio. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Ke ete anwaan amọ amaakekịt afịd se Moses akenam anọ ikọd amọ, anye amaabo ate, “Nsoo ke afo anam ami ye mbon mfo? Nsoo ido nọ afo atie ikpọọñ nte abiideikpe, ado afịd mbon awo edada ukanna ekʌk tọọñọ ke ubakusen tutu ndubiayio?”<verse eid="EXO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Moses amaabọọrọ anye ate, “Sia mme awo esidi embịne miin ediyem uduak Abasi. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Ini akeedodo a-ammọ enieghe mfịna, esiben ensọk miin, ndin ami mbiere ke ufọọd ammọ ñnyʌñ ndọkkọ ammọ mbaña ewʌhọ ye mme item Abasi.”<verse eid="EXO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Ete anwaan Moses amaabọọrọ ate, “Se afo anam ifọnnọ. <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />Afo ye mbon se idi ubịne fiin eyaekpañña mba. Utom ami adoppo abọhọ unọ fiin; ndin afo uduukanna unam anye ikpọọñ. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Kpañ utọñ nnọ miin idahami, ndin ami ñyaunọ item; yak Abasi ñko aba ye afo. Ana afo ada ke itie ibon ami ke iso Abasi, anyʌñ aben mfịna ammọ asọk anye. <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />Kpeep ammọ mme ewʌhọ ye item Abasi, nyʌñ temme ammọ usʌñ eduuwem ye naña ammọ ana esaña. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />Ado mek mbon nti iwuod sio ke atu afịd ami, ideen se ibaak Abasi, ideen se inam akpanikọ, e-esuaha idiọọk udod, nyʌñ sio ammọ nte mme ñkpisọñ ke atu mme tọsịn, ke mme ikie, ke mme aba mme duob, ye ke mme duob. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />Yak ammọ enam utom nte mme akpe ikpe nnọọ Isrel afịd ini, ado yak ammọ ekoono ikpe se inekke isọñ usọk fiin; ado ammọ ekeme adibiide ntək ikpe. Ado ayaanam utom mfo ayakka, sia ammọ ediiwawana inam utom ye afo. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Adieke afo anamma ami naña Abasi anọ uyio, afo ayaakan anam utom nọ akpeene; ndin afịd mbon awo ami eyaenyọñọ ye uyʌkkọ.”<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Moses amaakpañ utọñ anọ ete anwaan amọ anyʌñ anam afịd se anye aketañ. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />Anye amaamek mme akobidem ideen ato afịd Isrel, anyʌñ anịm ammọ nte mme etubom, mme adaiso ke atu mme tọsịn, ke mme ikie, ke aba mme duob ye ke mme duob. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Ammọ emaenam utom nte mme abiideikpe enọ mme awo afịd ini. Ammọ emaenyʌñ ekoono ñkpoon ikpe esọk Moses, enyʌñ ekpe ntək ikpe ke idem ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Ndin Moses amaasio ete anwaan amọ unyọñ, ndin Yetro amaatịmme anyọñ idịd ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ke Abod Sainai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1" />Ke akpa usen ke ayọhọ afiọñ ita tọọñọ nditọ Isrel ekekpọñ Iyib, ammọ emaedisịm Akpautatan Sainai. <verse eid="EXO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2" />Ammọ emaekekpọñ Refidịm, emaedʌk Akpautatan Sainai, ndin Isrel emaebono do ke akpautatan ke iso ekamba abod.<verse eid="EXO 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Ndin Moses amaakaa abịne Abasi, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaada ke anyọñ abod akoot Moses abo, “Ami ado se afo anie aditañ nnọọ mbon se ito ubon Yekọb ye se afo anie idọkkọ nditọ Isrel: <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />‘Ndufo ke idem ndufo emekịt se ami ñkenam ye Iyib, ye naña ami ñkikama ndufo ke mba ntrukpuum iben ndufo nnọ idem mmi. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Idahami adieke ndufo ekoppo uyio mmi ayọhọ-ayọhọ enyʌñ enịm edioomo mmi, ndufo eyaedo mbon se ami mma ñkan ke atu afịd mme idịd. Akpesʌkado afịd ederimbod ado ake mmi, <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />ndufo ediido abioubọọñ mme aku ye adisana idịd innọ miin.’ Mme ikọ se afo anie adidọkkọ nditọ Isrel edo ami.”<verse eid="EXO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Ndin Moses amaanyọñ akaa akedọñ ekoot mme ñkpisọñ mbon awo anyʌñ aben afịd mme ikọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ ye anịm ke iso ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ ke uyio keed ete, “Ñnyịn iyainam afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo.” Akema, Moses amaaben ibọọrọ ammọ asọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="EXO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses ate, “Ami ñyaadi ubịne fiin ke ndodoppo ntọñanyọñ, nọ mme awo ekop naña ami ntañ ikọ ye afo, ndin ammọ eyaenie mbuọdidem ke idem mfo afịd ini.” Ndin Moses amaadọkkọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> se mbon awo eketañ.<verse eid="EXO 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Kaa bịne ikọd mmi, nyʌñ kenam ammọ esana mfịn ye ñkpọñ. Nam ammọ eyet afọñ ammọ, <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />enyʌñ ebeeñe idem enịm enọ ayọhọ usen ita, sia ke usen ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaasọiyọ ato Abod Sainai adi ke iso afịd awo. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />Nịm adaña kanna ekamba abod kʌk nọ mbon awo nyʌñ bo ammọ ate, ‘Ikịt ibo ke ndufo isañake ikpere ekamba abod ami, inyʌññọ ituuk mben abod. Ana ewot awo akeedodo adiituuk abod ado. <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />Enie aditọọñ ammọ ke itiad, miidooho etịgha ke idañ ewot; inaaha ubọk awo ndomokeed atuuk ammọ. Inaaha eyak awo ndomokeed, me unam adu uwem.’ Ukweeñe ini ekemeke adisaña ñkpere ekamba abod ado ado ke emaefịt nnʌk akukịmedọñ nọ akpeene.”<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Ke Moses amaakesọiyọ ke ekamba abod akisoobo ye mbon awo, anye amaanam ammọ esana, ammọ ñko emaeyet afọñ ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />Akema anye amaabo ammọ, “Ibeeñe idem ndufo inịm inọ ayọhọ usen ita. Awonwaan ye awodeen inaaha enie ewuana ye emọ-emọ.”<verse eid="EXO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Ke ubakusen ayọhọ usen ita aduma amaatop, akebkeb anyʌñ akeppe, idiọọk anyọñ anyʌñ afʌk ekamba abod ye ekamba uyom adukpoñ. Idem amaanyeñ afịd awo e-ekebaaha ke nnaaekọñ. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Ndin Moses amaadat afịd awo usʌñ awuọ ke itie nnaa nọ ekesoobo ye Abasi, ndin ammọ ekeda ke usuuk abod. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Nsʌñikañ amaafʌk Abod Sainai, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akesọiyọ do ke ikañ. Nsʌñikañ amaabịmme adọọk anyọñ nte nsʌñikañ a-atooho ekamba ebʌkikañ, ndin abod amaanyeeñe ataa eti-eti. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />Ke idaha u-uyom adukpoñ akenekkeke asọñ, Moses amaatañ ikọ, ndin uyio Abasi amaabọọrọ anye.<verse eid="EXO 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasọiyọ aketie ke anyọñ Abod Sainai anyʌñ akoot Moses ate adi anyọñ abod. Ndin Moses amaadọọk akaa. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Sọiyọ kaa ke dʌt mbon awo utọñ mbaak ammọ ediyem adikịt iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mbaak uwak ammọ edikpañña. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Akpọkọm mme aku, e-esañake ekpere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ana enam idem ammọ asana, imiidooho ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanọ ammọ unọmọ.”<verse eid="EXO 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Moses amaabo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate, “Mbon awo ikemeke idi Abod Sainai, sia afo ke idem mfo amaiwuuk ñnyịn ate, ‘Nịm adaña kanna abod nyʌñ sio anye nịm nte adisana.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ Moses ate, “Sọiyọ kaa ke ben Erọn dọọk di. Ado mme aku ye mbon awo inaaha eyem adidọọk mbịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, imiidooho anye ayaayat esịd ye ammọ.”<verse eid="EXO 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Ndin Moses amaasọiyọ abịne mbon awo anyʌñ akedọkkọ ammọ se Abasi aketañ.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Mbed Duob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Ndin Abasi amaatañ afịd mme ikọ ami:<verse eid="EXO 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />“Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo, a-akubenne fiin asio ke Iyib, ke isọñ ufʌn a-afo akedʌññọ.<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />“Inaaha ndufo ekpono abasi mfen ke mmiibọhọke ami.<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />Inaaha afo anam usọsọi ñkpọ anọ idem mfo, ke mbid ñkpọ ndomokeed ke hefịn ke anyọñ, me ke isọñ mmọọñ. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />Inaaha afo atuak iwuod anọ ammọ, inaaha anyʌñ akpono ammọ; sia ami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo ndo Abasi ufịb, mmia nditọ ufen idiọọkñkpọ mme ete ammọ tutu asịm emana ita ye inaañ m-mbon e-ensuaaha miin, <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />ado ñwọt ima nnọ tọsịn emana mbon e-emmaaha miin, enyʌñ enịm mme mbed mmi.<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />Inaaha afo asịn anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo ke ndek, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idiitreke adibiom awo a-asịnne anyịñ amọ ke ndek ikpe.<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />Toiyo usen Sabad ke adinịm anye asana. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Ke usen itiokeed ke afo anie adinam afịd utom, <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />ado ayọhọ usen itiaba ado sabad anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo. Inaaha afo anam utom ndomokeed ke usen ado, me afo, me ayịn awodeen, me ayịn awonwaan, me ayịnufọk mfo awodeen me awonwaan, me mme unam mfo, me asenawo a-adʌññọ ke mme abio mfo. <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam anyọñ ye isọñ, akpainyañ ye afịd se idọñọ ke esịd ke usen itiokeed, ado anye amaaduọk adudu ke ayọhọ usen itiaba. Ke ntoro, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadiọñ usen Sabad, anyʌñ anam anye ado adisana.<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />Kpono ete ye eka mfo, nọ ato do afo adu uwem akpeene ke isọñ ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo unọọhọ fiin.<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />Kuuwot awo.<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />Kuusịn efịbe.<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />Kuuyịp inọ.<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />Kuutie ntiense nsu udian mbọhọidʌñ mfo.<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />Kuusịn anyen ke ufọk mbọhọidʌñ mfo. Kuusịn anyen ke anwaan mbọhọidʌñ mfo, me ke ayịnufọk amọ awodeen me awonwaan, ayaaraenañ amọ, me dọñki, me ñkpọ keed akeedodo a-anieghe mbọhọidʌñ mfo.”<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />Ñnyeñidem amaanam mme awo ke ini ammọ ekekịtte aduma ye akebkeb, enyʌñ ekop uyom adukpoñ, ye nsʌñikañ ke abod. Ammọ emaeda nsan-nsan <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />ebo Moses, “Tañ ikọ ke idem mfo inọ ñnyịn, ndin ñnyịn iyaikpañ utọñ unọ fiin. Ado kuuyak Abasi atañ ikọ inọ ñnyịn, mbaak ñnyịn idikpañña.”<verse eid="EXO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Moses amaabo ammọ ate, “Ikiifeghe ndịk. Abasi adi adidomo ndufo nse, nọ uteeñe Abasi aba ye ndufo, mbaak ndufo idikaiso inam idiọọkñkpọ.”<verse eid="EXO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Mbon awo ekesʌk eda nsan-nsan, ado Moses amaasaña akpere ukañ akpọsọñ ekịm, itie A-Abasi akebaaha.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Usọsọi Ñkpọ ye Mme Akpokoro Uwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel ate: ‘Ndufo emekịt ke idem ndufo ke ami mmetie ke anyọñ ntañ ikọ inọ ndufo: <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Ikiibot mme abasi indian miin; ikiibot abasi a-silfa me abasi a-kold.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />“ ‘Inam itieukpono ke ntanisọñ innọ miin, inyʌñ inam ufọfọb uwa ke ndo ye uwa ewuana, iwa mme edọñ, ebod ye ufene ndufo. Itie akeedodo a-ami nnịmme nọ adikpono anyịñ mmi, ami ñyaadidiọñ ndufo ke ndo. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />Adieke ndufo ebọppọ akpokoro uwa ke itiad ennọọ miin, ikiikama itiad e-ediọññọdiọñ ibọp, sia ndufo eyaesappa anye adieke ekamake ñkpọutom ediọñ anye. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Ñko ikiisaña ke mme utọukod idọọk akpokoro uwa mmi, mbaak idifʌkkọ ifed ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />Mme mbed a-anaaha afo aben anịm ke iso ammọ edo ami:<verse eid="EXO 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nditọufọk Hibru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />“Adieke afo adeppe ayịnufọk a-adooho awo Hibru, ana anye anam ñkpọ unọ fiin ke isua itiokeed. Ado ayọhọ isua itiaba, ana anye anyọñ, ikpeeghe utịb ndomokeed. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />Adieke anye asañake ikpọọñ adi, ana anye asaña ikpọọñ anyọñ; ado anye akpenie anwaan idaha anye adiighe, ana anwaan amọ asaña ye anye anyọñ. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Adieke eteufọk amọ anọọhọ anye anwaan, ndin anwaan ado aman nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan anọ anye, anwaan amọ ye nditọ ado ediinie eteufọk amọ, ndin awodeen ado ikpọọñ adiinyọñ.”<verse eid="EXO 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />“Ado adieke ayịnufọk ado abooho ate, ‘Ami mmema eteufọk mmi ye anwaan mmi ye nditọ mmi, ñnyʌññọ ñyem unyọñ,’ <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />ana eteufọk amọ aben anye aka iso mme abiideikpe. Ana eteufọk aben anye aka inuausʌñ me abọbọọk inuausʌñ, anyʌñ atịppe anye utọñ ke akuum. Ndin anye ayaado ayịnufọk amọ ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />“Adieke awo anyamma ayịn awonwaan amọ nte ayịnufọk, anye idiinyọññọ naña nditọufọk ideen esinyọñ. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />Adieke anye imiikanna inem eteufọk a-akemekke anye anọ idem amọ esịd, ana anye ayaak nọ efak anye esio. Eteufọk amọ inieghe unen adinyam anye nnọọ awo asenidịd, sia anye ikinamma akpanikọ ye etufọk amọ. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />Adieke eteufọk amọ adatta anye anọ ayịn amọ awodeen, ana anye anọ ayịnufọk ado unen nte amanaisọñ ayịn awonwaan. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />Adieke awodeen ado adọọhọ anwaan mfen, inaaha anye anyịm akpa anwaan ndidia, ye afọñidem ye unen ufọkndọ. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />Adieke eteufọk imiinọọhọ anwaan ado mme ñkpọ ita ami, anwaan ado a-anie unen adinyọñ, ikpeeghe akʌk ndomokeed.”<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asaña-Asaña Unọmọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />“Awo akeedodo atọọhọ awo akpọsọñ ita nọ awo ado akpa, ana ebiere ikpe ñkpa enọ anye. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />Ado, adieke awo imiifiọkkọfiọk inam, ado Abasi anam nọ atịppe, ana ammọ efeeñe eka itie se ami ndiinịm. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Ado adieke awo ndomokeed asịnne ñkara anyʌñ afọfiọk awot awo, ana eben utọ awo ado esio ke itieuwa mmi, enyʌñ ewot anye.”<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />“Ana ewot awo akeedodo a-anwanake ye ete me eka amọ.”<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />“Ana ewot awo akeedodo a-amʌmmọ awo mfen akedịp, me emaenyam awo e-ekemʌmmọ, me anye mmọdo asʌk aba ye awo se ikimʌm anye.”<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />“Ana ewot awo akeedodo a-asueñe ete me eka amọ.”<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18" />“Adieke mme awo enieghe utọk ndin awo keed atọ awo mfen ke itiad me akpọkkọ anye ke ubọk amọ ndin anye e-ekekpọkkọke ikpaaha ado anaa udọñọ ke ñkpana, <verse eid="EXO 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19" />awo a-aketọọhọ anye ita idiinieghe ubiomikpe adieke awo e-eketọọhọ ita adakkake ada anyʌñ asaña awuọ esiin ye esañ. Ado, awo a-akedueehe ana akpe utịb anọ awo e-ekenọọhọ unan ke ini se awo ado akebiat anyʌñ akịt abo ke idem a-asọñ awo ado afịd-afịd.”<verse eid="EXO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />“Awo ndomokeed akpemia afʌn awodeen me afʌn awonwaan amọ ke esañ ukwak, ndin ato ke ado afʌn ado akpa, ana emia anye ufen, <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />ado ammọ idotto ufen adieke afʌn ado akoppo nsọñidem ke ñkpọ nte usen keed me iba, sia afʌn ado adooho inie ammọ.”<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />“Adieke mme awo enwanake anwan eketuak awonwaan idịb ndin anye aman ayịn ke ini imiikemme, ado awo inọọhọ anye ekamba unan, awo se ikidue ana akpe utịb se ebe awonwaan ado ayem nọ anye akpe ye se esob enyịmme. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Ado adieke ekamba unọmọ abaaha, ana edat uwem ke uwem, <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />anyen aka ke anyen, eded aka ke eded, ubọk aka ke ubọk, ikpad aka ke ikpad, <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />unan ikañ aka ke unan ikañ, unan aka ke unan, anyenunan aka ke anyenunan.”<verse eid="EXO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />“Awo a-atuakka afʌn awodeen me afʌn awonwaan amọ anyen anyʌñ abiat anye anyen ana ayaak anye anyọñ nọ ado utịb anọ anye ke ntak anyen amọ. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />Awo a-atuakka eded afʌn awodeen me afʌn awonwaan amọ asio ana ayaak afʌn ado anyọñ ke ifuuro nọ ado utịb anọ anye ke ntak eded amọ.”<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />“Adieke ayaaraenañ atuakka awodeen me awonwaan awot, ana etọọñ ayaaraenañ ado ke itiad ewot, ndin inaaha eta unam amọ. Ado andinie ayaaraenañ ado idiinieghe ndudue. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Ñko, adieke ayaaraenañ ado asimaaha adituak awo ndin ado ke emaedọkkọ andinie, ndin andinie imʌmmọ anye iyịt itie keed, ndin anye akewot awodeen me awonwaan, ana etọọñ ayaaraenañ ado ewot enyʌñ ewot andinie anye ñko. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Ado, adieke ekọmudua awanake, ana andinie anye afakka idem amọ ke ekọmudua se eyem. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />Mbed ami ñko abọp adieke ayaaraenañ atuakka ayịn awodeen me ayịn awonwaan awot. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />Adieke ayaaraenañ atuakka afʌn awodeen me afʌn awonwaan, andinie ana akpe ekpad akʌk sekel silfa edịb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 345</char></note> mme duob anọ eteufọk a-anieghe afʌn ado, ndin ana etọọñ ayaaraenañ ado ke itiad ewot.”<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />“Adieke awo ndomokeed afʌkkọke ube se emaeketịppe me atịppeke ube ndin atre adifʌk anye, ndin abaakenañ me dọñki aduọ adʌk, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />awo a-aketịppeke ube ado ana akpe andinie unam ado ke ntakudua, anyʌñ aben adukpo unam ado ke usiene.<verse eid="EXO 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />“Adieke ayaaraenañ awo anọọhọ ayaaraenañ awo mfen unan ndin anye akpa, mme andinieñe ñyaaraenañ iba ado ana enyam ayaaraenañ andisʌhọ ke uwem enyʌñ ebakka akʌk ukem-ukem, emaana ebakka adukpo ayaaraenañ ado ñko ukem-ukem. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Ado, adieke ekediọọñọke ke ayaaraenañ ado amaasima adituai mme enañ mfen, ado andinie iyịtte anye ke abaenañ, andinie ana akpe unam ke unam, anyʌñ aben adukpo unam ke usiene.”<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ukpeme Inie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">22: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed mbon Hibru ewet Eksọdọs 22:1 nte Eksọdọs 21:37, ndin ewet Eksọdọs 2-31 nte Eksọdọs 22:1-30.</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />“Awo akeedodo a-ayịppe abaakenañ me edọñ anyʌñ awot anye me anyam anye ana akpe iwuod enañ ition anọ andinie abaakenañ, anyʌñ anọ iwuod edọñ inaañ ke edọñ ado.”<verse eid="EXO 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />“Adieke emʌmmọ inọ naña abom ufọk adʌk akonayio, ndin etịm enyʌñ etọọñ anye eta tutu anye akpa, mbon e-etịmme anye inieghe ndudue uduọk iyiib; <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />ado akpetịppe ke ayio amaasiere, awo a-atịmme anye a-adue ke uduọk iyiib.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:3">“Awo ndomokeed a-ayịppe ñkpọ ana akpe utịb, ado adieke ammọ imiinieghe ñkpọ ndomokeed, ana enyam ammọ edat ekpe utịb se ammọ ekeyịp. <verse eid="EXO 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" />Adieke ekịtte unam e-ekeyịppe ke uwem ke ubọk ammọ, me ado abaakenañ, me dọñki, me edọñ, ana ammọ ekpe akʌk akañ iba.”<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />“Adieke awo ndomokeed anọọhọ ufene amọ ndidia ke inwañ fain, ndin ayak anye adʌk inwañ awo mfen ata ñkpọ, awo a-adueehe ana anam ukpeutịb ke inwañ amọ andifọọn ñkpọ ñkañ.”<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />“Adieke ikañ abịppeke awuọ anyʌñ atara adʌk ikọd ndin ata mme mfịd inwañ, awo se ikitọọñọ ikañ ado ana akpe utịb.”<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />“Adieke awo anọọhọ mbọhọidʌñ amọ silfa me kold ate anịm inọ imọ, ndin ediyịp ke ufọk mbọhọidʌñ, ekpemʌm inọ ado, ana anye akpe utịb akañ iba. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Ado adieke awo imiikịtte inọ ado, andinie ufọk ana ada ikpe ke iso mme abiideikpe, ndin ammọ ana ebiere me andinie ufọk ado amaatuuk ubọk ke inie awo mfen. <verse eid="EXO 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />Ke afịd idaha ukwañ-ukwañ ukọ inie, nte abaakenañ, dọñki, edọñ, afọñ, me mme ñkpọ inie mfen a-anamma nọ awo abo ate, ‘Ake mmi ado ami,’ ibon iba ami ana eben mfịna ammọ edi iso mme abiideikpe. Awo a-mme abiideikpe ebooho ke a-adue ana akpe utịb akañ iba anọ awo anye ako.”<verse eid="EXO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />“Adieke awo ndomokeed anọọhọ mbọhọidʌñ amọ dọñki, abaakenañ, edọñ, me unam ndomokeed mfen ate adʌñ keed ndin ufene ado akpa, me adat unan, me ediyịp anye idaha a-awo ndomokeed imiikịtte, <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" />eyaekpe mfịna ke ufọọd ammọ ato ke adita unwọñọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mbo ke mbọhọidʌñ ado ikidatta ubọk amọ ituuk inie awo mfen. Andinie ñko ana anyịmme ntoro, ndin ukpeutịb idiiwanake. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Ado adieke adooho ekeyeeyịp unam ami eto mbọhọidʌñ, ana enam ukpeutịb enọ andinie. <verse eid="EXO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />Adieke adooho idiọọk unam afai akewai anye mbai-mbai, mbọhọidʌñ ado ana akoono mbai ado adi nte ñkpọ ntiense, ndin inaaha ebọ anye utịb ke unam se idiọọk unam afai akewai.”<verse eid="EXO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />“Adieke awo awuọdọ ufene ato mbọhọidʌñ amọ, ndin ufene ado adinie unan me adikpa ke idaha andinie imiibaaha, ana ammọ ekpe utịb. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Ado adieke andinie akebaaha ye mme ufene ado, awo andikiwuọt inieghe adikpe utịb. Adieke adooho ekebọ ufene ami ke ewuọd, akʌk ekekpeeghe ke ewuọd a-akem ke ntakudua ado.”<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewuana Ubiọñutom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />“Awodeen akpekpek adisịre abọikpa a-awo imiinọọhọ ke ndọ anyʌñ anaa ye anye, ana awodeen ado akpe akʌk ndọ iwuod amọ, ndin ana anye ado anwaan amọ. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />Adieke ete ayịn awonwaan ado asịnne adiyaak anye nnọọ awodeen ado ke ndọ, awodeen ado ana asʌk akpe akʌk ndọ ubọikpa i-imiidiọọñọke awodeen.”<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />“Ikiiyak abiamfa awonwaan adu uwem.”<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />“Ana ewot awo akeedodo a-anieghe ewuana ye unam.”<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />“Ana ewot awo akeedodo a-awaaha ñkpọ anọ abasi mfen ke imiibọhọke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />“Ikiifiomo, ikiinyʌñ ifiik asenawo, sia ndufo emaedo isenawo ke isọñ Iyib.”<verse eid="EXO 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />“Ikiifiik ebekpa me ayịnakpa. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />Adieke ndufo enamma ntom, ndin ammọ eseeme ennọ miin, ke akpanikọ, ami ñyaakop uyio ayịd ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />Iyadesịd mmi ayaademme, ndin ami ñyaiwot ndufo ke akañkañ. Ibaan ndufo eyaedoñño mme ebekpa, ndin nditọ ndufo eyaedoñño nditọakpa.”<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />“Adieke afo awuọdọ awo mmi keed ke atu ndufo a-abaaha ke unana akʌk, kuunam ado nte ndubeghe; kuubọọ anye udod. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />Adieke afo abọọhọ mbọhọidʌñ mfo afọñ ke ewuọd, ben sọk anye mbemiso utịn asakka, <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />sia ukweeñe afọñ ufʌkidem a-mbọhọidʌñ mfo anieghe adodo. Nsoo ndin ke ammọ ediidat ifʌhọ idaiya? Ammọ emaeseeme ennọ miin, ami ñyaakop, sia ami ñyọhọ ye mbọm.”<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />“Kuutañ idiọọk ikọ udian Abasi, kuunyʌñ usuuñọ mme andikara mbon ndufo.”<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />“Ikiimʌm mme enọ e-etooho inwañ, me itie unịm ukọd ndufo, me ikpọ abañ ukọd ikama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:29">“Ana ndufo ennọ miin akpa ayịn awodeen ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />Inam ukem ado ye mme enañ ye mme edọñ ndufo. Yak ammọ eba ye mme eka ammọ ke usen itiaba, ado iben ammọ insọk miin ke ayọhọ usen itiaita.”<verse eid="EXO 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" />“Ana ndufo edo mme ndisana awo mmi. Ke ntoro ikiita unam a-mme ndiọi unam ikọd ewotto; itop anye inọ mme ewa.”<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Mbed Unenikpe ye Mbọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />“Ikiisuan etob a-adooho nsu. Ikiinọọ awo a-anieghe ndudue unwam ke adido ntiense nsu.”<verse eid="EXO 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />“Ikiikeene atu awo ke adinam idiọọk. Imainọ ikọ ntiense ke esob, ikiikwaañ unen ke adikeene nda ye atu awo, <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />ikiinyʌñ inam adusad ye uweene ke itie ikpe.”<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />“Adieke ndufo ekịtte ayaaraenañ me dọñki awo usua ndufo naña asop usʌñ, nwam ke adiben anye nsọk andinie. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />Adieke ndufo ekịtte dọñki awo i-isuaha ndufo naña aduọ ye mbiomo amọ, ikiidakka ikpọñ anye; idomo ukeme adinwam anye.”<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />“Ikiinyịm mme uweene ndufo unen ubiideikpe ke mme ikpe ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Ikiinie ñkpọ ndomokeed adinam ye ukwañ ikpe, ikiinyʌñ iwot awo imiidueghe me awo akpanikọ, sia ami ndiisaanake awo adueghe ñyaak.”<verse eid="EXO 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />“Ikiibọọ ubọkedem, sia ubọkedem akekịm mme amọọnọ ñkpọ anyen, anyʌñ adukpakka ikọ mbon i-imiidueghe ñkpọ.”<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />“Ikiifiik awo asenidịd; ndufo ke idem ndufo emediọọñọ naña aba adido adidʌñ, sia ndufo ekedoñño mme adidʌñ ke Iyib.”<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Mbed Sabad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />“Ke isua itiokeed ana ndufo etọ inwañ ndufo enyʌñ edọk mme mfịd amọ, <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />ado ke ayọhọ isua itiaba iyak isọñ ana ukpọk, ke awo atọ ñkpọ. Ndin mme mbon unana ke atu ndufo ekeme adidat ndidia do ndia, ndin ndiọi unam ikọd ekeme idia ñkpọ se enyọñ ekpọñ. Inam ukem ado ye inwañ fain ndufo ye inwañ ọlif ndufo.”<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />“Ke usen itiokeed nam utom mfo, ado ke ayọhọ usen itiaba kuunam utom, yak ayaaraenañ mfo ye dọñki mfo ebọ nduọkadudu, nọ ifʌn a-amanake ke ufọk mfo ye awo asenidịd a-adʌññọ ye afo amaana anie nsọọñọidem.”<verse eid="EXO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />“Ikpeme adinam afịd mme ñkpọ se ami ntañ inọọ ndufo. Ikiitommo anyịñ abasi mfen; ikiiyak ekop ammọ ke inua ndufo.”<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Usọrọ Ita E-Enamma kwa Isua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />“Akañ ita ke isua, ana ndufo enam usọrọ ennọ miin.”<verse eid="EXO 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />“Inam Usọrọ Uyo a-yiis imiisịneke. Ke usen itiaba, ita uyo a-yiis imiisịneke, kpa naña ami ñkitemme ndufo. Inam ami ke asaña-asaña ini ke afiọñ Afif, sia ke afiọñ ado ke ndufo ekewuọọñọ ke isọñ Iyib.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:15">“Inaaha awo ndomokeed asaña ubọk ñkaña adi iso mmi.<verse eid="EXO 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />“Inam Usọrọ Idọk ye mme akpa mfịd a-ndufo eketọọhọ ke inwañ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:16">“Inam Usọrọ Mboho ke utịd isua, ke idaha a-ndufo etañña mfịd ndufo ke inwañ.<verse eid="EXO 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />“Akañ ita ke isua, afịd ideen ana edi iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara.<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />“Kuunam uwa a-asañake ye iyiib unnọọ miin ye ñkpọ se isịne yiis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:18">“Inaaha enịm akpọñ e-enọọhọ ke mme usọrọ mmi tutu ayio asiere.<verse eid="EXO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />“Ben mme akpa mfịd mfo se ifọọn ikan a-atooho isọñ inwañ mfo di nịm ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">“Kuutem ñyịn ebod ke mmọọñeba eka amọ.<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enyere Abasi Ayaadiọñ Usʌñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />“Ami mmedọñ enyere nọ ibem ndufo iso, ikpeme ndufo ke usʌñ, anyʌñ iben ndufo akesịm itie a-ami ñkebeeñeke nnịm. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Ikpañ utọñ inọ anye, inyʌñ ikop se anye atañ. Ikiisọñ iwuod ye anye; sia anye idiifeene nsọñiwuod ndufo, koro anye ado isʌñutom mmi. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Adieke ndufo etʌmmọ ekpañ utọñ enọọ se anye atañ, enyʌñ enam afịd se ami atañ, ami ñyaado asua nnọ mbon usua ndufo, ñnyʌñ nnam mfịna ye mbon e-enamma mfịna ye ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />Mme enyere mmi eyaeboiyo iso inọ ndufo, enyʌñ iben ndufo ekaa ke isọñ mbon Amọọ, Hed, Peris, Kenan, Hif ye Yebus, ndin ami ñyaakwokko ammọ nsio ke iso isọñ. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />Ikiinʌhọ inọọ mme abasi ammọ, ikiinyʌñ ikpono ammọ, me adikeene edu unam ñkpọ ammọ. Ana ndufo ewuut ammọ, enyʌñ eboom mme itiad itieuwa ammọ mbai-mbai. <verse eid="EXO 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />Ikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, ndin adidiọñ amọ ayaaba ke ndidia ndufo ye mmọọñ ndufo. Ami ñyaaben udọñọ mfep ke atu ndufo, <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />ndin idịb idiiwuọñọke awo ndomokeed; ada idinyʌññọ iba ke isọñ ndufo. Ami ñyainọ ndufo ayọhọ isua uwem.<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />“Ami ñyaadọñ ñkpọ ndịk ibem ndufo iso, ñnyʌñ nsịn ndutịme ke afịd mme idịd se ndufo esoobo. Ami ñyaanam afịd mme asua ndufo ekappa edem efeeñe. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />Ami ñyaadọñ akwọọk ibem ndufo iso ekebịn mme Hif, mbon Kenan ye mbon Hed esio ke usʌñ ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Ado ami ndiibịneke ammọ nsio ke isua keed, sia isọñ ayaakappa anaa ukpọk ndin mme ndiọi unam ikọd ediwak ikan ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Ami ndiibịn ammọ usʌk-usʌk nsio ke iso ndufo, tutu ndufo ediwak ekem se eben isọñ ado enie.<verse eid="EXO 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />“Ami ñyaasịn adaña ndufo tọọñọ ke Ndad-ndad Akpainyañ tutu akesịm Akpainyañ Mediterenia ake Filistia, ndin tọọñọ ke akpautatan tutu akesịm Inyañ Yufretis. Ami ñyaiyaak ndufo nsịn ke ubọk mbon e-edʌññọ ke isọñ ado, ndin ndufo eyaebịn ammọ esio ke iso ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Ikiinam edioomo ye ammọ, me ye mme abasi ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />Ikiiyak ammọ edʌñ ke isọñ ndufo, imiidooho ntoro ammọ eyaenam ndufo enam idiọọkñkpọ, sia ukpono abasi ammọ ayaakappa ado afia inọ ndufo.”<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s1">Esọọñọ Edioomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Dọọk di mbịne miin, afo ye Erọn, Nadab ye Abihu, ye ñkpisọñ Isrel ata mme duob. Ana ndufo eda nsan-nsan eñkpono miin, <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />ado Moses ikpọọñ ana asaña akpere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; mbon ako inaaha esaña ekpere. Ndin mme awo inaaha esaña ye anye edọọk edi.”<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Ke ini Moses akedọkkọke mme awo afịd ikọ ye mme mbed se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ, ammọ emaebọọrọ ke uyio keed, “Afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ñnyịn iyainam.” <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Akema, Moses amaawet afịd ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ. Anye amaabak ademme edem usen, anyʌñ akebọp akpokoro uwa ke idak ekamba abod, anyʌñ abono itiad duob mme iba a-adaaha anọ esiin Isrel duob mme iba. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Ndin anye amaadọñ ñkparawa Isrel ate ewa ufọfọb uwa, enyʌñ ewa ñyịn ayaaraenañ nte ñkpọ ewuana uwa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Moses amaaben ubaak iyiib ado adọñ ke mme bọwịd, anyʌñ aben ibio asịppe ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Akema, anye amaaben Ñwed Edioomo akoot anọ mbon awo. Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Ñnyịn iyainam afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ; ñnyịn iyaikop item.”<verse eid="EXO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Ndin Moses amaaben iyiib ado asịppe mme awo ke idem, anyʌñ abo, “Ami ado iyiib edioomo ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anamma ye ndufo naña asaña ye afịd mme ikọ ami.”<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Moses ye Erọn, Nadab ye Abihu, ye afịd ñkpisọñ ata mme duob ke Isrel emaedọọk ekaa anyọñ <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />enyʌñ ekekịt Abasi Isrel. Ke idak ukod amọ ñkpọ amaaba nte mbood e-enamma ke nsọñudua itiad lapis lasuli, ayamma nte bru ikpaanyọñ. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Ado Abasi ikibenneke ubọk amọ inọmọ mme adadusʌñ Isrel; ammọ emaekịt Abasi, ndin ammọ emaedia enyʌñ enwọñ.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Dọọk di mbịne miin ke anyọñ ekamba abod, nyʌñ ba mi, ndin ami ñyaunọ fiin itiadñwed a-adọñọke mbed ye mme ewʌhọ a-ami ñwette nnọ ammọ nọ ekama ekpeep ñkpọ.”<verse eid="EXO 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Akem Moses amaadakka awuọ ye Yọsua nsañautom amọ, ndin amaadọọk akaa abod Abasi. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Anye amaabo mme ñkpisọñ, “Ida mmi ibet ñnyịn tutu ñnyịn itịmme ibịne ndufo. Erọn ye Họọ mmọdo eba ye ndufo, ndin awo akeedodo a-anieghe mfịna akeme adibịne ammọ.”<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" />Ke ini Moses akedọọhọ akaa anyọñ ekamba abod, ntọñanyọñ amaafʌk anyọñ abod, <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />ndin ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadoro ke Abod Sainai. Ke usen itiokeed ntọñ amaafʌk abod, ndin ke ayọhọ usen itiaba <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakoot Moses ato ntọñanyọñ. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />Ke anyen nditọ Isrel, ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeba nte ikañ a-ataaha ñkpọ ke anyọñ abod. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Ndin Moses amaadʌk ntọñanyọñ naña anye akedọọkọ anyọñ ekamba abod. Ndin anye amaaba ke anyọñ ekamba abod ke usen aba ye akonayio aba.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Enọ A-anieghe Tabanakịd Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel ate ammọ eben enọ ensọk miin. Ana afo abọ enọ annọ miin ato afịd awo se esịd ammọ adọkkọ ammọ ebo enọ.<verse eid="EXO 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />“Anyem ado mme enọ a-anaaha afo abọ ato ammọ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 25:3" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 25:3">“kold, silfa, ye brọns; <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />bru, iduod-iduod ye ndad-ndad udʌk ye eti linen;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 25:4">ided ebod;<verse eid="EXO 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />mme ikpa akukịmedọñ e-enamma nọ ado ndad-ndad ye eti uduud ikpa mfen a-asọññọ idem;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 25:5">ye eto akasia;<verse eid="EXO 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />adan ọlif se edat edomo ikañ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 25:6">mme anemufịk ñkpọ ake adan adidiọñ ye anemufịk insensi;<verse eid="EXO 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />mme nsọñudua itiad ọniks ye mme nsọñudua nsem-nsem itiad a-anaaha edot ke itie afọñ aboditọñ ye afọñ ikpanesịd.<verse eid="EXO 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />“Ndin nam nọ ammọ ebọp adisana itie ennọ miin, ndin ami ñyaadʌñ ye ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />Nam tabanakịd ye afịd ñkpọ mbanaidem amọ aba ukem-ukem naña ami nduuwọt fiin.<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akebe Edioomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />“Nam ammọ ebọp akebe edioomo ke eto akasia, ubaak kubid iba mme ubaak ke unyọọñ, kubid keed mme ubaak ke ubom, ndin kubid keed mme ubaak ke ukoñ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 3 3/4 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 2 1/4 ke ukpa ye unyọọñ me ñkpọ nte mita 1.1 ke unyọọñ ye sentimita 68 ke ukpa ye unyọọñ; ntoro ñko ke Eksọdọs 25:17</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Bana anye idem ke ataa eti kold, ke esịd ye ke anyọñ, ndin bod ñkpọ ke kold kanna anye. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Bot ikara kold inaañ nọ anye, nyʌñ kọọp ammọ ke ukod amọ inaañ, ñkpannuun iba ke ukod keed ye iba mfen ke ukod anye ako. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Ndin nam mboi ke eto akasia nyʌñ fʌk kold ke idem ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Wuuk mme ukwak ami kanna mme ikara mbeñ akebe edioomo nọ ado se ediikan iben anye. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Mme mboi itiad ami ana eba ke mme ikara akebe edioomo; inaaha nte esio ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />Ndin sịn mme itiadñwed mbed a-ami ndiinọ ndufo ke akebe edioomo.<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />“Nam ufʌkñkpọ itie ñkpeubọk ke eti kold, kubid iba mme ubaak ke unyọọñ ye kubid keed mme ubaak ke ubom. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Nyʌñ nam serubim iba sio ke kold e-etịmmetịm nịm ke edem itie ufʌkñkpọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Nam serub keed ke ukañ edem keed ye serub iba ke edem ukan uko; nam serubim ke ñkañ ikpeghe keed ye ufʌkñkpọ ke naña edem iba. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Ana mme serubim etaara mba ammọ ekaa anyọñ, enyʌñ efʌk mme ufʌkñkpọ ami ye mba ammọ. Mme serubim ami ana esak iso ese emọ-emọ, ese ukañ ufʌkñkpọ ami. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Dot ukʌb ke anyọñ akebe edioomo, nyʌñ sịn mme itiadñwed mbed edioomo a-ami ndiinọ ndufo ke akebe edioomo. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />Ke anyọñ ukʌb ke ñkpufañ itie serubim iba a-abaaha ke akebe edioomo mbed, ami ñyausoobo fiin ñnyʌñ unọ fiin afịd mme ewʌhọ mmi nọ afo anọ nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpokoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />“Nam akpokoro ke eto akasia, kubid iba ke unyọọñ, kubid keed ke ukpa, ye kubid keed ye ubaak ke ukoñ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 3, ikpad 1 1/2 ke ukpa ye ikpad 2 1/4 ke unyọọñ, sentimita 45 ke ukpa ye sentimita 68 ke unyọọñ.</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Fʌk anye ke ataa eti kold, nyʌñ bot anye kanna ke kold. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Ñko bot kanna mben inua amọ ñkpọ nte ayọhọ ekpaubọk keed,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte sentimita 7.5</char></note> nyʌñ sịn kold e-ebotto ke mbad ke mben amọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Nam ikara kold inaañ nọ akpokoro ado, nyʌñ bọp ammọ dian ke mbañ ukod amọ inaañ. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Mme ikara ado ana eba ekpere mben inua nọ emʌm mme ukwak edatta eben akpokoro ado ekama. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Nam mme eto akasia, fʌk ammọ ye kold, nyʌñ ben akpokoro ado dian ye ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Nam mme usan ye ñkpọ usịn ndidia ammọ edo ataa eti kold, ukem ado ye mme atu ye mme bọwịd usịn enọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />Sịn Uyo Iso Abasi ke akpokoro ado nọ aba ke iso mmi afịd ini.<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpọ Udod Utuenikañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />“Nam ñkpọ udod utuenikañ ke ataa eti kold. Mia idak ye mbañ amọ sio di, nyʌñ nam anye aba nte mme kọọb e-ebotto ke mbid ñkpokpoñ, ye mme emịne amọ ke eboho keed. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Ñkọk itiokeed ana etara eto ukañ itie udod utuenikañ ita ke ñkañ keed, ita ke ñkañ mfen. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Mme kọọb ita e-enamma ke mbid ñkpokpoñ mmansañ mbakara, ye mme emịne ye mme eboho ñkpokpoñ enie adiba ke ñkọk keed, ita ke ñkọk mfen, ndin ukem ado ke afịd ñkọk itiokeed, etara ewuọ eto udod utuenikañ. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Ndin ke itie udod utuenikañ ana kọọb inaañ e-ebaaha nte ñkpokpoñ mmansañ mbakara a-ayọhọke ye mme emịne ye mme eboho ñkpokpoñ eba. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Emịne keed adiiba ke idak akpa ñkọk a-atarake akesịm itie udod utuenikañ, ayọhọ emịne iba ke idak ayọhọ ñkọk iba, ndin ayọhọ mfịd ita ke idak ayọhọ ita, ñkọk itiokeed ke afịd. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Mme emịne ye mme ñkọk ana edo eboho keed ye udod utuenikañ, e-ekamake ataa eti kold enam.<verse eid="EXO 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />“Ndin nam mme utuenikañ amọ itiaba, nyʌñ dot ammọ ke anyọñ nọ ammọ eyamma enọ unwana ke iso ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Mme ufadñkpọ afọñ utuenikañ ye nainai amọ ana edo ataa eti kold. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Ana edat talen ataa nsọñudua eti kold keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 34</char></note> enam ñkpọ udod utuenikañ ye afịd mme ñkpọ mbanaidem ami. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />Kịt bo ke amenam afịd ñkpọ aba ukem-ukem naña ekuwọt ke anyọñ ekamba abod.<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s1">Tabanakịd Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />“Nam nọ tabanakịd anie afọñ ikpeghe duob ke ataa uyaiya afọñ linen etuakkatuak ye bru afọñ, iduod-iduod ye ndad-ndad udʌk, ndin yak ata adiọọñọ utom anyʌñ adọk serubim asịn ke esịd ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Ana afịd mme afọñ ikpeghe edo ukem-ukem, anyọọñ ñkpọ nte kubid edịb mme itiaita ye kubid inaañ ke ukpa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 42 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 6 ke ukpa me ñkpọ nte mita 13 ke unyọọñ ye mita 1.8 ke ukpa</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Kịm afịd afọñ ikpeghe ition ami, nyʌñ nam ukem ado ye mme ition ako. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />Nam bru udʌk ke afọñ nọ asaña ke mben utịd afọñ ikpeghe ke afañ keed. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />Nam ekpək udʌk aba mme duob ke afọñ ikpeghe keed nyʌñ nam aba mme duob mfen ke utịd afọñ ikpeghe anye ako, yak mme udʌk enyʌñ eduseere emọ-emọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Ndin nam ekọb aba mme duob ke kold, nyʌñ dat ammọ mʌm mme afọñ ikpeghe ami dian keed nọ tabanakịd Abasi ado eboho keed.<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />“Ben ided ebod nam afọñ ikpeghe nọ atayad itie tabanakịd; afịd ana ado duob mme keed. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Afịd mme afọñ ikpeghe duob mme keed ami ana edo ukem-ukem, enyọọñ kubid edịb mme duob enyʌñ edo kubid inaañ ke ukpa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 45 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 6 ke ukpa me ñkpọ nte mita 13.5 ke unyọọñ ye mita 1.8 ke ukpa</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Ben afọñ ikpeghe ition dian itie keed, nyʌñ dian mme itiokeed ako ke itie keed. Fʌt ayọhọ afọñ ikpeghe itiokeed ke itie iba nịm ke iso atayad. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Nam ñkpaha aba mme duob ke mben afọñ ikpeghe ami ke itie keed ye ke mben utịd afọñ ikpeghe ke itie keed ñko. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />Ndin nam ekọb brọns aba mme duob, nyʌñ sịn ammọ ke udʌk, nọ amʌm atayad akama itie keed. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Ke abaña ñyọhọnsʌhọ afọñ ikpeghe, ibio afọñ ikpeghe se isʌhọ ana ekọp anye esuuk ke utịd mben tabanakịd. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Afọñ ikpeghe tabanakịd ana ado kubid keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 1 1/2 me mita 45</char></note> ke afịd mbañ iba; se isʌhọ ana akọbọ akanna mbañ tabanakịd nọ afʌk anye. <verse eid="EXO 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />Nam ufʌkñkpọ e-ekamake ided akukịmedọñ e-enyiine ke akukịn nọ anyen ado ndad-ndad nọ atayad ami. Ke akanna ado, dot ufʌkñkpọ a-adooho ataa eti uduud ikpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ke Eksọdọs 25:5</char></note> se isọñ idem ke anye.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />“Nam nnen-nnen abọbọọk usʌñ ke eto akasia nọ tabanakịd<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 15 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 2 1/4 ke ukpa me ñkpọ nte mita 4.5 ke unyọọñ ye sentimita 68 ke ukpa</char></note>. <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Abọbọọk usʌñ keedekeed ana ado kubid duob ke unyọọñ ye kubid keed mme ibio ke ukpa; <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />nam nọ afịd iba ese emọ-emọ. Nam afịd mme mboi tabanakịd ke utọ usʌñ ami. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />Nam abọbọọk udọk edịb nọ usʌñ ukañ usuuk tabanakịd, <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" />ndin nam itiad idakisọñ aba ke silfa nọ ammọ, iba ke ñkan keed, keed ke idak anye ako. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />Ke mben uko, ke ukañ anyọñ-anyọñ tabanakịd, nam mboi edịb <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />ye silfa idakisọñ aba, iba ke idak abọbọọk keed. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Nam mboi itiokeed nọ utịd-utịd uko, a-adooho ukañ usobutịn tabanakịd, <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />nyʌñ nam eto abọbọọk iba nọ inuuk utịd uko. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Ke mme inuuk iba ami, ana ammọ edo iba-iba tọọñọ ke idak isọñ tutu akewuọ anyọñ, anyʌñ afaha ke ikara adu keed; naña iba ediiba ntoro. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Ke ntoro eto abọbọọk itiaita ye itiad idakisọñ ke silfa duob mme itiokeed ediiba, iba ke idak abọbọọk keedekeed.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />“Nam kpa ukem ado nọ mme eto anyenusʌñ ke eto akasia: Abọbọọk usʌñ ition ke ñkañ tabanakịd keed, <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />ition anọ mbon uko, ye ition ke mboi edem ukañ usobutịn, ke ukañ ataa utịd-utịd tabanakịd ami. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Eto ufọọd abọọk usʌñ ana atara ato ukañ keed akewuọ ukañ mfen ke ufọọd mboi ami. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Fʌk mme mboi ami ke kold, nyʌñ nam ikara kold nọ amʌm mme eto anyọñusʌñ akama. Ndin kama kold fʌk mme eto anyọñusʌñ.<verse eid="EXO 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />“Nam tabanakịd aba naña ekuwọt fiin ke anyọñ ekamba abod.<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />“Nam ata adiọọñọ ubọkutom anam afọñ ikpeghe ke bru, iduod-iduod ye ndad-ndad udʌk ye ataa eti linen, anyʌñ adọk serubim asịn ke esịd ado. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Kọọñ anye ke ekọp kold ke mboi inuausʌñ inaañ eto akasia e-edotto kold, anyʌññọ ada ke idak silfa inaañ. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />Kọọñ mme afọñ anyenusʌñ ke ekọp, ndin nịm akebe edioomo mbed ke edem itie afọñ ikpeghe. Afọñ ikpeghe ana ayaabakka Adisana Itie asio ke Ataa Adisana Itie. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />Sin afọñ ufʌkñkpọ mbanaidem ke akebe edioomo mbed ke Itie Andisana Ñkan. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Nịm akpokoro ke esiin itie afọñ ikpeghe ke anyọñ-anyọñ ukañ tabanakịd, ndin sịn udod utuenikañ ke nsakiso amọ ke ñkañ usuuk-usuuk.<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />“Ke ntondʌk itie atayad, nam afọñ ikpeghe ke bru, ke iduod-iduod ye ke ndad-ndad udʌk ye ataa eti linen, utom awo a-adọkkọ afọñ. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Nam ekọb ke kold nọ afọñ ikpeghe ami ye adaaha eto akasia ition e-ekamake kold efʌk. Ndin dot itiad idakisọñ ition ke brọns nọ ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s1">Akpokoro Ufọfọb Uwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />“Kama adukpọk eto akasia bọp akpokoro uwa, kubid ita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 4 1/2 me ñkpọ nte mita 1.4</char></note> ke unyọọñ. Ana anie mbañ inaañ, kubid ition ke anyan ye kubid ition ke ukpa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 7 1/2 me ñkpọ nte mita 2.3</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />Nam nnʌk nịm ke afịd inuuk inaañ ado, nọ mme nnʌk ye akpokoro uwa edo keed, nyʌñ fʌk akpokoro uwa ke brọns. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Nam nọ afịd ñkpoduoho amọ ado brọns: Mme ako amọ nọ ekama esio ntọñ, mme udọk amọ, mme bọwịd usiime mmọọñ, mme akuum ukịm unam ye mme akpañkpañ ufraññkpọ. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Nam akuọk nọ anye, ñkpọ brọns, nyʌñ nam ikara ke brọns ke afịd inuuk ntondʌk usʌñ amọ. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />Sin anye ke idak eto akpokoro uwa, nọ anye ado mbakka iba ke ñkan anyọñ akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />Nam mboi eto akasia nọ akpokoro uwa, nyʌñ dat brọns fʌk ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />Ana esịn mme mboi ado ke mme ikara nọ ammọ eba ke mben ñkañ akpokoro uwa iba idaha ediiben anye. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Nam nọ akpokoro uwa anie ekamba ufañ, awuọ ada ke mme adukpọk. Ana anam anye ukem naña ekuwọt fiin ke anyọñ ekamba abod.<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esịd Akwere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />“Bọp esịd akwere nọ tabanakịd Abasi. Edem ukañ usuuk adiido kubid ikie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 150 me ñkpọ nte mita 45; se ke Eksọdọs 27:11</char></note> ke unyọọñ, ndin mme afọñ anyenusʌñ amọ ana ado ataa eti udọdọk linen, <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />ye mboi edịb ye brọns edịb ke idak, ndin ye mme ekọb silfa ye mme idiọọñọ ke mboi amọ. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Ukañ anyọñ-anyọñ ñko ana ado kubid ikie ke unyọọñ, ndin ana anie mme afọñ ikpeghe, ye mboi edịb ye brọns edịb ke idak, ye mme ekọp silfa ye mme idiọọñọ ke mboi ami.<verse eid="EXO 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />“Utịd ukañ usobutịn esịd akwere ana ado kubid aba mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 75 me ñkpọ nte mita 23; se ke Eksọdọs 27:13</char></note> ke ukpa, anyʌñ anie afọñ ikpeghe, ye adaaha duob ye idakisọñ duob ñko. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Ke edem usakkautịn, ke ukañ u-utịn asitooho asakka, esịd akwere ana ado kubid aba mme duob ñko ke ukpa. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14" />Mme afọñ ikpeghe enyọọñọ kubid duob mme ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 23 me ñkpọ nte mita 6.8; se ke <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 27:15">Eksọ 27:15</ref></char></char></note> ana eba ke ntondʌk, ye adaaha ita ye idakisọñ ita ñko. <verse eid="EXO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15" />Mme afọñ ikpeghe kubid duob mme ition ke unyọọñ ana eba ke mbeñ uko, ye adaaha ita ye idakisọñ ita.<verse eid="EXO 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />“Ke ntondʌk esịd akwere, yịt afọñ ikpeghe a-adooho kubid edịb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 30 me ñkpọ nte mita 9</char></note> ke unyọọñ, yak ado bru, ye iduod-iduod, ye ndad-ndad udʌk ye ataa eti afọñ linen edọkkọdọk, utom awo andidọk ñkpọ, ye eto adaaha inaañ ye idakisọñ inaañ. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Afịd mme abọbọọk usʌñ e-ebaaha ke esịd akwere ana enie idiọọñọ silfa ye mme ekọb, ye brọns ke idak. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Esịd akwere ana ado kubid ikie ke unyọọñ, anyʌñ ado kubid aba mme duob ke ukpa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 150 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 75 ke ukpa me ñkpọ nte mita 45 ke unyọọñ ye mita 23 ke ukpa</char></note> ye ataa eti afọñ linen a-adooho kubid ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 7 1/2 me ñkpọ nte mita 2.3</char></note> ke anyan, ye mme brọns nte itiad ke idak amọ. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Afịd mme ñkpọ mfen se edat enam utom ke tabanakịd, se ikpidodo se edat ammọ enam, tutu asịm afịd mme eto mboi atayad ye ake mme esịd akwere, ana edo ke brọns.<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adan Utuenikañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />“Nọ nditọ Isrel ewʌhọ bo nọ edat adan a-atarake, enyịmmeke esio ke ọlif edi, se edat edomo ikañ nọ mme utuenikañ esak afịd ini. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />Ke atayad mbono, ke anwa ikpeghe itie a-afʌkkọ akebe edioomo mbed enwọñọ, Erọn ye nditọ amọ ideen ana enam nọ utuenikañ akaka iso asak ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> tọọñọ ke ndubiayio tutu ubakusen. Ami ana ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ ke ufọọd nditọ Isrel ke afịd emana se idiidi.<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s1">Afọñ Mme Aku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />“Nam eben Erọn, ayịneka mfo usọk fiin ke atu nditọ Isrel, ye nditọ amọ ideen, Nadab ye Abihu, Eliasa ye Itama, nọ ammọ enam ñkpọ ennọ miin nte mme aku. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />Nam mme ndisana afọñ nọ ayịneka mfo, Erọn, nọ anọ anye uku ye ukpono. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />Dọkkọ afịd mme anam mfọọn ubọkutom a-ami ñkenọọhọ ifiọk ke utọ usʌñ ami ate ammọ enam mme afọñ enọ Erọn, ke udodubọk amọ, nọ anye adiinam ñkpọ innọ miin nte aku. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Mme afọñ se ammọ ana enam ado ami: Afọñ ikpanesịd, afọñ aboditọñ, ewịra, udọdọk afọñ, afọñiwuod, ye udʌkisịn. Ana ammọ enam mme ndisana afọñ ami enọ ayịneka mfo, Erọn, ye nditọ ideen amọ, nọ ammọ ediinam ñkpọ innọ miin nte mme aku. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Ana ammọ edat kold, ye bru, iduod-iduod, ye ndad-ndad udʌk, ye eti linen enam mme afọñ ado.<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afọñ Aboditọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />“Nam afọñ aboditọñ ke kold, ye ke bru, ye iduod-iduod, ye ndad-ndad udʌk, ye ake eti linen ewaññawañ, utom mme anam mfọọn ubọkutom. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Ana anie afọñ afara iba ke inuuk amọ iba, nọ ekan emʌm anye eyịt. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Mfọọn udọdọk mbọbọisịn amọ ana aba ukem ntoro, ado keed ye afọñ aboditọñ, enyʌñ enam ke kold, ye ke bru, ye ke iduod-iduod, ye ke ndad-ndad udʌk, ye ke eti uwawañ linen.<verse eid="EXO 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />“Dat itiad ọniks iba nyʌñ kap anyịñ nditọ ideen Isrel sịn ke ammọ <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />akeene naña eketo emana, anyịñ itiokeed ke itiad keed, ndin itiokeed ke itiad anye ako. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />Kap mme anyịñ nditọ ideen Isrel sịn ke mme itiad iba ami ukem usʌñ naña mme akabitiad esinam ye ufiikñkpọ. Ndin dot mme itiad ami ke uyaiya akpasa kold, <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />nyʌñ tobo ammọ yịt ke udʌk afara afọñ aboditọñ nte itiad ñkpọ aditoiyo anọ nditọ ideen Isrel. Erọn ana abiom mme anyịñ ami ke afara amọ nte ñkpọ aditoiyo anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />Nam uyaiya akpasa udọññkpọ ke eti kold daaha, <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />ye ekọb ukwak iba edọkkọdọk ke ataa eti kold, nte udʌk, nyʌñ ben udʌk ukwak yịt ke ñkpọ ado.<verse eid="EXO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afọñ Ikpanesịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />“Mme anam mfọọn ubọkutom ana enam afọñ ikpanesịd se ekama ebiere ñkpọ. Nam nọ anye aba nte afọñ aboditọñ. Ana enam ke kold, ye bru, ye iduod-iduod, ye ndad-ndad, ye eti linen ewaññawañ. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />Ana ado mbañinaañ, span<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte sentimita 23</char></note> keed ke unyọọñ ye span keed ke ukpa, ñko enyʌñ ekpañ anye ndodiba. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Ndin dot udịm nsọñudua itiad inaañ ke anye. Akpa udịm ana ado kanelian, krisolaid ye beril; <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />ayọhọ udịm iba ana ado tọkwọis, lapis lasuli ye emeraal; <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />ayọhọ udịm ita ana ado yasịn, akate ye ametis; <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />ayọhọ udịm inaañ ana ado topas, ọniks ye yaspa. Doot ammọ ke mme uyaiya akpasa kold udoodñkpọ. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Ana ado itiad duob mme iba, keed ada anọ mme anyịñ nditọ ideen Isrel keed, ekap ammọ keedekeed nte ufiikñkpọ ye ukem anyịñ esiin duob mme iba.<verse eid="EXO 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />“Yak edọk afọñ ikpanesịd ke ataa eti kold, nte udʌk. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Nam ikara kold iba nọ ekọp ammọ ke inuuk afọñ ikpanesịd iba ado. <verse eid="EXO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />Kọp kold ukwak iba ado ke ikara inuuk afọñ ikpanesịd ado, <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />ndin yịt utịd ukwak ukañ uko dian ke abai iba, tobo ammọ dian ke afara ye afọñ aboditọñ ke iso. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Nam kold iba ikara-ikara, nyʌñ bọọp ammọ ke inuuk iba ako ke itie afọñ ikpanesịd ke ukañ esịd-esịd ako a-akpereke afọñ aboditọñ. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Maana nam ikara kold iba, nyʌñ yịt ammọ ke idak afara ke ñkañ iso afọñ aboditọñ, a-akpereke itie e-eketoboke udʌk ke anyọñ mbọbọisịn afọñ aboditọñ. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Ana etobo mme ikara afọñ ikpanesịd ado edian ye ikara afọñ aboditọñ ke bru udʌk, edat anye ekesịm isịn, mbaak afọñ ikpanesịd adifakka awuọ ke afọñ aboditọñ.<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />“Ini keed akeedodo ake Erọn adʌkkọ Adisana Itie, ana anye adian anyịñ nditọ Isrel ke esịd amọ ke afọñ ikpanesịd e-ekamake enam ubiere nte ñkpọ ñkaiso aditoiyo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />Ñko sịn Urim ye Tumịm ke idak afọñ ikpanesịd, nọ ammọ edoro ke esịd Erọn ini keed akeedodo a-anye adʌkkọ iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ke ntoro Erọn adiisikọñọ mme ñkpọ e-edatta enam ubiere enọ nditọ Isrel ke ikpanesịd amọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> afịd ini.<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Afọñ Aku Mfen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />“Nam udʌk afọñ aboditọñ ado bru afịd-afịd, <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />ye adu ke ufọọd iwuod ado. Ana edọdọk mben ado nte itọñafọñ ekanna itie adu ado, mbaak anye adiwakka. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Nam mme kpomekrened ke bru, iduod-iduod ye ndad-ndad udʌk kanna mben afọñ ado, ye mme ñkanika kold ke ufọọd ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />Mme ñkanika kold ye mme kpomekrened ana edukpuuñọ itie ammọ ekanna mben afọñ ami. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Erọn ana asịne anye ke ini anye anamma uwa. Ana emia ñkanika ke ini anye adʌkkọ Adisana Itie ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke ini anye awuọọhọ, mbaak anye adikpa.<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />“Nam usan ke ataa kold, nyʌñ mịñ mme ikọ ami nte ufiikñkpọ ke esịd amọ:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="EXO 28:36">
    <char style="sc">Ado Adisana Anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.</char><verse eid="EXO 28:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />Tobo bru ekpək ke anye nọ eyịt anye ke afọñiwuod; ana aba ke iso afọñiwuod. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />Anye adiiba ke akpọiso Erọn, ndin anye adiibiom ndudue a-asịneke ke adisana enọ a-nditọ Isrel ediinọ, se ikpidodo se ammọ enọ. Adiiba ke akpọiso Erọn afịd ini nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akop inem adibọ mme enọ ado.<verse eid="EXO 28:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />“Dọk afọñ idakidem ke eti linen nyʌñ nam afọñiwuod ke eti linen. Udʌkisịn ana ado ubọkutom mbon udọk afọñ. <verse eid="EXO 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />Nam mme afọñ idakidem, mme udʌkisịn, itam nditọ Erọn nọ anọ ammọ uku ye ukpono. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />Umausịn ayịneka mfo Erọn ye nditọ amọ ideen mme afọñ ami uma, yet ammọ adan nyʌñ dot ammọ ubọk. Diọñ ammọ nọ ammọ enam ñkpọ ennọ miin nte mme aku.<verse eid="EXO 28:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />“Nam afọñ idakidem ke linen se ekama efʌk idem, atọọñọ ke isịn tutu asịm ifʌkkọ. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Erọn ye nditọ amọ ideen ana esịne ammọ ini keed akeedodo a-ammọ edʌkkọ atayad mbono, me esañake ekpere akpokoro uwa adinam uwa ke Adisana Itie, mbaak ammọ ediben ndudue enyʌñ ekpañña.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 28:43">“Ami adido nsi-nsi ewʌhọ inọ Erọn ye ubon amọ.<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s1">Adidiọñ Mme Aku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />“Se ana nte afo anam ado ami ke adidiọñ ammọ, nọ ammọ enam ñkpọ ennọ miin nte mme aku. Ben ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed ye akukịmedọñ iba i-imiinieghe ndo. <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />Ndin ben eti ndomuyo wiid nam mme ikara eboho uyo a-yiis imiisịneke, mme ndoppo eboho uyo i-imiinieghe yiis, e-enyʌññọ ekama adan ọlif ewuak, ye ñkeñe uyo a-yiis imiisịneke, e-enyʌññọ efiọññọ adan ọlif. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />Sịn ammọ ke akpasa, ndin ben ammọ di ye ayaaraenañ, ye mme akukịmedọñ iba ado. <verse eid="EXO 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />Ndin ben Erọn ye nditọ amọ di inuausʌñ atayad mbono, nyʌñ yet ammọ idem ke mmọọñ. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Ben mme afọñ ado sịn Erọn ye afọñ idakidem, anyọñ afọñ aboditọñ, afọñ aboditọñ, ye afọñ ikpanesịd. Tobo afọñ aboditọñ dian anye ke idem ye udọdọk mbọbọisịn. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />Dot afọñiwuod ke iwuod amọ, nyʌñ yịt adisana idiọọñọ ke afọñiwuod ado. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />Ben adan unịm idiọọñọ yet anye ke adiduọk anye ke iwuod. <verse eid="EXO 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />Koono nditọ ideen amọ di, nyʌñ sịn ammọ mme anyan afọñ idakidem, <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />nyʌñ tobo ammọ itam. Ndin tobo Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ mme udʌkisịn ke isịn. Ammọ edo mme aku ke nsi-nsi enwọñọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 29:9">“Ndin ana afo adot Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ ubọk.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />“Ben ayaaraenañ di iso atayad mbono, ndin Erọn ye nditọ amọ ideen ana edot ubọk ke iwuod amọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />Wot ayaaraenañ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ntondʌk atayad mbono. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />Ben ubaak iyiib ayaaraenañ ado ke nnuun mfo yet ke mme afịd inuuk inaañ akpokoro uwa, nyʌñ duọk ñyọhọnsʌhọ ke isọñ itie akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Ndin sio afịd mme akpọñ ke mme ndido esịd idịb, anyan nsia atiesịd ye naña ekpuud iba ado ye mme akpọñ a-abaaha ke ammọ, nyʌñ fọp ammọ ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Ado fọp abʌk ayaaraenañ ado ye ikpa amọ ye nsia ke anwaesiin atayad. Anye ado uwa idiọọkñkpọ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ke Eksọdọs 29:36</char></note><verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />“Ben akukịmedọñ keed, ndin Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ eyaedot ubọk ammọ ke iwuod amọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />Wot akukịmedọñ ado nyʌñ ben iyiib amọ siime ke mme mben akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />Kpok akukịmedọñ ado mbai-mbai, nyʌñ yet mme ñkpọ esịd idịb amọ ye mme ukod, nịm ammọ ye iwuod ye mme ñkikʌk mbon ñko. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />Ndin fọp afịd akukịmedọñ ado ke akpokoro uwa. Anye ado ufọfọb uwa anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anemufịk, uwa ndidia e-enamma enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />“Ben akukịmedọñ anye ako, ndin Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ eyaedot ubọk ke iwuod amọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Wot akukịmedọñ ado, ben ubaak iyiib amọ yet ke mben utọñ nnasia Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ, ke akpan nnuunubọk nnasia ammọ, ye ke akpan nnuunukod nnasia ammọ. Ndin siime iyiib ke mme mben akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Ndin ben ubaak iyiib ke akpokoro uwa ye ubaak adan adidiọñ siime Erọn ye afọñ amọ ye nditọ ideen amọ ye afọñ ammọ. Ndin anye ye nditọ amọ ye afọñ ammọ eyaedo se emaekediọñ.<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />“Sio akpọñ ke akukịmedọñ ado, akpọñ isịm, akpọñ ke mme nsia idịb, anyan nsia udʌkesịd, afịd ikọñesịd iba ye akpọñ ammọ, ye ifʌkkọ ubọk nnasia. (Anyem ado akukịmedọñ udodubọk.) <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />Ke akpasa uyo a-yiis imiisịneke, a-abaaha ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, sio ikara-ikara uyo keed, ndodoppo uyo keed ye adan ọlif e-ewuaha, ye mfefeere uyo keed. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Sịn afịd mme ñkpọ ami ke ubọk Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ, ndin nam ammọ efʌñ anye ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Ndin bọ mme ñkpọ ado ke ubọk ammọ, nyʌñ fọp ammọ ke akpokoro uwa ye mme ufọfọb uwa mfen nte inemufịk nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />Ke afo umaukuben esịd akukịmedọñ ado nte ñkpọ udodubọk Erọn, fʌñ anye nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa, ndin ayaado udeeme mfo.<verse eid="EXO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" />“Diọñ mme mbaak idem akukịmedọñ uwa e-ekebenne enam udodubọk a-anieghe Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ, mbaak ikọñesịd ekebenne efʌñ ye ifʌkkọ ukod ekenọọhọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Ami ana ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ ke udeeme a-nditọ Isrel enọọhọ Erọn ye nditọ amọ ideen. Ami ado udeeme enọ a-nditọ Isrel enieghe adinam nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nto mme uwa ewuana ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />“Adisana afọñ Erọn adiinie ubon amọ, nọ eyet ammọ adan, enyʌñ ediọñ ammọ ke mme afọñ ado. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Ayịn amọ awodeen a-adatta itie amọ nte aku anyʌñ adʌk atayad mbono adinam uwa ke Adisana Itie ana asịne mme afọñ ado ke usen itiaba.<verse eid="EXO 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />“Ben akukịmedọñ uwa udodubọk tem ke adisana itie. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Ke ntondʌk atayad mbono, Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ ana eta akukịmedọñ ado ye uyo a-asịneke ke akpasa. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />Ammọ enie adita ñkpọ uwa e-ekenamma ñkpeubọk a-abañake adidiọñ ye udodubọk ammọ. Ado inaaha awo ndomokeed mfen akeene ata, sia ammọ edo ndisana. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />Ado adieke unam akukịmedọñ udodubọk ado me uyo ndomokeed asʌhọke tutu ubakusen, ifọp unam se isʌhọ. Inaaha eta anye, sia anye ado adisana.<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />“Dat usen itiaba nam ndodubọk Erọn ye nditọ, nyʌñ nam afịd ñkpọ se ami itemme ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />Wa ayaaraenañ kwa usen nte ñkpọ uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ. Nam akpokoro uwa asana ke adinam ñkpeubọk, nyʌñ yet anye adan diọñ anye. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />Ke usen itiaba nam ñkpeubọk nọ akpokoro uwa, nyʌñ diọñ anye. Ndin akpokoro uwa ayaado ataa adisana, ndin ñkpọ akeedodo atuuhọ anye adiido adisana.<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />“Afịd usen ana ndufo ewa ñyịn edọñ iba e-edooho isua keed ke akpokoro uwa ado. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Wa ñyịn edọñ keed ubakusen nyʌñ wa anye ako ndubiayio. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />Kama ataa eti ndomuyo ke udomo efa mbakka keed ke itie duob wuak ye adan e-esioho eto ọlif, mbakka hin keed ke itie inaañ wa akpa ñyịn edọñ, nyʌñ kama wain mbakka hin keed ke itie inaañ nte unwọnwọñ uwa. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Wa ñyịn edọñ anye ako ke ndubiayio ye ukem mfịd uwa ye ukọd uwa naña akenam ubakusen, inemufịk uwa, uwa ndidia e-enamma enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="EXO 29:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />“Ke mme emana se idiidi ke ayio iso ana enam ufọfọb uwa aba ke akemini ndin-ndin ke ntondʌk inuausʌñ atayad mbono, ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ke ndo ke ami ndiisoobo ye ndufo ñnyʌñ ntañ ikọ inọ ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />Ke ndo ñko ke ami ndiisoobo ye mme nditọ Isrel, ndin eyaediọñ itie ado ke ubọọñ mmi.<verse eid="EXO 29:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />“Ndin ami ñyaadiọñ atayad mbono, ñnyʌñ ndiọñ akpokoro uwa, ñyaanyʌñ ndiọñ Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ nọ enam ñkpọ ennọ miin nte mme aku. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />Ndin ami ñyaadʌñ ke atu nditọ Isrel, ñnyʌñ ndo Abasi ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Ammọ eyaediọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ, a-akesioho ammọ ke isọñ Iyib nọ ato do ami ndiidʌñ ye ammọ. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s1">Akpokoro Uwa Ufọb Insensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />“Nam akpokoro ufọb insensi ke eto akasia. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />Ana anye ado mbañ inaañ, kubid keed ke unyọọñ ye kubid keed ke ukpa, ndin kubid iba ke ukoñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 1 1/2 ke unyọọñ ye ke ukpa amaana ado ikpad 3 ke ukoñ me ñkpọ nte sentimita 45 ke unyọọñ ye ke ukpa amaana ado sentimita 90 ke ukoñ</char></note>, mme nnʌk amọ edo ifre keed ye anye. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Dot anyọñ amọ ye afịd mbañ amọ ye nnʌk amọ ke ataa eti kold, nyʌñ fʌk kold kanna anye. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Nam ikara kold iba nọ akpokoro uwa ke idak, iba-iba ke nsakiso mbañ ammọ iba, adimʌm mme mboi e-ekekamake eben anye. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Nam mme mboi ke eto akasia, nyʌñ dat kold fʌk ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Yak akpokoro uwa aba ke iso afọñ ikpeghe a-afʌkkọ akebe edioomo mbed enwọñọ, mbemiso ufʌkñkpọ ñkpeubọk a-afʌkkọ itiad akebe edioomo mbed, itie a-ami ndiisoobo ye ndufo.<verse eid="EXO 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />“Erọn ana afọp inem ufịk insensi ke itie akpokoro uwa ado afịd ubakusen idaha a-anye akaaha adidomo ikañ akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />Ana Erọn amaana afọp insensi ke ini a-anye adomoke ikañ uwa ke utịn ubakusen ye ndubiayio nọ insensi asak asio inem ufịk afịd-afịd ini ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ mme emana ke ini iso. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />Kuuwaa insensi mfen ke akpokoro uwa ado, me ufọfọb uwa mfen, me uwa mfịd inwañ, kuunyʌñ unam uwa uduọk ukọd ke anye. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Akañ keed ke isua, Erọn ana anam uwa ñkpeubọk ye iyiib uwa ñkpeubọk idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana</char></note> anọ mme emana ke ini iso. Ado ataa adisana ñkpọ anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akʌk Ukpeutịb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />“Umaubat nditọ Isrel, awo keedekeed ana akpe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ekọmudua ke iwuod uwem amọ ke idaha esʌkkọ ebat anye. Ndin afo umaubat ammọ, idiọọk udọñọ ndomokeed idiisịmme ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" />Awo se iboiyo idʌk ukañ e-emaekebabat ana anọ mbaak sekel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 5.8; se ke Eksọdọs 30:15</char></note> keed a-anieghe udob kera edịb, akeene naña mbed adisana itie sekel atemme. Mbaak sekel keed ami ado enọ e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Afịd mbon e-edooho isua edịb, me awakka akan ado, ana enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enọ ami. <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />Mme imọawo inaaha enọ awak akan mbaak sekel keed, ñko mme uweene inaaha enọ asịp akan ke ini afo anọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enọ adikpe ubọk mbaña uwem ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Bọ nditọ Isrel akʌk ukpeutịb nyʌñ dat anye nam ñkpọ ke esob itie atayad mbono. Ami adiido ñkpọ aditoiyo inọ nditọ Isrel ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke adinam ñkpeubọk nnọọ uwem ndufo.”<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Besịn Uyieidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />“Nam besịn ke brọns, a-anieghe ukod brọns, nte ñkpọ uyieidem. Nịm anye ke ufọọd atayad mbono ye akpokoro uwa, nyʌñ sịn mmọọñ ke esịd. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ ana eyie ubọk ye ukod ammọ ke mmọọñ ado. <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20" />Ammọ emaedʌk atayad mbono, ana eyie ubọk ke mmọọñ mbaak ammọ edikpa. Ñko, ammọ emaesaña ekpere akpokoro uwa adiwa uwa ndidia nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <verse eid="EXO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21" />ana ammọ eyie ubọk ye ukod mbaak ammọ edikpa. Ami adiido nsi-nsi mbed inọ Erọn ye mme ubon amọ ke mme emana se idiidi.”<verse eid="EXO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Adan Adidiọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" />“Ben mme nti anemufịk mmọọñ-mmọọñ adan mee sekel ikie ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 5.8; se ke Eksọdọs 30:24</char></note> (500), ake sinamọn mbakka iba ñkpọ nte sekel ikie iba mme aba mme duob (250), inem ufịk adan kalamus sekel ikie iba mme aba mme duob (250), <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />adan akesia sekel ikie ition (500), afịd akeene udomoñkpọ sekel adisana itie ye adan ọlif hin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte akpọ adan keed me lita 3.8</char></note> keed. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Nam nọ ado adisana adan adidiọñ, e-ewuaha inem ufịk, utom atem a-pefium. Anye adiido eti adisana adan adidiọñ. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />Ndin ben anye diọñ atayad mbono, akebe edioomo mbed enwọñọ, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />akpokoro ye afịd mme ñkpọ utom amọ, udod utuenikañ ye afịd ñkpoduoho amọ, ye akpokoro uwa ufọp insensi, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />akpokoro ufọfọb uwa ye afịd ñkpoduoho amọ, ye besịn ye mme ukod amọ. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />Ana afo adiọñ anye nọ ammọ edo ataa ndisana, ndin ñkpọ ndomokeed se ituuk ammọ eyaekappa edo adisana.<verse eid="EXO 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />“Yet Erọn ye nditọ amọ ideen adan, nyʌñ diọñ ammọ nọ ammọ enam ñkpọ ennọ miin nte mme aku. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel, ‘Ami adiido adisana adan adidiọñ mmi ke afịd emana. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Ikiiduọk anye ke idem awo mfen, ikiinyʌñ inam adan mfen ke ukem usʌñ ami. Anye ado adisana, ana ndufo edat anye nte adisana. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Ana ewot awo akeedodo imiidooho aku a-anamma ukem inem ufịk adan a-abaaha ntom, anyʌñ aben aduọk awo mfen ke idem.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Insensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Dat mme anemufịk mfañ, kọm a-resịn, onisa, ye kalbanum, ye ataa eti frankinsensi, afịd ammọ ana edo ukem-ukem udomo, <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />nyʌñ waak ammọ nam inem ufịk insensi, ubọkutom awo se inam eti inem ufịk adan. Ana esịn inʌñ, enam anye asana, anyʌñ ado asaña-asaña. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />Kọk ubaak amọ nọ adọrọ nte ntọñ, nyʌñ nịm anye ke iso itie akebe edioomo mbed ke atayad mbono, itie a-ami ndiisoobo ye ndufo. Adiido ataa adisana ñkpọ inọ ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Kuunam insensi mfen ke utọ usʌñ ami unọọ idem ndufo; dat anye nte adisana ñkpọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Awo ndomokeed a-anamma insensi se iba ntom nọ anye akop inem ufịk amọ ana ewot anye esio ke atu mbon ammọ.”<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s1">Besalel ye Oholiab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />“Ami mmemek Besalel ayịn Uri, a-adooho ayịn Họọ, a-atooho ubon Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />ndin ami mmeyọhọ anye ye Sịbidịd Abasi, ye aniọñ, ye ndiọọñọidem, ye ifiọk ye afịd ifiọkutom, <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />adinam mme uyaiya ñkpọ ubọkutom ke kold, ke silfa ye brọns, <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />adikpịkke, ñnyʌñ mbono mme itiad, adinam utom ke eto, ñnyʌñ ñkan adinam nsio-nsio ubọkutom. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />Ke akanna ado, ami mmemek Oholiab ayịn Ahisamak, a-atooho ubon Daan, nọ adiinwam anye.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 31:6" />
  <para style="li4" vid="EXO 31:6">“Ami mmenọ afịd mme anam mfọọn ubọkutom ukeme adinam afịd ñkpọ se ami ñkitemme:<verse eid="EXO 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />“Atayad mbono,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 31:7">akebe edioomo mbed enwọñọ ye ufʌkñkpọ ñkpeubọk ke anyọñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 31:7">ye afịd mme ñkpọ mbanaidem atayad,<verse eid="EXO 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />akpokoro ye mme ñkpoduoho amọ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 31:8">ataa eti kold udod utuenikañ ye afịd mme ñkpọ mbanaidem amọ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 31:8">akpokoro uwa insensi,<verse eid="EXO 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />akpokoro ufọfọb uwa, ye afịd ñkpoduoho amọ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 31:9">besịn ye ukod amọ,<verse eid="EXO 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />ndin ye mme udọdọk afọñ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 31:10">afịd mme ndisana afọñ aku Erọn,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EXO 31:10">ye mme afọñ nditọ amọ ideen ke ini ammọ enamma utom aku,<verse eid="EXO 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />ndin ye adan adidiọñ ye inem ufịk insensi Adisana Itie.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 31:11" />
  <para style="li4" vid="EXO 31:11">“Ammọ ana enam naña ami ñkiwuuk ndufo.”<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usen Sabad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel, ‘Ana ndufo enịm mme Sabad mmi. Ami adiido idiọọñọ ke ufọọd mmi ye ndufo ke mme emana adiidi ke ayio iso, nọ ndufo ediọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-anamma nọ ndufo esana.<verse eid="EXO 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />“ ‘Inịm usen Sabad, sia ado adisana inọ ndufo. Awo ndomokeed a-asappake anye ana ewot anye; ana ewot mbon e-enamma utom ke usen ado esio ke atu mbon ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Ke usen itiokeed ke ana nte enam utom, ado ayọhọ usen itiaba ado usen sabad nduọkadudu, adisana usen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ana ewot awo ndomokeed a-anamma utom ke usen Sabad. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Nditọ Isrel ana enịm usen Sabad, edia anye nte usọrọ ke mme emana se idiidi nte nsi-nsi enwọñọ. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Adiido idiọọñọ ke ufọọd mmi ye nditọ Isrel ke nsi-nsi, sia ke usen itiokeed ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam anyọñ ye isọñ, ndin ke ayọhọ usen itiaba anye amaaduọk adudu, anyʌñ anie adidemme ke idem.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />Ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaketañ ikọ ama ye Moses ke Abod Sainai, anye amaanọ anye itiad mbed iba, itiadñwed A-Abasi akewette ke nnuunubọk ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s1">Ubobod Ñyịn Enañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />Ke ini mme awo ekekịtte ke Moses amaakpeene adisọiyọ ndi ke anyọñ ekamba abod, ammọ emaebịne Erọn ekebo ete, “Di, bot mme abasi inọ ñnyịn e-ediisaña ke iso ñnyịn. Amaado awo e-ekoodo Moses a-akisịññeke ñnyịn ke isọñ Iyib, ñnyịn idiọọñọke se itịppe inọ anye.”<verse eid="EXO 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Erọn amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, “Isịññe afịd ñkpahautọñ kold i-ibaan ndufo, nditọ ideen ndufo, ye nditọ ibaan ndufo esịneke iben insọk.” <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Ndin afịd awo emaesịññe mme ñkpahautọñ ammọ eben esọk Erọn. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Anye amaaben ammọ anam ubobodñkpọ ke mbid ñyịn enañ, akama ñkpọutom adiọñ anye. Akema, ammọ emaebo, “Ami ado mme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Anye ami ado abasi ndufo; se ke Eksọdọs 32:8</char></note> abasi ndufo, Isrel, e-ekesioho ndufo ke isọñ Iyib.”<verse eid="EXO 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Ke ini Erọn akekịtte ami, anye amaabọp akpokoro uwa ke iso ñyịn enañ ado anyʌñ anọ uyio ate, “Ñkpọñ usọrọ ayaaba anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” <verse eid="EXO 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Ke edem usen, mme awo emaebak edemme ewa ufọfọb uwa, enyʌñ enam uwa ewuana. Ke emaekema ammọ emaesuuk etie edia ñkpọ, enwọñ ñkpọ, enyʌñ enam mme mbubiam ido.<verse eid="EXO 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Sọiyọ kaa, sia mbon mfo, a-afo akesioho ke isọñ Iyib, e-ebiaña. <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />Ammọ e-esọp aditịmme ñkpọñ usʌñ a-ami ñketemmeke ammọ, enyʌñ enam ubobodñkpọ ke mbid ñyịn enañ enọ idem ammọ. Ammọ enʌhọ ekpono anye, enyʌñ ewa uwa enọ anye ete, ‘Isrel, mme abasi ndufo edoñño ami, e-ekisioho ndufo ke isọñ Iyib.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Ami mmekịt mbon ami, ammọ edo mbon esọọñọ aboditọñ. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />Dakka ñkpọñ miin idahami nọ ami ñwọt ammọ iyadesịd mmi ñnyʌñ nsobo ammọ. Ndin ami ñyaunam fiin akappa ado ekamba idịd.”<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Ado Moses amaabeeñe mfọn <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ. Anye amaabo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nsoo inam nọ iyadesịd mfo afiop abaña ikọd mfo, a-afo akesioho ke isọñ Iyib ke ekamba adudu ye ekamba ubọk? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />Ntak a-mbon Iyib ekpebooho, ‘Akedo ye idiọọk uduak ke anye akesio ammọ, adiwot ammọ ke mme ñkpoon abod, nyʌñ nsọọk ammọ nsio ke iso ederimbod-o’? Siññe idem kpọñ ufiob iyadesịd mfo; teeghe ube, kuunyʌñ uben nsobo usọk ikọd mfo. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />Toiyo mme isʌñutom mfo Ebraham, Aisik ye Isrel, a-afo akenwọñọke ke idem mfo: ‘Ami ñyaanam ubon ndufo awak nte ntantaafiọñ ke ikpaanyọñ, ndin ami ñyaanọ ubon mfo isọñ a-ami ñkenwọñọke nnọ ammọ, ndin ado ayaado udeemeñkpọ ammọ ke nsi-nsi.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịññe idem akpọñ iyadesịd a-anye akeduakka adidot ikọd amọ ke idem.<verse eid="EXO 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Moses amaawọññọ iso asọiyọ ke abod ye itiadñwed mbed iba ke ubọk. Ekewet ke mbeñ iba, iso ye edem. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Mme itiadñwed ado ekedo ubọkutom Abasi; ekekakap ubọkñwed Abasi esịn ke mme itiadñwed ado.<verse eid="EXO 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Ke ini Yọsua akekoppo uyom ñkpo mme awo, anye amaabo Moses, “Uyom ekọñ a-aba ke anwa mbono.”<verse eid="EXO 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Moses amaabọọrọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 32:18">“Idooho uyom adikan ke ekọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 32:18">idooho uyom mfʌhọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 32:18">ado uyom ikwọ ke ami ñkop.”<verse eid="EXO 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Ke ini Moses akekpereke anwa mbono, anyʌñ akịt ubobod ñyịn enañ ye mme awo naña enek unek, iyadesịd amọ amaafiop, ndin anye amaatop itiadmbed ke ubọk amọ aduọk, abom ammọ mbai-mbai ke mben ekamba abod. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Ndin anye amaaben ubobod ñyịn enañ a-mme awo ekebotto afọp ke ikañ; ndin akọk anye tutu akappa ntọñ, asuan anye ke mmọọñ anyʌñ anam nditọ Isrel enwọñ mmọọñ ado.<verse eid="EXO 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Moses amaabo Erọn ate, “Nsoo ke idịd ami ekunam fiin, nọ afo aben ammọ asịn ke uto ekamba idiọọkñkpọ ami?”<verse eid="EXO 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Erọn amaabọọrọ ate, “Kuuyat esịd, abọọñ mmi, afo amediọọñọ naña idịd ami esọp ke adinam idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />Ammọ emaembo miin, ‘Bot mme abasi inọ ñnyịn se idiiboiyo iso inọ ñnyịn. Ado amaado awo e-ekoodo Moses akisịññeke ñnyịn ke isọñ Iyib, ñnyịn idiọọñọke se itịppe inọ anye.’ <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Ami mmaadọkkọ ammọ nte, ‘Yak awo se inie ñkpọ mbanaidem kold, asịññe adi.’ Ndin ammọ emaennọ miin mme kold ami, ndin ami mmaatop nsịn ke ikañ, ndin ubobod ñyịn enañ ami amaawuọ!”<verse eid="EXO 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Moses amaakịt ke mme awo ekeba ke ndutịme, ndin Erọn amaayaak ammọ eba nte inieghe ukpeme aba, ndin ammọ emaenyʌñ ekappa edo ñkpọ nsakimam enọ mme asua ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />Ndin Moses amaada ke inuausʌñ anwa mbono abo, “Awo akeedodo adaaha anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, di mbịne miin.” Ndin afịd mme Lifai emaekaa ebịne anye.<verse eid="EXO 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />Ndin anye amaabo ammọ, “Ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel atañ ado ami: ‘Ana afịd ideen efaak afịd ke ñkañ ammọ. Ikaa edem ye iso ke afịd anwa mbono ami ke ñkañ keed tutu asịm edem uko, awo keedekeed ana awot ayịneka amọ awodeen, anyʌñ awot ufan amọ ye mbọhọidʌñ amọ.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />Mme Lifai emaenam naña Moses aketemme, ndin ke usen ado ñkpọ nte awo tọsịn ita emaekpañña. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Akema, Moses amaabo, “I-isịññe ndufo enịm asaña-asaña enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mfịn ami, sia ndufo ekenwanake ye nditọ ndufo ye nditọeka ndufo, ndin anye i-idiọñ ndufo mfịn ami.”<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Edem usen Moses amaabo mme atu awo ate, “Ndufo emenam ekamba idiọọkñkpọ. Ado idahami ami ñyaakaa mbịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; me ami ñyaakan adinam ñkpeubọk mbaña idiọọkñkpọ ndufo.”<verse eid="EXO 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Ndin Moses amaatịmme abịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo ate, “O, se utọ ekamba idiọọkñkpọ i-idịd ami enamma! Ammọ emaenam ubobod abasi kold enọ idem ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Ado idahami, mbọk feen mme idiọọkñkpọ ammọ, imiidooho ntoro, ñkwokko miin sio ke ñwed a-afo awette.”<verse eid="EXO 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ Moses ate, “Awo akeedodo a-anamma idiọọkñkpọ andian miin ñyaakwokko anye nsio ke ñwed mmi. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />Ado kaa, dat mme awo usʌñ kaa itie a-ami ñketañña mbaña, ndin mme enyere mmi eyaubem fiin iso. Ado, ini amaakem ami adimia ammọ ufen, ami ñyaamia ammọ ufen ke mme idiọọkñkpọ ammọ.”<verse eid="EXO 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatọ ammọ idiọọk udọñọ nsobo akeene se ammọ ekenam ye ubobod ñyịn enañ ake Erọn akebotto anọ ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Kpọñ itie ami, afo ye afịd mbon se afo akeben asio ke isọñ Iyib, nyʌñ kaa ke isọñ a-ami ñkenwọñọke nnọ Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb, nte, ‘Ñyaanọ mme ubon mfo.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />Ami ñyaadọñ mme enyere ubem fiin iso, enyʌñ ekebịne mbon Kenan, mbon Amọọ, mbon Hed, mbon Peris, mbon Hif ye mbon Yebus esio. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Ikaa ke isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk. Ado ami ndiisañake ye ndufo, sia ndufo edo mbon esọññọ aboditọñ, sia ami mmekeme adikisobo ndufo ke usʌñ.”<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />Ke ini mme atu awo ekekoppo mme anie ndịk ikọ ami, ammọ emaetọọñọ adifʌhọ, ndin awo ndomokeed ikisịneke ñkpọ mbanaidem ndomokeed. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel, ‘Ndufo edo mbon esọññọ aboditọñ. Adieke ñkpesañake ye ndufo ke etək ibio ini, ami mmekeme isobo ndufo. Isịññe ñkpọ mbanaidem ndufo idahami, ndin ami ñyaadiọọñọ se nnam ye ndufo.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Ndin nditọ Isrel emaesịññe mme ñkpọ mbanaidem ammọ ke Abod Họreb.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Atayad Mbono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />Ndin Moses amaasima adiben atayad ñwuuk ke anwa esiin mbono ke itie amaanake asanna etək, akoot anye “atayad mbono.” Awo ndomokeed se iyem adibịp <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñkpọ akena aka atayad ami ke anwa esiin. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Ndin ini akeedodo ake Moses akesikaaha atayad mbono ado, akena afịd awo edaaña eda ke inuausʌñ atayad ammọ ese Moses tutu anye adʌk atayad ado. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Naña Moses adʌkkọ atayad mbono, adaaha ntọñanyọñ ayaasọiyọ adida ke inuausʌñ, ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañña ikọ ye Moses. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />Ini akeedodo a-mme awo ekesikịtte adaaha ntọñanyọñ naña ada ke inuausʌñ itie mbono, ammọ keedekeed emaesida ke inuaatob atayad ammọ ekpono Abasi. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaatañ ikọ ye Moses iso ye iso, nte ufan atañ ikọ ye ufan. Ndin Moses ayaatịmme akaa esịd nnaaekọñ, ado etək ayịnufọk amọ, Yọsua ayịn Nọn ikikpọññọ atayad ado.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moses ye Ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Moses amaabo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate, “Afo amesindọkkọ miin, ‘Dat idịd ami usʌñ,’ ado afo unamma ami ndiọọñọ awo se afo uduunọ nọ asaña ye ami. Afo amesibo, ‘Ami mmudiọọñọ fiin ke anyịñ, ndin afo amekịt mfọn ke ubọk mmi.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />Adieke afo anemme esịd ye ami, ñkpeep miin usʌñ mfo nọ ami udiọọñọ fiin, ñnyʌñ ñkaiso ñkịt mfọn ye afo. Toiyo ke idịd ami edo ikọd mfo.”<verse eid="EXO 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ anye ate, “Ami ñyaasaña ye afo, ndin ami ñyaunọ fiin nduọkadudu.”<verse eid="EXO 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Ndin Moses amaabọọrọ anye ate, “Adieke afo umuusañake ye ñnyịn, kuusio ñnyịn udọñ. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Mme awo ediisaña die idiọọñọ ke afo amenen iso ye ami ye ikọd mfo ibọhọke afo asaña ye ñnyịn? Nsoo idiinam ami ye ikọd mfo inie ukpʌhọde ye afịd mbon mfen ke afịd iso isọñ?”<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “ami ñyaanam ñkpọ afo abeeñe, sia ami mmenem esịd ye afo, ndin ami mmudiọọñọ fiin ke anyịñ.”<verse eid="EXO 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Akema, Moses amaabo ate, “Idahami ñwọt miin ubọọñ mfo.”<verse eid="EXO 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye, “Ami ñyaanam afịd ubọọñ mmi aboiyo ke iso mfo, ndin ami ñyaatommo adisana anyịñ mmi, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke iso mfo. Ami ñyaatua awo se ami ñyem aditua mbọm, ndin ñnyʌñ ñkop udʌk mbaña awo se ami ñyem adikop udʌk.” <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Ndin anye amaabo, “ado afo ukemeke adiñkịt miin iso, sia awo ndomokeed ikemeke adiñkịt miin ndin adu uwem.”<verse eid="EXO 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo ate, “Itie aba añkpere miin a-afo akpedaaha ke anyọñ itiad. <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />Ubọọñ mmi amaaboiyo, ami ñyausịn fiin ke ufañ abaitiad ñnyʌñ ñkama ubọk mmi ufʌk fiin tutu ami nsaña mboiyo. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Ndin ami ñyaafʌkkọ ubọk mmi, ndin afo ayaakịt edem mmi; ado inaaha ekịt iso mmi.”<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ufa Itiadñwed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Kpịkke itiadñwed iba naña akenam akpa, ndin ami ñyaawet ke mme itiadñwed ado mme ikọ se ñkewet ke mme akpa itiadñwed a-afo akebommo. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Beeñe idem ubakusen, nyʌñ dọọk di Abod Sainai. Ben idem mfo diñwọt miin ke anyọñ ekamba abod. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Inaaha awo ndomokeed asaña ye afo adi, me aba akpere anyọñ abod; ukpọk udịmedọñ, me udịmenañ inaaha edi uta mbid ke iso ekamba abod ado.”<verse eid="EXO 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Ndin Moses amaakap itiadñwed iba nte akpa itiad, anyʌñ adakka akaa Abod Sainai ke ñkịmñnwaña ubakusen, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye. Anye amaanyʌñ akama itiad ñwed iba ado ke ubọk amọ. <verse eid="EXO 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaasọiyọ ke ntọñanyọñ adida ye anye anyʌñ atommo anyịñ amọ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Ndin anye amaaboiyo ke iso Moses, atommo ate, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mbọm ye mfọn, isọppọ iyadesịd, ayọhọ ye ima ye akpanikọ, <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />a-awọttọ tọsịn emana ima amọ, anyʌñ afeen ibak, afai ye idiọọkñkpọ. Ado anye itreke adimia awo ufen ke ndudue amọ; anye amia nditọ ye nditọnditọ ufen ke idiọọkñkpọ mme ete ammọ, tutu asịm ayọhọ emana ita ye inaañ.”<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Moses amaaduọ ke isọñ ini keed anyʌñ akpono Abasi. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />Anye amaabo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,” “adieke adooho ami mmekịt mfọn ke iso mfo, yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asaña ye ñnyịn. Akpesʌkado idịd ami edooho mbon esọññọ aboditọñ, feen mme ibak ye idiọọkñkpọ ñnyịn, nyʌñ dat ñnyịn nte udeeme mfo.”<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo: “Ami ñyaanam edioomo ye afo. Ke iso afịd ikọd mfo ami ñyaanam utịppeñkpọ a-adooho kpaanam awo inamma ke idịd ndomokeed ke afịd ederimbod. Mbon se afo adʌñ ke atu ammọ eyaekịt ñkpọ ñkpaidem se Ami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndiinam unọ fiin. <verse eid="EXO 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />Nekke kpeme se ami utemme fiin mfịn ami. Ñyaabịn mbon Amọọ, mbon Kenan, mbon Hed, mbon Peris, Hif ye mbon Yebus nsio ke iso mfo. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Kpeme mbaak ndufo idinam edioomo ye mbon e-edʌñọke ke isọñ a-ndufo ekaaha, mbaak adikappa ado afia inọ ndufo. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Bom mme akpokoro uwa ammọ, bom ndisana itiad ammọ, nyʌñ kpịkke mme abai Asera ammọ nịm ke isọñ. <verse eid="EXO 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />Kuukpono abasi mfen, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-anyịñ amọ adooho Ufịb, ado Abasi ufịb.<verse eid="EXO 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />“Ikpeme mbaak ndufo idinam edioomo ye mbon e-edʌñọke ke isọñ a-ndufo ekaaha; sia ammọ emaenam akpara ye mme abasi ammọ, enyʌñ enam uwa enọ ammọ, ammọ eyaikoot ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaedia mme uwa ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />Ndin ndufo imaidat usʌk nditọ ibaan ammọ inọ nditọ ideen ndufo ke ndọ, ndin nditọ ibaan ado ekenam akpara ye mme abasi ammọ, ammọ eyaenam nditọ ideen ndufo ekeene enam ntoro.<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />“Ikiinam ubobodñkpọ ndomokeed.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />“Inam usọrọ Uyo a-yiis imiisịneke. Ke usen itiaba ana eta uyo a-yiis imiisịnneke, naña ami ñkitemme ndufo. Inam ami ke uyọhọ ini ke afiọñ Afif, sia ke afiọñ ado ke ndufo ekewuọñọ ke isọñ Iyib.<verse eid="EXO 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />“Afịd akpa mfịdidịb ado ake mmi, tutu asịm afịd akpa nditọ ufene se ido ñyaara, ñkọm ado udịmenañ me udịmedọñ. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Idat ñyịn edọñ ifakka akpa ñyịn dọñki, ado ndufo imiifakkake anye, ibuuñ itọñ amọ. Ifak afịd akpa ayịn awodeen ndufo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">“Inaaha awo ndomokeed asaña ubọk ñkaña adi ke iso mmi.<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />“Ke usen itiokeed ke ndufo ediinam utom, ado ke ayọhọ usen itiaba, ana eduọk adudu; ukem ado ke ini utọ ñkpọ ye ke ini ukpeeñe.<verse eid="EXO 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />“Inam idaara Usọrọ Udua ye mme akpa mfịd inwañ idọk, ye Usọrọ Idọk ke ntọọñọ isua. <verse eid="EXO 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />Akañ ita ke isua afịd ideen ndufo ana edi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, Abasi Isrel. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" />Ami ñyaabịne mme idịd nsio ke iso ndufo, ñnyʌñ ntat adaña ndufo, ndin ba awo ndomokeed idiisịnne anyen ke isọñ ndufo idaha a-andufo ekaaha iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akañ ita ke isua.<verse eid="EXO 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />“Ikiinam uwa a-asịneke iyiib innọọ miin ye ñkpọ ndomokeed a-sịneke yiis, ñko ikiiyak uwa Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ana awuọ ubakusen edem usen.<verse eid="EXO 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />“Iben mme akpa mfịd inwañ ndufo andifọn ñkan idi ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">“Ikiitem ñyịn ebod ke mmọọñeba eka amọ.”<verse eid="EXO 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />Akem, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, “Wet mme ikọ ami, sia ami nnam edioomo ye afo ye nditọ Isrel akeene mme ikọ ami.” <verse eid="EXO 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Moses akeba do ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke uweemeayio aba ye akonayio aba, inyʌññọ ita uyo me inwọñ mmọọñ. Ndin anye amaawet ke itiadñwed mme ikọ edioomo, a-adooho mme Mbed Duob.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñyayamma Iso Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />Ke Moses amaakesọiọ ke Abod Sainai ye itiadñwed mbed edioomo iba ke ubọk amọ, anye ikidiọọñọke ke iso imọ ayaayamma, sia anye amaaneme nneme ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Ke ini Erọn ye afịd mbon Isrel ekekịtte Moses, iso amọ akeyaayamma, ndin ammọ emaekop ndịk adisaña ñkpere anye. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Ado Moses amaakoot ammọ; ndin Erọn ye afịd mme adadusʌñ ke esob, emaetịmme ebịne anye, ndin anye amaatañ ikọ anọ ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Akema afịd mbon Isrel emaesaña ekpere anye, ndin anye amaanọ ammọ afịd mme mbed se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ anye ke Abod Sainai.<verse eid="EXO 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Ke ini Moses amaaketañ ikọ anọ ammọ ama, anye amaafʌk afọñ ke iso amọ. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Ado ini akeedodo a-anye akesikaaha iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adinie nneme ye anye, Moses amaasifʌkkọ iso amọ tutu anye atịmme awuọ adi. Ndin anye amaawuọ adi adidọkkọ nditọ Isrel se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye, <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />mbon Isrel emaesikịt ke iso amọ ayaayamma. Ndin Moses amaasimaana aben afọñ afʌk iso amọ tutu anye atịmme akaa adineme nneme ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Mbed Sabad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Akema, Moses amaakoot afịd ubon Isrel abon, anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Mme ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayem nọ ndufo enam ado ami: <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />Ana ndufo enam utom ke usen itiokeed, ado ayọhọ usen itiaba ado adisana usen nduọkadudu ndufo, usen nduọkadudu sabad <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Awo ndomokeed a-anamma utom ke usen sabad ana ewot anye. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />Ikiibara ikañ ke itieidʌñ ndufo ndomokeed ke usen sabad.”<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ñkpọ Tabanakịd Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Moses amaadọkkọ afịd nditọ Isrel ate, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atemme ado ami: <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />Ke atu se ndufo enie, isio enọ uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Afịd mbon e-esịd ammọ anyịmmeke ana eben enọ esọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 35:5" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 35:5">“Kold, silfa ye brọns;<verse eid="EXO 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />bru, iduod-iduod ye ndad-ndad udʌk ye eti linen;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 35:6">ye ided ebod;<verse eid="EXO 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />ikpa akukịmedọñ e-enamma nọ ado ndad-ndad ye eti uduud ikpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ke Eksọdọs 35:23</char></note> mfen se isọñ idem;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 35:7">ye eto akasia;<verse eid="EXO 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />adan ọlif se esịn ke utuenikañ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 35:8">inem ufịk mfañ ake adan udodubọk ye inem ufịk insensi;<verse eid="EXO 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />dian ye mme itiad ọniks ye mme nsọñudua nsem-nsem itiad mfen se ediidot ke itie afọñ aboditọñ ye itie afọñ ikpanesịd.<verse eid="EXO 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />“Afịd mbon se ikan inam mfọọn ubọkutom ana edinam afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ uyio abaña:<verse eid="EXO 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />“Tabanakịd ye atayad amọ ye ufʌkñkpọ amọ, mme ekọb, abọbọọk, eto ndodanyọñ, adaaha ye idakisọñ;<verse eid="EXO 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />akebe edioomo ye mme eto amọ ye afọñ akebe itie ukpeutịb, ye afọñ ikpeghe a-afʌkkọ anye;<verse eid="EXO 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />akpokoro ye mme mboi amọ ye afịd ñkpọ uwa amọ ye Uyo Iso Abasi;<verse eid="EXO 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />udod utuenikañ ake ikañ ye mme ñkpoduoho amọ, mme utuenikañ ye adan ikañ;<verse eid="EXO 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />akpokoro uwa insensi ye mme eto idaha amọ, adan udodubọk ye anemufịk insensi;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 35:15">afọñ ikpeghe ke inuausʌñ ke ntondʌk tabanakịd Abasi;<verse eid="EXO 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />akpokoro itie ufọfọb uwa ye brọns amọ, abai amọ ye afịd mme ñkpoduoho amọ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 35:16">besịn brọns ye ñkpọidaha amọ;<verse eid="EXO 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />afọñ ikpeghe esịd akwere ye mme eto idaha ye itiad idakisọñ amọ, ye afọñ ikpeghe inuausʌñ esịd tabanakịd;<verse eid="EXO 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />mme mboi atayad tabanakịd ye esịd akwere, ye mme udʌk ammọ;<verse eid="EXO 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />atuatuak afọñ a-mme aku esịneke enam utom ke itieukpono ye adisana afọñ aku Erọn, ye afọñ nditọ amọ ideen idaha ammọ enamma utom nte mme aku.”<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Ndin afịd ikọd Isrel emaedakka ekpọñ iso Moses. <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />Akema, afịd awo e-ekenyịmmeke ye mbon se esịd ammọ akenyimme emaedi enyʌñ enọ enọ esọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nọ ekama enam utom atayad mbono, ye afịd utom amọ, ye mme adisana afọñ. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Afịd mbon se ikinyịmme, ideen ye ibaan ukem-ukem, emaedi eben enọ kold ke utọ ke utọ: Mme ñkpaha mbanaidem, ñkpahautọñ, ñkpannuun ye mme inem ufịk adan. Afịd ammọ emaeben enọ esọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Afịd awo se ikinie bru, iduod-iduod me ndad-ndad udʌk me eti linen, me ided ebod, mme ikpa akukịmedọñ etịmme nọ adadad me eti uduud ikpa mfen a-asọọñọ idem emaeben edi. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Mbon se ikinọọ enọ a-silfa me brọns emaeben edi nte enọ e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ndin afịd mbon se ikinie adukpọk akasia adikama nnam utom emaeben edinọ. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Afịd ibaan se ikikan adidọk ñkpọ emaeben se ammọ ekedọk edi, bru, iduod-iduod, me ndad-ndad udʌk me eti linen. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Ndin afịd ibaan se ikinyịmme inyʌñ inie ifiọk nti ubọkutom emaedọk ided ebod. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />Mme adadusʌñ emaeben itiad ọniks ye mme nsọñudua itiad mfen se edot ke itie afọñ aboditọñ ye ke itie afọñ ikpanesịd edi. <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ eben inem ufịk mfañ ye adan ọlif ake ikañ ye ake udodubọk ye ake inem ufịk insensi edi. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Afịd mbon Isrel ideen ye ibaan ekenyịmmeke emaeben mme enọ imaesịd esọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> se edat enam afịd utom se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeboiyo ke Moses awuuk ammọ abo enam.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Besalel ye Oholiab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Akema, Moses amaabo nditọ Isrel ate, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaamek Besalel ayịn Uri, ayịn Họọ, a-aketooho ubon Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />ndin ayọhọ anye ye Sịbidịd Abasi, ye aniọñ, ye ndiọọñọidem, ye ifiọk ye afịd mfọọn ubọkutom, <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />adinam mme uyaiya ubọkutom ke kold, ke silfa ye brọns, <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />adikpịkke ñnyʌñ mbono mme itiad, ñnyʌñ nnam utom ke eto, ñnyʌñ nnam afịd ñkpọ se ekakap. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Ndin anye a-anọ ammọ awo iba ye Oholiab ayịn Ahisamak, a-atooho ubon Daan, ukeme adikpeep mbon mfen. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Anye ñko a-ayọhọ ammọ ye enọ nsio-nsio ifiọk mfọọn ubọkutom adinam ñkpọ se ekakap, se edọdọk, ye se etuatuak ke bru ye iduod-iduod, ye ndad-ndad udʌk ye eti linen afọñ, ye mme adọk afọñ; afịd ammọ edo mme anam mfọọn ubọkutom.<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />Ndin ana Besalel, Oholiab ye afịd mme awo se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ enọ ubọkutom ye ikike adinam utom, e-enyʌññọ ekeme adibọp adisana itie enam utom ami ukem naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atemme.”<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Akema, Moses amaakoot Besalel ye Oholiab ye afịd mbon se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ ukeme, e-ekenyʌññọ enie udọñ adinam utom. <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Ammọ emaebọ Moses afịd mme enọ a-nditọ Isrel e-ekebenne edi adikama nnam utom ubọp adisana itie. Ndin mme awo emaekaa iso adiben mme enọ imaesịd ndi afịd ubakusen. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Ndin afịd mme anam mfọọn ubọkutom e-ekenamma utom ke adisana itieukpono emaekpọñ se ammọ ekenam <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />enyʌñ ebo Moses, “Mme awo e-eben ñkpọ utom awak akan se edat enam utom ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ uyio.”<verse eid="EXO 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Ndin Moses amaanọ uyio ndin enọ etob ami ke afịd esob: “Inaaha awodeen me awonwaan ndomokeed akaiso aben enọ adi aba ke abaña utom adisana itie.” Ke ntoro emaetre mme awo adiben mme enọ ndi, <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />sia se ammọ ekenọọ amaawak akem se edat enam utom ado.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tabanakịd Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Afịd mbon se ikido mme nti adiọọñọ ubọkutom ke atu mbon utom ami emaebọp tabanakịd ye afọñ ikpeghe duob ye ataa uyaiya afọñ linen eketuakkatuak ye bru afọñ, iduod-iduod, ye ndad-ndad udʌk, enyʌñ edọk serubim esịn do. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Afịd mme afọñ ikpeghe ekedo ukem-ukem, kubid edịb mme itiaita ke unyọọñ ye kubid inaañ ke ukpa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 42 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 6 ke ukpa me ñkpọ nte mita 13 ke unyọọñ ye mita 1.8 ke ukpa</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Ammọ emaeben afọñ ikpeghe ition edian keed, enyʌñ enam ntoro ye mme ition ako. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Akema, ammọ emaenam ekpək udʌk ke bru afọñ ke mben utịd afọñ ikpeghe ke itie keed, ndin enyʌñ enam ukem ado ye afọñ ikpeghe ke utịd uko. <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ enam ekpək udʌk aba mme duob ke afọñ ikpeghe keed, dian aba mme duob mfen ke utịd afọñ ikpeghe anye ako, nọ mme udʌk eduseere emọ-emọ. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Ndin ammọ emaenam ekọb aba mme duob ke kold, enyʌñ edat ammọ emʌm mme afọñ ikpeghe ke itie iba edian keed nọ tabanakịd Abasi anekke asọñ ada.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Ammọ emaekama ided ebod enam afọñ ikpeghe duob mme keed enọ atayad ke tabanakịd. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Afịd mme afọñ duob mme keed ami ekedo ukem-ukem, kubid edịb mme duob ke unyọọñ ye kubid inaañ ke ukpa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 45 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 6 ke ukpa me ñkpọ nte mita 14 ke unyọọñ ye mita 1.8 ke ukpa</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Ammọ emaeben afọñ ikpeghe ition edian keed, enyʌñ eben itiokeed ako edian keed ñko. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Ndin ammọ emaenam udʌk aba mme duob ke mben afọñ ikpeghe ke itie keed ñko, ye ke utịd mben afọñ ami ke itie mfen. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Ammọ emaenam ekọb brọns aba mme duob nọ amʌm atayad akama keed nte eboho. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Ndin ammọ emaedat ided akukịmedọñ e-ekenyiine nọ ado ndad-ndad enam ufʌkñkpọ enọ atayad ado; ndin ke akanna ado, emaedot ufʌkñkpọ ataa eti uduud ikpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ke Eksọdọs 36:7</char></note> se isọñ idem ke anye.<verse eid="EXO 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Ammọ emaedat eto akasia enam abom anyọñ enọ tabanakịd ado. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Eto abọbọọk keed akedo kubid duob ke unyọọñ ye kubid keed ye ibio ke ukpa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 15 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 2 1/2 ke ukpa me ñkpọ nte mita 4.5 ke unyọọñ ye sentimita 68 ke ukpa</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />ye ñwọọnda iba ke ñkañ emọ-emọ. Ammọ ekenam afịd mme eto abọbọọk tabanakịd ami ntom. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Emaenam abọbọọk edịb enọ ukañ usuuk tabanakịd, <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />enyʌñ edat silfa enam itiad idakisọñ aba enọ ammọ, iba ke ñkan keed, keed ke idak keed anye ako. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25" />Ke edem ukañ anyọñ-anyọñ tabanakịd, ammọ emaenam eto edịb <verse eid="EXO 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26" />ye silfa idakisọñ aba, iba ke idak abọbọọk keed. <verse eid="EXO 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />Ammọ emaenam eto abọbọọk itiokeed enọ utịd uko, a-adooho ukan usobutịn tabanakịd, <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />ndin emaenam eto abọbọọk iba enọ inuuk tabanakịd ke ataa utịd uko. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Ke mme inuuk iba ami mme eto abọbọọk ekedo iba tọọñọ ke idak isọñ tutu akewuọ anyọñ, anyʌñ afaha ke ikara adu keed; afịd iba ekedo ukem-ukem. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Ke ntoro eto abọbọọk itiaita ekeba ye itiad idakisọñ duob mme itiokeed e-ekedatta silfa enam, iba ke idak abọbọọk keedekeed.<verse eid="EXO 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ eben eto akasia enam abọbọọk usʌñ: Ition ke ukañ keed ke tabanakịd, <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />ition anọ mbon ukañ uko, ye ition ke mboi edem ukañ usobutịn, ke ukañ ataa utịd tabanakịd. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Ammọ emaenam eto ufọọd abọbọọk atara ato ukañ keed akewuọ mfen tọọñọ ke ufọọd. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ ekama kold efʌk ke mme eto ado, enyʌñ enam kold ke ikara adimʌm mme abọbọọk ado nnịm ke itie. Ammọ emaenyʌñ efʌk kold ke eto anyọñ ado.<verse eid="EXO 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Ammọ emaenam afọñ ikpeghe ado ke bru, iduod-iduod, ye ndad-ndad udʌk ye eti ufafiakka linen, ye utuatuak afọñ serubim ake awo a-adiọọñọke mfọọn ubọkutom akenamma. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Ammọ emaenam adaaha eto akasia inaañ enọ anye, enyʌñ ebịt ammọ ke kold. Ammọ emaenam kold ekọb inaañ enọ ammọ, enyʌñ emʌm itak ammọ ke silfa. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Ke ntondʌk inuausʌñ atayad, ammọ emaenam afọñ ikpeghe ke bru, ke iduod-iduod, ke ndad-ndad udʌk ye ke eti ufafiakka linen, utom mme adọk afọn. <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />Ndin ammọ emaenam adaaha ition ye ekọb enọ ammọ. Emaenyʌñ efʌk anyọñ eto adaaha ado ke kold, ado ekama brọns enam itak ition amọ.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s1">Akebe Edioomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Besalel amaanam akebe edioomo ke eto akasia, kubid iba ye ubaak ke unyọọñ, kubid keed ye ubaak ke ukpa, ye kubid keed ye ubaak ke ukoñ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 3 3/4 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 2 1/4 ke ukpa ye ke ukọñ me ñkpọ nte mita 1.1 ke unyọọñ ye mita 68 ke ukpa ye ke ukoñ; kpa ntoro ke Eksọdọs 37:6</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Anye amaadat ataa uyaiya eti kold afʌk ke anyọñ amọ, ke esịd ye ke edem, anyʌñ abot kold akanna anye. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Anye amaabot ikara kold inaañ anọ anye, anyʌñ akọp ammọ adian ke ukod ammọ inaañ, ye ikara iba ke ukod keed, ye iba mfen ke ukod anye ako. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Anye amaanam adaaha ke eto akasia anyʌñ akama kold afʌk ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />Ndin anye amaasịn mme adaaha ado ke ndudu ikara ke mme mbeñ akebe edioomo nọ adiiben anye.<verse eid="EXO 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Anye amaanam ufʌkñkpọ itie ñkpeubọk ado ke ataa kold, kubid iba ye ubaak ke unyọọñ ye kubid keed ye ubaak ke ukpa. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Ndin anye amaadat utetịm kold abot serubim iba ke utịd afọñ ufʌkñkpọ. <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />Anye amaanam serub keed aba ke edem keed, ye ayọhọ serub iba ke edem uko; ndin ke utịd naña iba anye amaanam ammọ edo keed ye ufʌkñkpọ. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Mme serubim emaetaara mba ammọ ewọt anyọñ, enyʌñ ekwe ammọ. Mme serubim ekesak iso ese emọ-emọ.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpokoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Ammọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Anye; se ke Eksọdọs 37:11-29</char></note> emaenam akpokoro ke eto akasia, kubid iba ke unyọọñ, kubid keed ke ukpa, ye kubid keed ye ubaak ke ukoñ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 3 ke unyọọñ, ikpad 1 1/2 ke ukpa ye ikpad 2 1/4 ke ukoñ me ñkpọ nte sentimita 90 ke unyọọñ, mita 45 ke ukpa ye sentimita 68 ke ukoñ</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Ndin ammọ emaekama ataa eti kold efʌk anye, enyʌñ ekama kold ebod ñkpọ ekanna anye. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ enam ekanna mben inua amọ ñkpọ nte ayọhọ ekpaubọk keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte sentimita 7.5</char></note> enyʌñ esịn kold e-ebọppọ ke mbad ke mben amọ. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Ammọ emaebọp ikara kold inaañ enọ akpokoro enyʌñ ekọp ammọ ke inuuk mbañ inaañ, ke itie a-mme ukod inaañ ado ekebaaha. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Emaenam mme ikara ado ekpere mben nọ amʌm eto a-akamake akpokoro akama. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Ekedat eto akasia enam mme ukod akpokoro, enyʌñ edat kold efʌk ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Ndin ammọ emaedat ataa eti kold enam mme ñkpoduoho se edot ke akpokoro, mme usan amọ ye mme ikpañ ye mme abọwịd ye mme atu se edat etọkkọ ukọd uwa.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udod Utuenikañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />Ammọ emaenam ñkpọ udod utuenikañ ke ataa eti kold. Emaetuak idak ye mbañ amọ esio edi, enyʌñ enam anye aba nte mme kọọb usịn ñkpokpoñ, mme emịne ye nseghe mfañ, afịd ke eboho keed. <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Ñkọk itiokeed emaesakka ke ñkañ keed udod utuenikañ, ita ke ñkañ keed, ita mfen ke ukañ uko. <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />Kọọb ita e-ebaaha nte ñkpokpoñ mmansañ mbakara ye mme emịne ye mme eboho ñkpokpoñ emaeba ke ñkọk keed, ita ke ñkọk mfen, ndin ukem-ukem ke afịd mme ñkọk itiokeed, etaara eto itie udod utuenikañ. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Ndin ke udod utuenikañ, iko inaañ e-ebaaha nte ñkpokpoñ mmansañ mbakara a-ayọhọke ye mme emịne ye mme eboho ñkpokpoñ emaeba. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />Emịne keed aketịppe ke idak akpa ñkọk a-atarake akesịm itie udod utuenikañ, ayọhọ emịne iba ke ayọhọ ñkọk iba, ndin ayọhọ ita ke itie ayọhọ ñkọk ita, ñkọk itiokeed ke afịd. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Mme emịne ye mme ñkọk ami ekediana itie keed ye udod utuenikañ, e-ekekamake ataa eti kold enam.<verse eid="EXO 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Ammọ emaenam utuenikañ amọ itiaba, ukem ñko ye ufadñkpọ afọñ utuenikañ ye usan ikañ ado ataa kold keed. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Ammọ emaenam mme udod utuenikañ ye afịd ñkpọ amọ eto <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 34</char></note> ataa nsọñudua eti talen kold keed.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpokoro Ufọp Insensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />Ammọ emaenam akpokoro ufọp insensi ke eto akasia. Akedo mbañ inaañ, kubid keed ke unyọọñ ye kubid keed ke ukpa ye kubid keed ke ukoñ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 1 1/2 ke unyọọñ ye ke ukpa amaana ado ikpad 3 ke ukoñ me ñkpọ nte sentimita 45 ke unyọọñ ye ke ukpa amaana ado sentimita 90 ke ukoñ</char></note> mme nnʌk ammọ edo ifre keed ye anye. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Ammọ emaefʌk abom ye afịd mme mbañ ye mme nnʌk ammọ ke eti kold, enyʌñ ekama kold ebot ñkpọ ekanna anye. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Ammọ emaenam ikara kold iba ekanna idak amọ, iba-iba ke nsakiso mbañ ammọ, adimʌm mme mboi ekekamake eben anye. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />Emaenam mme mboi ke eto akasia enyʌñ efʌk ammọ ke kold.<verse eid="EXO 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Emaenyʌñ enam adisana adan udodubọk ye inem ufịk insensi, utom atem a-pefium.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s1">Akpokoro Ufọb Uwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Ammọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Anye; se ñko ke Eksọdọs 38:2-9</char></note> emaebọp akpokoro ufọfọb uwa ke eto akasia, kubid ita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 4 1/2 me ñkpọ nte mita 1.4</char></note> ke ukoñ; akedodo mbañinaañ, ndin kubid ition ke unyọọñ ye kubid ition ke ukpa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 7 1/2 me ñkpọ nte mita 2.3</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Emaenam nnʌk ke afịd inuuk inaañ ado, nọ nnʌk ye akpokoro eba itie keed, ndin emaefʌk akpokoro ufọb uwa ke brọns. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Ammọ emaenam afịd ñkpoduoho utem ñkpọ amọ ke brọns, mme ako, mme udọk, mme bọwịd usiime mmọọñ, mme akuum ukịm unam, ye mme akpañkpañ ufraññkpọ. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Emaenam adukpọk ufʌkñkpọ enọ akpokoro uwa ke brọns, nọ aba ke ñkañ mbakka iba anyọñ akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Ammọ emaedian mme ikara brọns nọ amʌm eto adaaha ke mbañ inaañ e-ekekappa ke brọns akama. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Emaenam mme mboi ke eto akasia enyʌñ edat brọns efʌk ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />Emaesịn eto ke mme ikara ndudu ke ñkañ itie akpokoro uwa se ekama ebenne anye. Ekekama adukpọk enam anye, ndin amaatʌñọ.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Besịn Uyieubọk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Ammọ ekedat ukịdiso ibaan e-ekenamma utom ke inuaatob atayad mbono enam besịn brọns ye udodukod brọns.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esịd Akwere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Akema, ammọ emaebọp esịd akwere. Edem usuuk akedo kubid ikie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 150 me ñkpọ nte mita 45</char></note> ke unyọọñ, anyʌñ anie afọñ ikpeghe e-enamma ke eti linen e-edọkkọdọk, <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />ye mboi edịb ye brọns edịb ke idak, ye ekọb silfa ye mme idiọọñọ ke mboi amọ. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Ukan anyọñ-anyọñ akedo kubid ikie ke unyọọñ, anyʌñ anie eto mboi edịb ye brọns edịb ke idakisọñ, ndin ekọb silfa adiana ye idiọọñọ ke mboi amọ.<verse eid="EXO 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Ukañ usobutịn akedo kubid aba mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 75 me ñkpọ nte mita 23</char></note> ke ukpa, anyʌñ anie afọñ ikpeghe duob ke adaaha ye duob mfen ke idakisọñ, ye mme ekọb silfa ye mme idiọọñọ ke adaaha amọ. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Ukañ usakkautịn, akenyʌñ ado ñkpad ata mme duob ke ukpa. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14" />Afọñ ikpeghe a-akebaaha ke ukañ inuausʌñ keed akedo kubid duob mme ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 22 me ñkpọ nte mita 6.8</char></note> ke unyọọñ, ye eto adaaha ita ye ake idakisọñ ita ñko, <verse eid="EXO 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15" />ndin afọñ ikpeghe a-akedooho kubid duob mme ition ke unyọọñ akeba ke ukañ ntondʌk esịd akwere, ye eto adaaha ita ye ake idakisọñ ita. <verse eid="EXO 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Afịd mme afọñ ikpeghe se ikiba ke esịd akwere akedo ataa nti linen. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Mme idak abọbọọk usʌñ akedo ke brọns. Mme ekọb ye idiọọñọ akedo ke silfa, ndin ekedat silfa efʌk anyọñ ammọ; ndin afịd mme abọbọọk usʌñ e-ebaaha ke esịd akwere emaenie idiọọñọ silfa.<verse eid="EXO 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Ekenam afọñ ikpeghe ntondʌk esịd tabanakịd ke bru, iduod-iduod, ndad-ndad udʌk ye eti linen, utom a-adọk afọñ anamma. Akedo kubid edịb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 30 me ñkpọ nte mita 9</char></note> ke unyọọñ, ndin kpa nte afọñ ikpeghe esịd akwere, ado kubid ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 7 1/2 me ñkpọ nte mita 2.3</char></note> ke ukoñ, <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />ye eto idaha inaañ ye brọns inaañ ke idakisọñ, ndin emaedat silfa efʌk anyọñ ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Afịd mme mboi atayad itie tabanakịd ye mme ñkanñkʌk esịd akwere ekedo ke brọns.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ñkpọ Unam Utom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />Mme ibad ñkpọutom se ekedat ebọp itieukpono mbed edioomo edo ami, kpa naña mme Lifai ekewet, akeene naña Moses aketemme ato ke ndadusʌñ Itama, ayịn Erọn, a-akedooho aku. <verse eid="EXO 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />(Besalel ayịn Uri, ayịn Hur, a-aketooho ubon Yuda, akenam afịd ñkpọ naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses. <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />Awo a-akebaaha ye anye akedo Oholiab, ayịn Ahisamak, a-aketooho ubon Daan, awo utomusọ, a-akekanna atuak afọñ ke bru, ke iduod-iduod, ke ndad-ndad udʌk, ye ke eti linen.) <verse eid="EXO 38:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Afịd ekọmudua a-kold ufọfʌñ uwa se ekedat enam utom ke adisana itie akedo talen edịb mme usʌkkeed ye sekel 730,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Udob kold ado amaadoppo etək akan ñkpọ nte tọọn keed me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn keed</char></note> naña ndutʌm adisana itie sekel atemme.<verse eid="EXO 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Silfa se ekebọọ eto mbon e-ekebatta ke ini ubadawo akedo talen ikie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte tọọn 3 3/4 me metrịk tọọn 3.4 se ñko ke Eksọdọs 38:27</char></note> ye sekel 1,775,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 20; se ñko ke Eksọdọs 38:28</char></note> naña ndutʌm adisana itieukpono sekel aketañ, <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />beka keed anie awo keed, a-adooho mbaak sekel keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 5.7</char></note>, akeene udomo sekel adisana itie, tọọñọ ke afịd mbon se ikisaña iboiyo tutu akesịm mbon se ekebat, e-ekedooho isua edịb me awakka akan ado, ekedo ideen (603,550). <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Talen silfa ikie ke ekedat enam idakisọñ adisana itie, ndin afọñ ikpeghe akedo ikie ke atu talen ikie ami, talen keed anie itie keed. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Ekekama sekel tọsịn keed mme ikie itiaba mme ata mme duob mme ition (1,775) enam ekọb enọ mme adaaha, adidoot mme anyọñ ammọ, adinyʌñ nnam idiọọñọ ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Mme brọns a-aketooho ufọfʌñ uwa akedo talen ata mme duob (70), ye sekel tọsịn iba mme ikie inaañ (2,400).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Udob brọns akedo ñkpọ nte tọọn 2 1/2 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 2,4</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Ammọ ekekama anye enam idak itie ntondʌk inuaatob atayad mbono, akpokoro uwa brọns ye brọns amọ adiana ye afịd mme ñkpoduoho amọ, <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />idak itie ñkanñkʌk esịd akwere ye mbon itie inuausʌñ, ye afịd mboi atayad ye ake mme ñkanñkʌk esịd tabanakịd.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s1">Afọñ Mme Aku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Ekekama bru afọñ, iduod-iduod, ye ndad-ndad udʌk enam mme udọdọk afọñ enọ mme aku nọ ekama enam utom ammọ ke adisana itie. Ammọ emaenyʌñ enam ndisana afọñ enọ Erọn, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="EXO 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afọñ Aboditọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Ammọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Anye; se ñko ke Eksọdọs 39:7, 8, 22</char></note> emaenam afọñ aboditọñ ke kold, ye ke bru, ye ke iduod-iduod, ye ke ndad-ndad udʌk ye ke eti linen. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Emaemia tian kold enyʌñ ekpịkke mboi ekama enam bru, iduod-iduod ye ndad-ndad udʌk ye eti linen, utom mme anam mfọọn ubọkutom. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Ammọ emaenam mme afọñ afara enọ efọd, e-ekeyịtte ke inuuk amọ iba, nọ amʌm akọp adian. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Mfọọn udọdọk mbọbọisịn akenyʌñ aba ntoro, ukem ye afọñ aboditọñ e-ekenama ke kold, adiana ye bru afọñ, ye iduod-iduod ye ndad-ndad udʌk, ye eti linen, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="EXO 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />Ammọ emaedot itiad ọniks ke udodñkpọ a-abaaha nte kold, enyʌñ ekap ammọ nte ufiikñkpọ ye mme anyịñ nditọ ideen Isrel. <verse eid="EXO 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Ndin ammọ emaefaak ammọ ke mbañ afara itie afọñ aboditọñ nte itiad ñkpọ aditoiyo anọ nditọ Isrel, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="EXO 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Afọñ Ikpanesịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />Ammọ emaenam afọñ ikpanesịd, utom eti abodñkpọ. Emaenam anye aba nte afọñ aboditọñ, ke kold, ye bru, ye iduod-iduod, ye ndad-ndad udʌk, ye eti uwawañ linen. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Akedo mbañinaañ, span<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte sentimita 23</char></note> keed ke unyọọñ ye span keed ke ukpa, emaenyʌñ ekpañ anye ndodiba. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Akema, ammọ emaenam udịm inaañ ye nsọñudua itiad edot. Akpa udịm akedo kanelian, krisolaid ye beril; <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />ayọhọ udịm iba akedo nsọñudua itiad tọkwọis, lapis lasuli ye emeraal; <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />ayọhọ udịm ita akedo yasịn, akate ye ametis; <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />ayọhọ udịm inaañ akedo topas, ọniks ye yaspa. Emaedot ammọ ke ñkpọ idaha kold. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Itiad duob mme iba ekeba, mme itiad keedekeed ekeda enọ mme anyịñ nditọ ideen Isrel, enyʌñ ekap ammọ keedekeed nte ufiikñkpọ ye anyịñ keed ke atu mme esiin duob mme iba ami.<verse eid="EXO 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Ke abaña afọñ ikpanesịd, ammọ emaenam ukwak edọkkọdọk ke ataa eti kold, ndin aba nte udʌk. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Ammọ emaenam ñkpọ idaha iba ke kold ye ikara iba ke kold, enyʌñ ekọp ikara iba ado ke inuuk afọñ ikpanesịd iba. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />Emaekọp ukwak kold iba ado ke mme ikara ke inuuk afọñ ikpanesịd ado, <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />ndin eyịt utịd ukwak ñkañ uko edian ke abai iba, etobo ammọ edian ke afara ye afọñ aboditọñ ke iso. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Ammọ emaenam ikara kold iba ekọp ke inuuk itie afọñ ikpanesịd ke ukañ a-akpereke afọñ aboditọñ. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Ndin ammọ emaenam ikara kold iba mfen eyịt ke idak afara ke iso afọñ aboditọñ, a-akpereke itie e-etoboke udʌk ke anyọñ mbọbọisịn afọñ aboditọñ. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Emaetobo mme ikara afọñ ikpanesịd edian ye ikara afọñ aboditọñ ke bru udʌk, edat ekesịm isịn mbaak afọñ ikpanesịd adifakka awuọ ke afọñ aboditọñ, ukem naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Afọñ Aku Mfen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Ammọ emaenam afọñ aboditọñ ado bru afịd-afịd, utom mme adọk afọñ, <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />anie ndudu ke ufọọd nte ndudu akpọnọ itọñ afọñ, ye ñkpaha a-akannake itie ndudu ado, mbaak adiwakka. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Ammọ emaenam mme kpomekrened ke bru, iduod-iduod, ndad-ndad udʌk ye eti linen ke mben afọñ. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Ndin ammọ emaenam mme ñkanika ke ataa eti kold, enyʌñ eyiit ammọ ekanna mben afọñ ke ufañ mme kpomekrened ado. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Mme ñkanika ye mme kpomekrened ado emaeduwuaha ekanna mben afọñ a-mme aku esịneke enam utom, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="EXO 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />Ammọ emaenam mme tunik ke eti linen enọ Erọn ye nditọ amọ ideen, utom mme adọk afọñ, <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" />ye afọñiwuod ke eti linen, mme itam linen ye mme afọñ idakidem ke ataa eti utuatuak linen. <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />Ekenam udʌkisịn ke ataa eti linen ye bru afọñ, ye iduod-iduod ye ndad-ndad udʌk, akedo utom mme adọk afọñ naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="EXO 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Ammọ emaedat ataa eti kold ebana anyanya, nte adisana idiọọñọ, enyʌñ ekap ke esịd nte ufiikñkpọ ete:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="EXO 39:30">
    <char style="sc">ADO Adisana Anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></char><verse eid="EXO 39:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Ndin ammọ emaetobo bru ekpək ke anye, enyʌñ eben ekeyịt ke tọban, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moses Akese Tabanakịd Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Ndin emaekweeñe afịd utom ke itieukpono ye atayad mbono. Nditọ Isrel emaenam afịd ñkpọ naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />Ndin ammọ emaeben tabanakịd esọk Moses:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 39:33" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 39:33">Atayad ye afịd mme ñkpọ mbanaidem amọ, mme ekọb, mme mboi, mme abọbọọk usʌñ abai ye idakisọñ;<verse eid="EXO 39:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />mme ufʌkñkpọ ided akukịmedọñ, e-enamma akappa ndad-ndad, ye ufʌkñkpọ eti uduud ikpa mfen ye afọñ ikpeghe a-afʌkkọ ifed;<verse eid="EXO 39:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />ye akebe edioomo mbed enwọñọ ye mme eto idaha ye ufʌkñkpọ ñkpeubọk;<verse eid="EXO 39:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />akpokoro ye afịd mme ñkpoduoho amọ ye Uyo Iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;<verse eid="EXO 39:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />ye ataa eti udod utuenikañ a-kold ye mme udịm ikañ ye afịd mme ñkpoduoho amọ, ye adan ikañ ọlif;<verse eid="EXO 39:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />akpokoro kold, adan udod ubọk, inem ufịk insensi, ye afọñ ikpeghe ke inuaatob itie atayad;<verse eid="EXO 39:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />akpokoro uwa brọns ye ikpeghe brọns amọ, mme abai ye afịd ñkpoduoho amọ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 39:39">besịn ye ñkpọidaha amọ;<verse eid="EXO 39:39" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />mme afọñ ikpeghe esịd akwere ye mme abai ye idakisọñ, ye afọñ ntondʌk esịd akwere;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 39:40">mme udọk ye mme mboi atayad ake esịd akwere;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 39:40">afịd mme ñkpọ mbanaidem tabanakịd, ake itie atayad mbono;<verse eid="EXO 39:40" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />ye mme utuatuak afọñ e-esịneke enam utom ke itieukpono, ndisana afọñ aku Erọn ye mme afọñ nditọ amọ ideen ke ini e-enamma uwa nte mme aku.<verse eid="EXO 39:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Nditọ Isrel emaenam afịd ñkpọ naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Moses amaakese afịd utom, anyʌñ akịt ke e-enam anye naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme. Ndin Moses amaadiọñ ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s1">Adibono Ñkpọ ke Tabanakịd Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />Akema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate: <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />“Beeñe itie tabanakịd, atayad mbono, ke akpa usen ke akpa afiọñ. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />Sịn akebe edioomo mbed enwọñọ ke esịd ammọ, nyʌñ fʌk akebe edioomo ke afọñ ikpeghe. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />Ben akpokoro dinịm, nyʌñ koono afịd se isaña ye anye doot. Ndin ben udod utuenikañ di nyʌñ koono mme utuenikañ doot. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />Dot kold akpokoro uwa insensi ke iso akebe edioomo enwọñọ, nyʌñ sịn afọñ ikpeghe ke ntondʌk tabanakịd.<verse eid="EXO 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />“Nịm akpokoro ufọfọb uwa ke iso ntondʌk itie tabanakịd, atayad mbono; <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />dot besịn ke ufọọd itie atayad mbono ye akpokoro uwa, nyʌñ sịn mmọọñ ke esịd. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />Nam akwere kanna anye nyʌñ sịn afọñ ikpeghe ke ntondʌk esịd akwere.<verse eid="EXO 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />“Ben adan adidiọñ diọñ tabanakịd ye afịd ñkpọ se isịne ke esịd; diọñ anye ye afịd ñkpọ mbanaidem amọ, ndin ayaado adisana. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />Ndin diọñ akpokoro ufọfọb uwa ye afịd ñkpoduoho amọ; diọñ akpokoro uwa, ndin anye ayaado adisana. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />Diọñ besịn ado ye ukod amọ, nyʌñ yet ammọ adan nam esana.<verse eid="EXO 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />“Ben Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ di ntondʌk atayad mbono, nyʌñ yet ammọ idem ke mmọọñ. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Ndin sịn Erọn adisana afọñ, yet anye adan, nyʌñ diọñ anye nọ anye adot adinam ñkpọ innọọ miin nte aku. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />Ben nditọ ideen amọ di, nyʌñ sịn ammọ tunik. <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />Yet ammọ adan naña akeyet ete ammọ, nọ ammọ enam ñkpọ ennọ miin nte mme aku. Adidiọñ ammọ ayaanam ammọ edo ubon mme aku ke afịd emana.” <verse eid="EXO 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Moses amaanam afịd ñkpọ naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye.<verse eid="EXO 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Ndin emaebono ñkpọ ke tabanakịd ke akpa usen ke akpa afiọñ ke ayọhọ isua iba. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Ke ini Moses amaakebono ñkpọ tabanakịd ama, anye amaanịm mme itiad idakisọñ amọ ke itie, awuuk mme mboi, adoot mme abọbọọk, anyʌñ adoot mme abai. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Ndin anye amaatat atayad afʌk tabanakịd, anyʌñ adot ufʌkñkpọ ke atayad, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye.<verse eid="EXO 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Anye amaaben mme itiadñwed mbed edioomo asịn ke akebe edioomo, abọp eto abai adian ke akebe edioomo, anyʌñ asịn ufʌkñkpọ ñkpeubọk ke esịd. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Ndin anye amaaben akebe edioomo adot ke tabanakịd, anyʌñ ayịt afọñ ikpeghe, ndin afʌk akebe edioomo mbed, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="EXO 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Moses amaadot akpokoro ke atayad mbono ke anyọñ-anyọñ itieukpono ke edem afọñ ikpeghe, <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />amaanyʌñ anịm uyo ke anyọñ ado ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye.<verse eid="EXO 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Anye amaadot udod utuenikañ ke atayad mbono ke nsakiso akpokoro ke ukañ usuuk-usuuk itieukpono, <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />amaanyʌñ adot ikañ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye.<verse eid="EXO 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Moses amaadot akpokoro uwa a-kold ke atayad mbono ke iso afọñ ikpeghe; <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />amaanyʌñ afọp inem ufịk insensi do, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye.<verse eid="EXO 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Ndin Moses amaayịt afọñ ikpeghe ke ntondʌk itieukpono. <verse eid="EXO 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />Anye amaabọp akpokoro itie ufọfọb uwa akpere inuausʌñ tabanakịd, atayad mbono, amaanyʌñ anam ufọfọb uwa ye uwa mfịd, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye.<verse eid="EXO 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Anye amaadot besịn ke ufọọd atayad mbono ye akpokoro uwa, anyʌñ asịn mmọọñ uyieidem ke esịd, <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />ndin Moses ye Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ emaekama mmọọñ ado eyie ubọk ye ukod ammọ. <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />Ammọ emaesiyie ini akeedodo a-ammọ ekedʌkkọ atayad mbono me esañake ekpere akpokoro uwa, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="EXO 40:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Ndin Moses amaabọp esịd akwere akanna tabanakịd ye akpokoro uwa, anyʌñ ayịd afọñ ikpeghe ke ntondʌk itie esịd akwere. Ndin Moses amaakweeñe utom ado.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubọọñ Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Akema, ntọñanyọñ amaafʌk atayad mbono, ndin ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayọhọ tabanakịd. <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Moses ikikanna idʌk atayad mbono, sia ntọñanyọñ amaadoro ke anye, ndin ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayọhọ tabanakịd.<verse eid="EXO 40:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />Ke afịd isañ nditọ Isrel, ini akeedodo a-ntọñanyọñ akefʌkkọke ke anyọñ itie tabanakịd, ammọ eyaewuọñọ; <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />ado adieke ntọñanyọñ imiikifʌkkọke, ammọ ikiwuọhọ, tutu akem usen a-anye akefʌkkọke. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />Ndin ntọñanyọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaafʌk tabanakịd ke uweemeayio, ndin ikañ amaaba ke akonayio, ke anyen afịd nditọ Isrel ke afịd mme isañ ammọ.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>